<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUKA NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="mt4">NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="ip">Né Luka te dɔktaniɛ, (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref> </char>) na né ɔbokka asomafoɛ 12 naso. Ɔne Paul yeɛ bɛtutuli atee wɔ ye nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo nanu ɔ. Wanga kyɛ ɔfale ye nye nwuni nningyein bɔ ɔhɔle so ne; ye nzɛmba ne ahyɛaseɛ nala, ɔhane kyɛ, ɔyɛle edwirɛ nanwo nhwehwɛmuɛ. Ye ala yeɛ ɔhworɔle Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne. Ɔhworɔle Luka ne Asomafoɛ Nyumaa namukoraati mane Teofilus. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luk 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:1">Aso 1:1</ref> </char>) Teofilus de, yɛnze ye nwo dwirɛ biala. Luka hworɔle ye nzɛmba ne kɔyɛ afoɛ 56-58 Y.A,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> sɔ mmerɛ ne né ɔwɔ Kaesarea. Ye nzɛmba ne ka nningyein bɔ ɔhɔle so kora yeɛ bɛbaanwonzɛ Yohane ne Yesu wɔ afoɛ 3 K.Y.B<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K.Y.B kyire Kora yeɛ Yesu Ba Ɔ (Brɔfo: Before Common Era anaa B.C.E)</char></note> kosi Yesu tingyelɛ ne ye anwuro hɔlɛ wɔ afoɛ 33 Y.A. — <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ip">Luka nzɛmba ne de, ɔhworɔ mane Yudafoɛ ne maen-maen nufoɛ mukoraati. Nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ Luka nwomaa nanu namukoraati sisili wɔ Palestina mandanu berɛ, ofi Kaesare Filipi ɔkwaasi Bɛsheba. Sɔ mmerɛ namukoraati, né Roman maen ne yeɛ odi ɛberɛ mɔ so ɔ. Yesu aworɛ yeɛ ɔfa hyɛle yebo ɔ, sɔ mmerɛ ne, Herode yeɛ ne Romanfoɛ ne aye ye kyɛ amrado wɔ Yudea ɔ. Na Yesu wue, ye tingyelɛ, ne mmerɛ bɔ ɔhɔle anwuro ne yeɛ ɔfa pɛle yebo ɔ; sɔ mmerɛ ne koso, Pontio Pilato, Antipa ne Filipo yeɛ né bɛte amrado ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka dwirɛ ne biemɔ wɔ berɛ a, ɛkora nwu ye kyɛ, Yesu maame Mary yeɛ ɔha hyire ye ɔ. Bɔ ɔmaa yɛnwu ye sɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ne ɔtaa ka kyɛ, “Na ye maame fale edwirɛ he amukoraati siele ye ti anu.”— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 2:19">Luk 2:19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 2:51">51</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ip">Luka nzɛmba ne te sorongo koraa, ofikyɛ nningyein biemɔ wɔ berɛ a, ye ngome yeɛ ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ. Sɔ nningyein ne bie yeɛ oli so ne.</para>
  <para style="is2">Yesu nwo dwirɛ biemɔ</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Luka yeɛ ɔhane abɔfo bɔ bɛyele bɛ nwo ali bɛhyirele bɛ bɔ bɛnea mmoan nanwo dwirɛ ɔ— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 2:8-19">Luk 2:8-19</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Afei osa hane Yesu ngwalaa nu dwirɛ, ɔne mmerɛ bɔ ominini wɔ Yerusalem ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 2:41-50">Luk 2:41-50</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="is2">Yesu nzɛngyerɛneɛ biemɔ</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu nzɛngyerɛneɛ kɔyɛ kyɛ nnu de, Luka ngome yeɛ ɔhworɔle ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ; ebie ole:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Egyein pembe bɔ Yesu maa Petro mɔ hyele ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kunaniɛ n'awa bɔ otingyele ye wɔ Nain ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:11-17">Luk 7:11-17</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Maame bɔ yenu akondo bɔ ɔsale ye anwonyerɛ Homeda ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 13:10-17">Luk 13:10-17</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Biaa bɔ ne wanwu-nwu ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 14:1-6">Luk 14:1-6</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kwatafoɛ buru bɔ ɔsale bɛ anwonyerɛ ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 17:11-19">Luk 17:11-19</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="is2">Yesu mvandoho biemɔ</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu yɛle bɔne-fakyɛ, mbaebɔ, anwunvoin, ne Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo mvandoho pee, enu biemɔ wɔ berɛ a, Luka nzɛmba ne ngome yeɛ ɔka ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ; Sɔ mvandoho ne bie ole:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Mmenia nyɔ bɔ ne bɛma kerɛ ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:41-43">Luk 7:41-43</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Samarianiɛ bɔ ɔbokale biaa bɔ awiefoɛ bole ye ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:30-37">Luk 10:30-37</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Biaa bɔ ɔhɔle ye damvo berɛ kɔngɔen ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 11:5-8">Luk 11:5-8</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Sikaniɛ bɔ ɔnze nworɛ ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:16-21">Luk 12:16-21</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Boan ne drakma bɔ ominini ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-10">Luk 15:1-10</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Baa hohwiniɛ ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 15:11-32">Luk 15:11-32</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Lazarus ne sikaniɛ ne mvandoho ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 16:19-31">Luk 16:19-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kunaniɛ bɔ ne ɔha temmufoɛ ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 18:1-8">Luk 18:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Farisiniɛ ne biaa bɔ odidɛ toɔ ne mbaeɛ ne— <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 18:9-14">Luk 18:9-14</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Luka nzɛmba ne ka mmrasua nwo dwirɛ paa, na ɔmaa yɛnwu ye kyɛ mbaeɛ nwo hia. Osa maa yɛnwu kyɛbɔ nningyein hɔle so wɔ Yesu asetena nu ne nnidisoɛ-nnidisoɛ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu aworɛ, ye ngwalaa nu, ye asubɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5–2:52</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohane asɛnka adwuma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu asubɔ; Abɔnzam sɔle ye neane (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21–4:13</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu asɛnka adwuma wɔ Galilea (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14–9:50</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ Galilea tonn oodwuli Yerusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51–19:27</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nningyein bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ Yerusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28–23:56</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu tingyele, ɔyele ye nwo ali, ɔhɔle anwuro (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mmeni pee abɔ mmɔden kyɛ bɛkɔhworɔ nahorɛ bɔ yalɛ́ yato nu ne, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />kyɛbɔ ofi ahyɛaseɛ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛfale bɛ nye bɛnwuni bɔ ɔhɔle so, ɔne bɛ bɔ né bɛte edwirɛ nanwo asomvoɛ ne fa mane yɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Yeti, Onuoyamfoɛ Teofilus, me koso, sɔ ala yeɛ mayɛ m'adwene ɔ. Na mato me bo ase maneɛnea nikye biala nu pɛpɛɛpɛ fi ahyɛaseɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ngɔhworɔ edwirɛ ne nnidisoɛ-nnidisoɛ ngɔberɛ wɔ, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />ná wamaa anwu nahorɛ bɔ ɔwɔ edwirɛ bɔ baha bahyire wɔ namukoraati nu.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Yudea hene Herode ngyẽa nanu ne, né sɔfo bie wɔ berɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Zakaria. Né ɔboka sɔfo kue bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Abia naso. Né ɔye te Aaron mmaa nanu kõ, na ne bɛfrɛ ye Elizabɛt. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bɛ munyɔ namukoraati, né bɛtengyɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu, na Awurade mmeraa ne ye ahyɛdeɛ koso, né bɛdi ye mukoraati so pɛpɛɛpɛ bɔ edwirɛ biala nne bɛ nwo. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Nakoso né bɛlle baa biala, ofikyɛ ne Elizabɛt ngora wo, na bɛ munyɔ namu, né banyi paa.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Mmerɛ bɔ odwuli ye sɔfo kue naso ne, né ɔyɛ ye sɔfo adwuma wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Na kyɛbɔ asɔfodie nwo nhyehyɛɛ ne te ne, ye yeɛ ne wadwu ye so kyɛ ɔkɔ Awurade nekaa krongron berɛ kɔyera insɛns ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Na mmerɛ bɔ ɔyera insɛns ne, né mmeni lɔen namukoraati wɔ aluo dɔ bɛbɔ mbaeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Na Awurade abɔfo yele ye nwo ali hyirele ye, né abɔfo ne gyi afɔleɛ bokyea bɔ bɛyera insɛns wɔ so ne famaa so. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Mmerɛ bɔ Zakaria nwuni ye ne, ye kunu tele ye, na esuronyi hane ye.<verse eid="LUK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Nakoso abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Zakaria, nnɛsuro! Nyameɛ ate wɔ mbaeɛ ne, na ɛye Elizabɛt kɔwo baa brienzua, na odikyɛ ɛto ye dumaa Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Wɔ nye kɔgye, na ɛkoli ahurusi, na ye aworɛ ne kɔmaa mmeni pee koli ahurusi, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />ofikyɛ ɔkɔyɛ sona titire wɔ Awurade nye so. Nakoso nnɛmaa ɔno nzãa bɔ enu yɛ se anaa nzãa bɔ ɔbo biala. Na honhom krongron kɔwa ye so, mmerɛ po bɔ owura ye maame kunu ne. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Na ɔkɔmaa Israel mmaa nanu pee kosa kɔwa Awurade, bɛ Nyameɛ ne berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Na ɔkɔfa Elia honhom ne ye tumi koli Nyameɛ nyunu, na wakakyi baba mɔ ahone wawa bɛ mmaa mɔ nwo, ná asoserɛfoɛ awa teneneefoɛ nyanza nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, okosiesie mmenia bie kɔma Awurade.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Yeɛ Zakaria bisale abɔfo ne kyɛ: “Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né malɛ ɛhe mali? Ofikyɛ mayɛ aworowaa, na me ye koso anyi paa.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Na abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me yeɛ nne Gabriel bɔ ogyi Nyameɛ nyunu ne, na basoma me kyɛ mene wɔ dwudwo, na nga edwirɛ pa he ngyire wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Na ɔnate kyɛ anne me dwirɛ bɔ ɔkɔwa nu wɔ ye mmerɛ nu ne anni nati, wɔ noa komua, na ɛngɔhora dwudwo tonn kodwu kyẽa bɔ ɛhemɔ mukoraati kɔwa nu ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Sɔ mmerɛ namukoraati, ne mmenia ne nwondɛ Zakaria, na ne ɔyɛ bɛ nwanwa kyɛ wahyɛ krongron nu krongron berɛ sɔ ne. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Mmerɛ bɔ ofitele ne, wangora dwudwo kyire bɛ, na bɛnwuni ye kyɛ, wanwu nikye bie wɔ nekaa krongron berɛ. Ɔfale ye sa yɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ hyirele bɛ, nakoso wangora dwudwo. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ngyẽa bɔ ɔfa yɛ ye adwuma krongron ne wale awieɛ ne, ɔhɔle ye awuro.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ngyẽa biemɔ si ne, ɔye Elizabɛt nwonzɛle, ɔfale ye nwo siele bosome nzia, na ɔhane kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Bɔ Awurade ayɛ ama me wɔ sɔ ngyẽa he anu ɛne. Wafa ye adwene wawa me so, na waye m'animguaseɛ wafi berɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ye bosome nzia nanu ne, Nyameɛ somane abɔfo Gabriel hɔle Galilea kuro bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Nazerɛt nu, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ɔsomane ye wɔ ababunu bie berɛ. Né bahyɛ Yosef bɔ ofi David abusua nu ne bɔ kyɛ, bɛkɔmaa okogya sɔ ababunu ne, né ababunu ne dumaa li Mary. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Abɔfo ne wurale awuro berɛ ne, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ bɔ balo wɔ, mekyea wɔ, Awurade boka wɔ so.” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Nakoso abɔfo ne dwirɛ ne maa ɔyɛle basaa, na ne ɔpena kyɛ onwu bɔ sɔ ngyeaa ne kyire ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Yeti abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mary, nnɛsuro, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ alo wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Nea, ɛkɔnwonzɛ kɔwo baa brienzua, na odikyɛ ɛto ye dumaa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ɔkɔyɛ sona titire, na bɛkɔfrɛ ye Anwuro-Anwuroniɛ né awa. Na Awurade Nyameɛ kɔfa ye baba David bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia.”</char></note> kɔma ye, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />na okoli Yakob awuro so Hene afebɔɔ, na ye ahennie ne ngɔwa awieɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Nakoso Mary bisale abɔfo ne kyɛ: “Mene brienzua lalle lle, ye de ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ɛhe ayɛ yé?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Yeɛ abɔfo ne yele ye noa kyɛ: “Honhom krongron kɔwa wɔ so, na Anwuro-Anwuroniɛ ne tumi kɔbutu wɔ so. Ɛhene ati, bɔ ɛkɔwo ye ne, bɛkɔfrɛ ye krongron, Nyameɛ Awa. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Na tie, w'abusuaniɛ Elizabɛt bɔ wayɛ aworowaa ne, wanwonzɛ; ye bɔ ne bɛnwa ɔte bonini ne, ɔnwonzɛle ne, bosome nzia ɛhe; <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />ofikyɛ Nyameɛ de, nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔngora ye yɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Yeɛ Mary hane kyɛ: “Nea, nde Awurade abaawa! Ɔyɛ berɛ ma me, kyɛbɔ wɔ dwirɛ ne te ne.” Na abɔfo ne fili berɛ hɔle.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Yeti sɔ ngyẽa nanu ne, Mary sili nu, na ɔyɛle ndɛ hɔle maen bɔ ɔwɔ mmokaa so nanu, ɔhɔle Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />na ɔhɔle Zakaria awuro, yeɛ ɔhyeale Elizabɛt. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Mmerɛ bɔ Elizabɛt tele Mary ngyeaa ne, akwalaa bɔ owura ye kunu ne huruli, na honhom krongron wale Elizabɛt so, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />na ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Bahyira wɔ batra mmrasua mukoraati, na bahyira akwalaa bɔ owura wɔ kunu ne! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ɔwale ye sɛɛ yeɛ manya ye nwo atee kandinga sɔa, kyɛ me Wura maame baanea me boso ne? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Ofikyɛ ndele wɔ ngyeaa nala pɛ, akwalaa bɔ owura me kunu ne fale anigye huruli. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Na anigye yeɛ ole brasua bɔ ole gyidie kyɛ, edwirɛ bɔ Awurade amaa baha bahyire ye namukoraati kɔwa nu ne.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Yeɛ Mary hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Me kra, kamvo Awurade<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />na me honhom di ahurusi wɔ m'Agyenkwa Nyameɛ nwo,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />ofikyɛ, wapɛ ye nye waanea ye afaneɛ bɔ ɔtte sona bie ne.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Nea, ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, mmenia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ.”</char></note> mukoraati kɔha kyɛ nne anigye,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />ofikyɛ, Otumvoɛ ne ayɛ nikye piri paa ama me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">na krongron yeɛ ole ye dumaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Na ofi aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ so bɔ ɔkɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ so ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">bɛ bɔ bɛsuro ye ne yeɛ onwu bɛ anwunvo ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wafa ye sa wayɛ nningyein mbiri-mbiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">bɛ bɔ bɛte dwɛɛ wɔ b'ahone nu ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">wabɔ bɛ wapete.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Watu atumvoɛ wafi bɛ bia so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">na wama bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ anwunvo naso;<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />bɛ bɔ ɛhɔen ku bɛ ne, wama bɛ nningyein pa maa bɛ ko ayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">na wamaa asikafoɛ afa bɛ sa nzaa-nzaa ahɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Waaboka ye akoaa Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">na wakaye ye anwunvoin ne,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />kyɛbɔ ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ hyirele yɛ nana mɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">kyɛ okonwu Abraham ne ye bosofoɛ anwunvoin daa ne.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mary lili kɔyɛ bosome nza wɔ Elizabɛt nwo berɛ, na yesi ne, ɔhɔle ye awuro.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Elizabɛt aworɛ dwuli, na ɔwole baa brienzua. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Na ye mandanu berɛfoɛ ne ye abusuafoɛ tele kyɛ Awurade anwu ye anwunvo paa, na bɛne ye lili ahurusi. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so mmɔtwɛ ne, bɛwale kyɛ bɛbaapɛ akwalaa ne toa. Na ne bɛpena kyɛ bɛfa ye bɛto ye baba Zakaria, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />nakoso ye maame ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Daabi! Bɛkɔfrɛ ye Yohane.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Yeɛ bɛ koso bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “W'abusuaniɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ oli sɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Yeti, bɛyɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɛbisale ye baba dumaa bɔ ɔpena kyɛ bɛfa bɛto akwalaa ne. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Na ɔhane kyɛ bɛma ye nikye bɔ bɛtworɔ so, na ɔhworɔle kyɛ: “Ye dumaa li Yohane.” Na ɔyɛle bɛ mukoraati nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Na ɛberɛ ala ye noa ne bukyele, na ye temverema ne sangyele maa odwudwole, na ɔyele Nyameɛ ayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Na esuronyi tɔle bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ mandanu berɛ namukoraati so, na bɛhane ɛhe anwo dwirɛ wɔ Yudea nguro bɔ ɔwɔ mmokaa naso namukoraati nu. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛtele namukoraati bisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nzu po yeɛ akwalaa he kɔyɛ ye kyẽabie ɔ?” Ofikyɛ né nikye biala kyire kyɛ Awurade sa wɔ ye so.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Na honhom krongron wale ye baba Zakaria so, na ɔhyɛle ngɔm kyɛ:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Ayɛyie ha Awurade, Israel Nyameɛ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">ofikyɛ wapɛ ye nye waanea ye mmenia, na walɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Wama awɛen bɔ odɛ́ ngoa so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">wɔ ye akoaa David awuro wama yɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />kyɛbɔ ɔnate ye adiifoɛ krongron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">bɔ bɛtenane ase tete naso hane ye kyɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />okole yɛ kofi y'atamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛtane yɛ namukoraati sa nu,<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />na wanwu yɛ baba mɔ anwunvoin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">na wakaye ye apam krongron ne,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />ndaen bɔ ɔtale yɛ baba Abraham</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73">kyɛ <verse eid="LUK 1:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />sɛ odɛ́ yɛ fi y'atamfo mɔ sa nu yie a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">yekonya atee yɛkɔsõ ye bɔ yɛngɔsuro,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />na yɛkɔsõ ye wɔ nahorɛ ne tenenee nu wɔ ye nyunu daa.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Na wɔ akwalaa he, bɛkɔfrɛ wɔ Anwuro-Anwuroniɛ ne diifoɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ofikyɛ ɛkoli Awurade nyunu koosiesie ye atee,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />na amaa ye mmenia anya nimdeɛ kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ɔkɔfa bɛ bɔne kɔhyɛ bɛ, na walɛ bɛ ngoa,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />ɔnate yɛ Nyameɛ anwunvoin ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">Sɔ anwunvoin he ati, eyia fi anwuro afite yɛ so,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />na wamaa bɛ bɔ bɛte awosii nu, ɔne nekaa bɔ ewue wawoɛ la né anya kanea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">na wali yɛ nyunu wahɔ asomdwie atee so.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Na akwalaa ne nyini, na ɔyɛle se wɔ honhom nu; na ɔtenane ɛserɛ so tonn oodwuli mmerɛ bɔ ɔyele ye nwo ali pefee hyirele Israel ne.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ne, Kaesare Augusto hyɛle mmeraa kyɛ, bɛhworɔ mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ wiase mukoraati né dumaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ɛhe yeɛ ole mmerɛ bɔ oli moa bɔ bɛhworɔle dumaa, mmerɛ bɔ ne Kirinio te amrado wɔ Siria ne. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Yeti, ebiala hɔle ye kuro kyɛ ɔkwaahworɔ ye dumaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Na Yosef koso, ɔnate kyɛ ofi David awuro ne ye abusua nu nati, ofili Nazerɛt bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne, na osili nu hɔle David kuro Betlehem bɔ ɔwɔ Yudea ne. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ɔhɔle kyɛ ɔkwaahworɔ ɔne Mary bɔ bafa ye bama ye kyɛ ogya ye ne dumaa, sɔ mmerɛ ne, né waha kaa maa Mary wo.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Bɛdwuli berɛ ne, aworɛ hane Mary. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Na ɔwole brienzua, ɔwa panyi, na ɔfale ɛtena kyekyele ye nwo, yeɛ ɔfale ye tole alaka bɔ ngaka didi nu nanu, ofikyɛ bannya nekaa wɔ ɛwɔfoɛ sua nemɔ nu.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Sɔ kɔngɔen ne, né mmenia biemɔ wɔ porɛ nanu berɛ, bɔ ne bɛnea bɛ mmoan wɔ ɛserɛ so. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Na komapɛ, Awurade bɔfo yele ye nwo ali hyirele bɛ, na Awurade anuonyam pɛle bɛ nwo yiale, na esuronyi hane bɛ paa. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Yeɛ abɔfo ne ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ suro! Ɛmɔnea, edwirɛ pa yeɛ mefa mebrɛ ɛmɔ ɔ, sɔ dwirɛ ne kɔmaa mmenia mukoraati nye kɔgye paa. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ɛnɛ kyẽa ye, bawo agyenkwa bɔ yeɛ ole Awurade Kristo ne bama ɛmɔ wɔ David kuro. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na ɛhe yeɛ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu ye ɔ: Ɛmɔ konwu adɔma bɔ bafa ɛtena bakyekye ye nwo, kyɛ ɔla alaka bɔ ngaka didi nu nanu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ɛberɛ ala, abɔfo pee bɛɛbokale abɔfo naso, na bɛyele Nyameɛ ayɛ kyɛ:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Anuonyam ha Nyameɛ wɔ anwuro-anwuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">na asomdwie ha mmenia bɔ bɛsɔ ye nye wɔ aseɛ so!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Abɔfo nemɔ fili bɛ nwo berɛ hɔle anwuro ne, bɛ bɔ bɛnea mmoan ne ha hyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma yɛhɔ Betlehem, na yɛɛnea edwirɛ bɔ wasi, bɔ Awurade ala ye ali ahyire yɛ ne.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Yeti, bɛyɛle ndɛ bɛhɔle, na bɛnwuni Mary ne Yosef, ne adɔma né kyɛ ɔla alaka bɔ ngaka didi nu nanu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni ye ne, akwalaa ne nwo dwirɛ bɔ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ ne, bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Na edwirɛ bɔ bɛ bɔ bɛnea mmoan ne hane ne, ɔyɛle ebiala bɔ ɔtele ne nwanwa, <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />nakoso Mary de, ɔfale edwirɛ he amukoraati siele ye ahone nu, na ɔdwenene ye nwo.<verse eid="LUK 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛnea mmoan ne sa hɔle, na bɛhyɛle Nyameɛ anuonyam bɛyele ye ayɛ wɔ bɔ banwu ye, ná bate namukoraati nwo, ofikyɛ bɔ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ ne, sɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ yeɛ né ɔte ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ngyẽa mmɔtwɛ si ne, né mmerɛ aso kyɛ bɛpɛ akwalaa ne toa, na bɛtole ye dumaa Yesu; sɔ dumaa ne yeɛ abɔfo ne fa tole ye kora yeɛ bɛnwonzɛ ye ne.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Kyɛbɔ Mose mmeraa ne kyire ne, mmerɛ sone kyɛ bɛte ye nwo ne, bɛfale ye bɛwale Yerusalem kyɛ bɛbaafa ye bɛkyire Awurade, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />na kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ Awurade mmeraa nanu ne: “Baa brienzua biala bɔ okoli moa kofi koɛ nanu kofite ne, odikyɛ bɛfrɛ ye krongron bɛma Awurade.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Na bɛbɔle afɔleɛ kyɛbɔ baha ye wɔ Awurade mmeraa nanu ne: “ɔfa mmubure nyɔ anaa mmorɔnoma mmaa-mmaa nyɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Né biaa bie wɔ Yerusalem bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Simeon. Né sɔ biaa he te teneneeniɛ, na ne ɔmva ye som nni angorɛ, afei ne ɔnwondɛ Israel awerɛkyekye ne, na né honhom krongron wɔ ye so. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Afei koso, né honhom krongron amaa wanwu ye kyɛ, okonwu Kristo bɔ Awurade asoma ye ne kora, né wawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Na honhom krongron ne hane ye maa ɔhɔle asɔre awuro berɛ. Na mmerɛ bɔ adɔma Yesu awofo fale ye wale berɛ kyɛ bɛbaayɛ bɔ mmeraa ne ahyɛ ne bɛma ye ne, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />olɛle akwalaa ne tole ye sa so, na ɔyele Nyameɛ ayɛ kyɛ:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Otumvoɛ Awurade, kesaalae de, esoma w'akoaa atee asomdwie nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">kyɛbɔ wɔ dwirɛ ne te ne.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ofikyɛ me nye anwu atee bɔ ɛkɔfa so kole ngoa,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />bɔ asiesie ye wɔ maen-maen mukoraati nyunu ne,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />kanea bɔ ɔkɔye nikye bɔ wakata maen-maen naso ne kofi berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">na wahyɛ wɔ maen Israel anuonyam ne.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Na edwirɛ bɔ ɔha fale akwalaa nanwo ne yɛle ye baba ne ye maame nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Afei Simeon hyirale bɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele Mary, bɔ ɔte akwalaa ne maame ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:34">“Baye akwalaa he kyɛ, ɔma mmeni pee fi ase wɔ Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:34">na ɔma pee koso dwɔso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:34">na ɔkɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ mmeni pee kodwudwo kotia,<verse eid="LUK 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, mmeni pee tianu nzusuyɛɛ kɔla ali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:35">(amba, dadeɛ tendee bie kosina wɔ).”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Né diifoɛ brasua bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Anna wɔ berɛ, né ɔte Fanuel bɔ ofi Aser abusua nu ne awa. Né sɔ maame he anyi paa, na ogyale ohu ne, ɔne ye tenane afoɛ nzoo. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Na sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɔte kunaniɛ bɔ wali afoɛ 84. Daa biala ne ɔwɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, bɔ ɔfa akɔngyere ne mbaebɔ sõ Nyameɛ eyia ne kɔngɔen. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Na ye koso ɔwale bɛ nwo berɛ sɔ mmerɛ nala, na ɔhyɛle yebo lale Nyameɛ ase, na ɔhane akwalaa nanwo dwirɛ hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛnwondɛ kyɛ bɛkole Yerusalem namukoraati ne.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Na beyiele nikye biala kyɛbɔ ɔwɔ Awurade mmeraa nanu ne, besa bɛhɔle bɛ kuro Nazerɛt bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Na akwalaa ne nyini, na ye nwo yɛle se, na onwuni nworɛ paa, na né Nyameɛ adom wɔ ye so.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Afoɛ biala, né ye awofo kɔ Pɛnu Afahyɛ nabo wɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Na onyane afoɛ 12 ne, bɛhɔle kyɛbɔ afahyɛ nanwo nhyehyɛɛ te ne. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Bɛlili afahyɛ ne beyiele, ná besa bɛkɔ bɛ kuro ne, abɛɛmaa Yesu de, ɔhale Yerusalem, nakoso ye awofo adwene angɔ so. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Né b'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ, wafra mmenia bɔ bɛne bɛ tu atee nanu, yeti bɛpɛle ɛlɛho atee. Na afei bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛpena ye wɔ b'abusuafoɛ ne bɛ nnamvo nemɔ nu. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Nakoso bannwu ye, yeti besa bɛhɔle Yerusalem bɛɛpenane ye. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ɛlɛsa si ne, bɛnwuni ye wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, né ɔte akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ nemɔ afia otie bɛ, na né obisabisa bɛ dwirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Na ye nyanza ne ye mmuayɛ ne yɛle bɛ bɔ betie ye namukoraati nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ye awofo nwuni ye ne, bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ, na ye maame bisale ye kyɛ: “Mma, nzuati yeɛ ayɛ yɛ sɔ ne? Mene wɔ baba apena wɔ afɛ pa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Na ye koso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔpena me ɔ? Ɛmɔnze kyɛ odikyɛ metena me baba awuro anaa?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Nakoso bɛ de, bannde bɔ ɔha hyirele bɛ ne bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ɔne bɛ sa hɔle Nazerɛt, na ɔbrɛle ye nwo ase mane bɛ. Na ye maame fale edwirɛ he amukoraati siele ye ti anu. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Na Yesu nyini, onwuni nworɛ paa, na ne Nyameɛ ne mmenia mukoraati kuro ye dwirɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Tiberio Kaesare ahennie né afoɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so 15 ne, né Pontio Pilato te amrado wɔ Yudea, né Herode di Galilea manzini naso, na ne oliema Filipo di Iturea ne Trakoniti manzini naso, yeɛ ne Lisania di Abilene manzini naso, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />né Annas ne Kaiafa te sɔfo mbanyi. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, Nyameɛ dwirɛ wale Zakaria awa Yohane berɛ wɔ ɛserɛ so.<verse eid="LUK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Na Yohane hyinini nguro bɔ wapɛ Yordan nwo wayia namukoraati nu, na ɔha hyirele mmenia ne kyɛ, bɛbɔ asu bɛfa behyire kyɛ basakra b'adwene na wamaa bafa bɛ bɔne bahyɛ bɛ; <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ diifoɛ Isaiah nwomaa nanu; bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Konviɛ bie tea nu wɔ ɛserɛ naso kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Ɛmɔsiesie Awurade atee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">ɛmɔma ye atee ne tengyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ɛmɔtua bɔnza biala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na ɛmɔdwiri mmokaa namukoraati bɛgua;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">atee bɔ wahyea ne, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ tee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na nekaa bɔ wayɛ mmɔnga-mmɔnga ne, ɛmɔma so yɛ trome-trome,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />na anwoɔnaen biala konwu atee bɔ Nyameɛ kɔfa so kole ngoa ne.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Na mmenia bɔ bɛwale ye berɛ kyɛ ɔbɔ bɛ asu ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛkyerebene mmaa mɔ, nwa yeɛ ɔha hyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔnwati ɛyaa bɔ ɔba ne? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ɛmɔsu mmaa bɔ okyire adwene-sakra. Na nnɛmɔ keka bɛkyire ɛmɔ nwo kyɛ, ‘Yɛ baba yeɛ ole Abraham.’ Ofikyɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, Nyameɛ kɔhora kɔmaa Abraham konya mmaa kofi nyɔboɛ hemɔ nu <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bafa akumaa ne bato bakaa ne ndii nanwo dada, yeti bakaa biala bɔ onzu mmaa pa ne, bɛkɔpɛ na bagyi bagua see nu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Yeɛ mmenia ne bisale ye kyɛ; “Ye de, nzu yeɛ yɛyɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ole ndadeɛ nyɔ ne, ɔma bɔ olle bie ne kõ, na bɔ ole aleɛ ne koso, ɔyɛ sɔ ala.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne po wale maa ɔbɔle bɛ asu, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, nzu yeɛ yɛyɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛtoɔ bɔ bɛnwa ɛmɔle ne, nnɛmɔ de maa ɔbo so.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Afei koso, sogyafoɛ ne bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ yɛyɛ ɔ?” Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ tee-tee ebiala, na nnɛmɔfa edwirɛ bɛto ebiala so, mmom ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye sɔ bɔ ɛmɔle ye ne.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né mmenia ne nea Kristo né ate, na ne ebiala dwene Yohane nwo wɔ y'ahone nu kyɛ, “Anaa yeɛ ole Kristo ne?” <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohane yele bɛ mukoraati noa kyɛ: “Me de, nzue yeɛ mefa mebɔ ɛmɔ asu ɔ, nakoso bɔ ole tumi tra me ne ba, na ye mmaboa nyamaa po, menvata kyɛ me sangye. Ye de, honhom krongron ne see yeɛ ɔkɔfa kɔbɔ ɛmɔ asu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Otira nikye bɔ bɛfa behu hwiit so, na ɔkɔpra nekaa bɔ ohu hwiit gua ne kama-kama, na waboɔboa ye hwiit ne noa wagua pata so, na ndɛtɛ ne de, see bɔ onnua le yeɛ ɔkɔfa kɔyera ye ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Afei koso, ɔfale afutuo pee mane mmenia ne, na ɔhane nzɛmba ne hyirele bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Nakoso Yohane hwili Herode bɔ odi manzini naso ne nyunu, ofikyɛ ne wagya Herodia bɔ ɔte oliema brienzua aye, na ne wayɛ nningyein pee bɔ ɔttemaye. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Bɔ Herode yɛ bokale ye bɔne naso yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔhyele Yohane tole prizin.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔ mmenia namukoraati asu ne, Yesu koso bɔle asu. Ná ɔbɔ mbaeɛ ne, anwuro bukyele, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na honhom krongron ne dwu wale ye so te kyɛ abubure, na konviɛ bie fili anwuro wale kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle mma bɔ medɔ ye ne; male wɔ mato nu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu hyɛle ye adwuma bo ne, né wanya kɔyɛ afoɛ 30, na né mmenia nwu ye kyɛ ye baba yeɛ ole</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yosef, Heli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Matat, Lewi, Melki, Jannai, Yosef,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Matatia, Amos, Nahum, Esli, Nagai,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Maat, Matatia, Semen, Josek, Joda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Joanan, Resa, Zerubabel, Sealtiel, Neri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Melki, Addi, Kosam, Elmadam, Er,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Yosua,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek “Yesu”</char></note> Eliezer, Jorim, Matat, Lewi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Simeon, Yuda, Yosef, Yonam, Eliakim,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Melea, Menna, Matata, Natan, David,<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Yese, Obed, Boas, Salmon, Nason,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Aminadab, Arni, Hesron, Peres, Yuda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yakob, Isaac, Abraham, Tera, Nahor,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Serug, Reu, Peleg, Eber, Sela,<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Kainan, Arfaksad, Sem, Nowa, Lamek,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Metusala, Enok, Yared, Mahalalel, Kainan,<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Enos, Seth, Adam, Nyameɛ.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Na Yesu bɔ honhom krongron awa ye so ne fili Yordan nzue nanwo, na honhom ne fale ye hɔle ɛserɛ so <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />ngyẽa 40, na Abɔnzam sɔle ye neane. Sɔ ngyẽa nanu ne, wanni hwee, yeti ngyẽa 40 ne wale awieɛ ne, né ɛhɔen ku ye.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Yeɛ Abɔnzam ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ awa ne a, dwudwo kyire nyɔboɛ he ma ɔkakyi paanoo.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bahworɔ kyɛ, ‘Nná paanoo ngome yeɛ ɔkɔmaa sona kɔtena ase ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Yeti, Abɔnzam fale Yesu hɔle bokaa tendee bie so, na ɔfale ahennie bɔ ɔwɔ wiase namukoraati hyirele ye. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Yeɛ Abɔnzam ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ngɔfa tumi he amukoraati ne ye nwo anuonyam ngɔma wɔ, ofikyɛ bafa bama me, na ebiala bɔ mekuro ne, mefa mema ye. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Yeti, sɛ ɛbɔ wɔ nu ase sõ me a, ye mukoraati kɔyɛ wɔ deɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Bahworɔ kyɛ, ‘Awurade wɔ Nyameɛ ngome yeɛ odikyɛ ɛkoto ye ɔ, na ye ngome yeɛ odikyɛ ɛsõ ye ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Afei, ɔfale Yesu hɔle Yerusalem maa oogyinane asɔre awuro né nekaa bɔ ɔwale paa ne, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ awa ne a, to wɔ nwo fi wa to aseɛ nwo dɔ, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Wɔ ti, ɔkɔhyɛ ye abɔfo nemɔ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">maa ‘bɛkɔbɔ wɔ nwo waen’<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />na ‘bɛkɔsoa wɔ bɛ sa so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, wɔ gya ngɔpoli nyɔboɛ ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu mane ye mmuayɛ kyɛ: “Baha kyɛ, ‘Nnɛsɔ Awurade wɔ Nyameɛ nea.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Abɔnzam yiele sɔ nzɔhwɛ he amukoraati ne, ɔyakyile ye berɛ oodwuli mmerɛ foforɛ bɔ ɔte pa.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Afei Yesu bɔ honhom wɔ ye so ne sa wale Galilea, na ye nwo dwirɛ trɛ hɔle nguro bɔ wapɛ bɛ nwo wayia namukoraati nu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Afei koso, ɔyɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ebiala kamvole ye.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Na ɔhɔle Nazerɛt, nekaa bɔ bɛtetele ye ne, na kyɛbɔ daa ɔyɛ ye Homeda ne, ɔhɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔdwɔso gyinane berɛ kyɛ ɔbaakenga. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Yeti, bɛfale Isaiah nwomaa ne bɛmane ye, na mmerɛ bɔ obukyele nu ne, onwuni nekaa bɔ bahworɔ berɛ kyɛ:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Awurade honhom wɔ me so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ofikyɛ wasra me kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">nga nzɛmba ngyire ahiafoɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Wasoma me kyɛ, nga ahofadie nwo dwirɛ ngyire bɛ bɔ bafa bɛ nnɔmun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">na mma anyesiniwaafoɛ nwu nikye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">na mma bɛ bɔ bɛhyɛ bɛ so ne lɛ bɛ nwo,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />na nga Awurade adom mmerɛ ngyire mmenia.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Oyiele ne, ɔbobɔle nwomaa ne fa wurale sona bɔ ɔnea berɛ ne sanu, yeɛ ɔtenane ase ɔ. Na bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ sua nu berɛ namukoraati neane ye haa, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Tworɔnzɛm bɔ ɛmɔ ate ye kesaalae ne, ɛnɛ yeɛ wawa nu ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Na bɛ nu biala hane ye nwo dwirɛ pa, na ye noa nu dwirɛ bɔ ɔhyɛ nguraen ne maa bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ paa. Na bɛhane kyɛ: “Aa! Nná Yosef awa ne ɛhe?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔnyɛ nwanwa kyɛ ɛmɔkobu me anyandera kyɛ: ‘Dɔkta, sa wɔ nwo anwonyerɛ. Nningyein bɔ yɛtele kyɛ ɛyɛ ye wɔ Kapernaum ne, yɛ bie wɔ wɔ kuro wa koso.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Na ɔtoale so kyɛ: “Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, diifoɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ bedɛ ye bɛto nu wɔ ye kuro ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ: Elia aberɛ so, mmerɛ bɔ bɛtole anwuro nu afoɛ nza ne bosome nzia maa ɛhɔen kandinga bie wale aseɛ namukoraati so ne, né akunafoɛ pee wɔ Israel. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Nakoso banzoma Elia bangɔ bɛ nu biala berɛ, sana kunaniɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Sarefat, bɔ ɔwɔ Sidon aseɛ so ne. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Afei koso, diifoɛ Elisa aberɛ so ne, né kwatafoɛ pee wɔ Israel, nakoso bɛ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔsale ye anwonyerɛ ɔ, sana Naaman bɔ ofi Siria ne.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ namukoraati fɛle yaa paa. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Na bɛdwɔso bɛpiepiale ye bɛfili kuro nanu bɛfale ye bɛhɔle bokaa bɔ bɛ kuro ne gua so ne noa dɔ kyɛ bɛkwaasumu ye bɛto dɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Nakoso ɔfale bɛ afia berɛ hɔle.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Na ɔhɔle Galilea kuro bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kapernaum nanu, na homeda biala né okyirekyire bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Na ye ngyerɛkyerɛ ne yɛle bɛ nwanwa, ofikyɛ né tumi wɔ ye dwudwolɛ nanu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Né biaa bie bɔ ole sunzummɔne wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔteane nu serɛ-serɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu, nzu yeɛ yafa yayɛ wɔ ɔ? Ɛwale kyɛ ɛbaasɛkye yɛ hɔ? Mese wɔ, wɔ yeɛ ɛle Krongroniɛ bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Nakoso Yesu hwili ye nyunu kyɛ: “Yɛ konn na fi ye nu!” Na sunzummɔne ne maa ɔpɛ fini bɛ nyunu berɛ, na ofili ye nu bɔ wanyɛ ye hwee. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Na ɔyɛle bɛ mukoraati nwanwa, na bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Edwirɛ beni ɛhe? Ɔfa tumi ne anwoserɛ hyɛ sunzummɔne mɔ po maa bɛfite!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Yeti ye nwo dwirɛ trɛ hɔle nguro bɔ wapɛ bɛ nwo wayia né nekaa biala.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Ofili sua bɔ beyia nu nanu ne, ɔhɔle Simon awuro. Né <char style="tl">high fiiva</char> ahye Simon sia brasua, yeti bɛsrɛle Yesu kyɛ ɔnea ye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Na oogyinane ye nwo berɛ teɛteane <char style="tl">fiiva</char> ne, na ofili ye nu. Na ɛberɛ ala, maame ne dwɔsole na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔsõ ye.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Eyia kwaatɔ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛle mmenia bɔ anwonyerɛ ahoroɛ wɔ bɛ so namukoraati fale bɛ wale ye berɛ. Na ɔfale ye sa guale bɛ nu biala so sale ye anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Sunzummɔne koso tu fili mmeni pee nu, na bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ awa ne.” Nakoso ohwili bɛ nyunu, na wamma bandwudwo, ofikyɛ ne bɛse kyɛ ye yeɛ ole Kristo ne.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Nakoso aleɛ hene ne, ofili berɛ oowurale nekaa bie dinn. Nakoso mmenia ne penane ye alaa nwuni nekaa bɔ ɔwɔ ne, na bɛbɔle mmɔden kyɛ, bɛngɔma ɔngofi bɛ nwo berɛ nngɔhɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Odikyɛ meka Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ wɔ nguro foforɛ so, ofikyɛ ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛsomane me ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Yeti ɔɔhane nzɛmba ne wɔ Yudea sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ɛlɛho bie, né Yesu gyi Genesaret po ne noa, na ne mmenia abɔ apee ye so bɔ bɛpena kyɛ betie Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Onwuni kyɛ ɛlɛen nyɔ bie gyi ɛpo ne noa, nakoso né bɛ bɔ bɛkye egyein ne adwu afi nu bɔ bɛnwunzi bɛ nɛt. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Na ɔfole ɛlɛen ne kõ, né ɔte Simon deɛ, yeɛ ɔsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔpia fi aseɛ naso hɔ nzue nanu dɔ kaa. Na ɔtenane ɛlɛen nanu hyirehyirele mmenia ne. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Odwudwo yiele ne, ɔha hyirele Simon kyɛ: “Pia ɛlɛen ne kɔ ɛpo ne kunu dɔ, na ɛmɔgua ɛmɔ nɛt ne bɛhye gyein.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Yeɛ Simon hane kyɛ: “Me wura, yayɛ adwuma kɔngɔen namukoraati, yannya hwee. Nakoso bɔ aha nati, ngogua nɛt ne.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Bɛyɛle sɔ ne, bɛhyele naen pee, na né bɛ nɛt nemɔ po tete. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Yeti bɛfrɛle bɛ nnamvo bɔ bɛwɔ ɛlɛen foforɛ nu kyɛ bɛɛsɔ bɛ nu. Bɛwale ne, bɛyele naen ne bɛguale ɛlɛen nyɔ nanu maa ye munyɔ namukoraati yili dɛen, bɔ ahaa ɔmono po. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simon Petro nwuni bɔ wasi ne, obuli ndwerɛ wɔ Yesu gya bo hane kyɛ: “Awurade, fi me nwo wa kɔ, ofikyɛ nde ɔbɔnefoɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Bɔ ɔmaa ɔhane sɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, egyein bɔ bɛhyele bɛ ne, né ɔyɛ ye ne bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so namukoraati nwanwa, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />na né ɔyɛ Sebedeo mmaa Yakobo ne Yohane bɔ bɛne Petro yɛ adwuma ne po nwanwa. Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele Simon kyɛ: “Nnɛsuro; ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, ɛkɔhye mmenia.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Bɛpiane ɛlɛen ne bɛwale ɛpo ne noa, na bɛyakyile nikye biala berɛ bɛlili Yesu si.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Kyẽa foforɛ koso, né Yesu wɔ nguro ne kõ anu, na né biaa bie wɔ berɛ bɔ kwata abia ye! Onwuni Yesu ne, ofale ye nyunu butuli berɛ srɛle ye kyɛ: “Awurade, sɛ ekuro a, ɛkɔhora kɔmaa me nwo kɔtɔ me.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Na Yesu tengyɛle ye sa sɔle ye nu hane kyɛ: “Mekuro, wɔ nwo tɔ wɔ.” Na ɛberɛ ala, kwata ne tu minini. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Na ɔha hyirele biaa ne kyɛ, nnɛmaa ɔbɔ so kyire ebiala, mmom “kɔ, na kɔfa wɔ nwo kyire sɔfo ne, ná wɔ nwo bɔ watɔ wɔ nati, fa afɔleɛ bɔ Mose hane ne ma bɛ, na ɔyɛ adanzeɛ ma bɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Nakoso ye nwo dwirɛ trɛ hɔle nekaa biala, na mmeni pee yiale nu kyɛ bɛbaatie ye, ná bɛmaa ɔsale b'anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Nakoso né ɔtaa kɔ ɛserɛ naso kɔbɔ mbaeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ɛlɛho bie, né ɔyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ, na né Farisifoɛ ne mmeraa nanwo akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛfi Galilea ne Yudea nguraa mɔ nu ne Yerusalem né tete berɛ; na né Awurade tumi bɔ ɔkɔfa kɔsa anwonyerɛ wɔ ye so. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Na mmrienzua biemɔ fale bubuaniɛ bie bɔ ɔla bɛen so wale berɛ, né bɛpena kyɛ bɛfa ye bɛwura nu bɛkɔto Yesu nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Nakoso mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nati, bannya atee bamva ye banwura nu. Yeti bɛfole sua naso, na bɛtuli so tokuro yeɛ bɛdwurale ɔne ye bɛen ne bɛwale mmenia nanu wɔ Yesu nyunu berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Na Yesu nwuni bɛ gyidie ne, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Me damvo, bafa wɔ bɔne bahyɛ wɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Na atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ ne hyɛle yebo hane ye wɔ b'ahone nu kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔka sɔ mmusue dwirɛ ne? Nná Nyameɛ ngome yeɛ ɔkora fa bɔne kyɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu nwuni adwene bɔ ɔwɔ bɛ tianu ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔdwene ye nwo wɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu ne? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Beni yeɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ɔ, kyɛ ɛkɔha kyɛ, ‘Bafa wɔ bɔne bahyɛ wɔ,’ anaa ɛkɔha kyɛ, ‘Dwɔso na nate’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Nakoso bɔ ɔkɔyɛ na ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ Sona Awa ne le tumi bɔ ɔkora fa bɔne kyɛ wɔ aseɛ he aso ne—” ɔha hyirele bubuaniɛ ne kyɛ: “Meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, Dwɔso, fa wɔ bɛen, na kɔ w'awuro.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Na bɛ nyunu berɛ ala, odwɔsole, ɔfale bɛen bɔ né ɔla so ne, na ɔhɔle ye awuro; ɔkɔ namu né ɔye Nyameɛ ayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Na ɔyɛle bɛ nu biala nwanwa, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛyele Nyameɛ ayɛ. Na esuronyi hane bɛ maa bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɛnɛ de, yanwu anwanwadeɛ pa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ɛhene si ne, ofitele, na onwuni biaa bie bɔ odidɛ ɛtoɔ, né bɛfrɛ ye Lewi, na né ɔte nekaa bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne. Na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baali me si.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Na ɔyakyile nikye biala berɛ dwɔso lili ye si.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Na Lewi tole paati kandinga bie mane Yesu wɔ ye awuro berɛ; né bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ pee ne mmeni foforɛ boka bɛ bɔ ɔne bɛ didi naso. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Na Farisifoɛ ne atwerɛfoɛ ne hyɛle yebo nwii-nwii hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ ne bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne abɔnefoɛ to asaa didi ne?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Bɛ bɔ bɛte apɔ ne, benhia dɔktaniɛ, bɛ bɔ bafokyɛ ne mmon yeɛ behia dɔktaniɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nná ateneneefoɛ ti yeɛ mmale ɔ, mmom, mmale kyɛ mebaafrɛ abɔnefoɛ maa bɛsakra b'adwene.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Yohane asuafoɛ ne taa yɛ akɔngyere na bɛbɔ mbaeɛ, na Farisifoɛ ne koso, sɔ ala, nakoso w'asuafoɛ ne de, bɛdidi bɛno.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya ne wɔ ye nnamvo mɔ nwo ne, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne bayɛ akɔngyere? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Nakoso mmerɛ bie kɔwa, bɔ bɛkɔfa brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya ne bɛkofi ye nnamvo mɔ nwo, sɔ mmerɛ ne de, bɛkɔyɛ akɔngyere.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Osa yɛle mvandoho hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔpɛ ɛtena monɛ ta atadeɛ daa nu ɔ. Sɛ ɔyɛ sɔ a, ɛtena monɛ ne kɔte, na ɛtena monɛ kaa bɔ wafa wata daa nanu ne, ɔne ye nngɔyɛ pɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Afei koso, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔfa nzãa foforɛ gua nzãa bɔtɔ daa nu ɔ. Sɛ ɔyɛ sɔ a, nzãa foforɛ ne kɔpakye nzãa bɔtɔ daa ne, na nzãa ne kohwie kogua maa nzãa bɔtɔ ne koso kɔsɛkye. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Mmom odikyɛ bɛfa nzãa foforɛ bɛgua bɔtɔ monɛ nu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Afei, sɛ ebie no nzãa daa a, ɔmbena nzãa foforɛ, ofikyɛ ɔka kyɛ, ‘Nzãa daa ne kama paa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Homeda bie, né ɔnate hwiit bo bie nu, na ye asuafoɛ nemɔ tetele hwiit ne bie, na bɛposale ye wɔ bɛ sa nu belili. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ɛhe ati, Farisifoɛ nemɔ bie bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ nikye bɔ mmeraa mma atee kyɛ bɛyɛ ye Homeda ne?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Nakoso Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Bɔ David yɛle, mmerɛ bɔ ne ɛhɔen ku ɔne ye mmrandeɛ nemɔ ne, ɛmɔ kenngale? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ɔhɔle Nyameɛ awuro berɛ oolɛle paanoo bɔ bafa bawa Nyameɛ nyunu ne lili, na ɔfale bie mane ye mmrandeɛ nemɔ. Né mmeraa mma atee kyɛ ebiala di sɔ paanoo ne bie, sana sɔfo nemɔ ngome.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sona Awa ne yeɛ ɔte Homeda ne Wura ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Homeda foforɛ koso, ɔhɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ. Né biaa bie bɔ ye sa awu wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Né atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ nea ye haa, né bɛnea kyɛ ɔkɔsa biaa ne anwonyerɛ homeda ne, na banya edwirɛ bie bafa babɔ ye sommoɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ye de, né ɔse adwene bɔ ɔwɔ bɛ tianu ɔ, yeti ɔha hyirele baba bɔ ye sa awu ne kyɛ: “Dwɔso bagyina afia wa.” Yeti, odwɔso oogyinane berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me bisa ɛmɔ, aso mmeraa ma atee maa bɛyɛ nikye pa anaa nikye tɛɛ homeda? Kyɛ bɛkole ebie ngoa anaa bɛkɔsɛkye ebie?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ɔneane bɛ mukoraati yiale ne, ɔha hyirele biaa ne kyɛ: “Tengyɛ wɔ sa nanu.” Na ɔyɛle sɔ ne, ye sa ne yɛle yé. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Nakoso bɛ de, bɛfɛle yaa paa, na bɛne bɛ nwo susuli bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔyɛ Yesu nanwo.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Sɔ ngyẽa nemɔ nu ne, ɔhɔle bokaa bie so ɔɔbɔle mbaeɛ, na ɔbɔle Nyameɛ mbaeɛ kɔngɔen namukoraati. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Aleɛ hene ne, ɔfrɛle ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, na ɔyele bɛ nu 12, na osa frɛle bɛ asomafoɛ. Bɛ dumaa yeɛ ole: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simon bɔ ɔtole ye dumaa Petro ne, oliema Andrea, Yakobo, Yohane, Filipo, Bartolomeo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mateo, Tomas, Alfeo awa Yakobo, Simon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye mmɔden-bɔfoɛ ne, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yakobo awa Yuda, yeɛ Yuda Iskariot, bɔ yesi ne, ɔyele ye mane ne.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Na ɔne bɛ dwu wale, yeɛ bɛɛgyinane aseɛ frɛtɛɛ bie aso; né ye asuafoɛ pee ne mmenia bɔ bɛfi Yudea ne Yerusalem, ne bɛ bɔ bɛfi Sidon ne Tiro ɛpo ne noa dɔ namukoraati wɔ berɛ, bɛwale kyɛ bɛbaatie ye, ná bɛmaa ɔsa b'anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Na bɛ bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ bɛ so ne po, ɔsale bɛ anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Na ne mmeni lɔen namukoraati pena kyɛ bɛfa bɛ sa bɛka ye, ofikyɛ ne tumi fi ye nu ba, na ɔsale bɛ mukoraati anwonyerɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Na ɔtole ye nye neane ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, yeɛ ɔhyɛle yebo hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Anigye yeɛ ole ahiafoɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ofikyɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne te ɛmɔ deɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Anigye yeɛ ole ɛmɔ bɔ kesaalae ɛhɔen ku ɛmɔ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ofikyɛ ɛmɔ ko koyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Anigye yeɛ ole ɛmɔ bɔ kesaalae ɛmɔsu ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ofikyɛ, ɛmɔ kɔsere.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Anigye yeɛ ole ɛmɔ, mmerɛ biala bɔ mmenia tane ɛmɔ nye, bɛye ɛmɔ bɛfi mmenia nu, bɛbɔ ɛmɔ alapaa, na Sona Awa nati, bɛsɛkye ɛmɔ dumaa bɛka kyɛ ɛmɔte nnipa-bɔnefoɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Sɔ kyẽa ne, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ akatua bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne te piri, na sɔ ala yeɛ bɛ baba mɔ yɛle adiifoɛ nemɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Nakoso ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte asikafoɛ ne de, ɛmɔ yaakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">ofikyɛ, ɛmɔ anya ɛmɔ awerɛkyekye mukoraati bayie.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ɛmɔ bɔ kesaalae ɛmɔ ko ayi ne, ɛmɔ yaakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ofikyɛ ɛhɔen kohu ɛmɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ɛmɔ bɔ kesaalae ɛmɔsere ne, ɛmɔ yaakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ofikyɛ ɛmɔ wora kɔbɔ maa ɛmɔ kosu.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Sɛ mmenia mukoraati ka ɛmɔ nwo dwirɛ pa a, ɛmɔ yaakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ofikyɛ sɔ ala yeɛ bɛ nana mɔ yɛle ngondombo adiifoɛ nemɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Na meka mekyire ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔtie me ne kyɛ: Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛlɔ ɛmɔ atamfo, na ɛmɔyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛkyi ɛmɔ ne pa, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />ɛmɔhyira bɛ bɔ bɛdome ɛmɔ ne, na ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma bɛ bɔ bɛpɛ ɛmɔ nzoaa ne. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Sɛ ebie bɔ wɔ so kõ anu a, kakyi kõ ne koso ma ye; na bɔ okole w'atadeɛ bɔ ogua wɔ so ne, fa bɔ owura yebo ne boka so ma ye. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔsrɛ wɔ nikye ne, ma ye bie, na nikye bɔ okole kofi wɔ berɛ ne, nnedɛ ye kõ.<verse eid="LUK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />“Afei koso, bɔ ɛmɔpena kyɛ mmenia yɛ ma ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔyɛ sɔ ala bɛma bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Sɛ ɛmɔdɔ bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ ɛmɔ ngome a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ? Abɔnefoɛ po dɔ bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ bɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Na sɛ bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ɛmɔ pa yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɛ pa a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ? Sɔ ala yeɛ abɔnefoɛ po yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Afei koso, sɛ ɛmɔma bosea, na ɛmɔfa bɛma bɛ bɔ ɛmɔnea atee kyɛ bɛkotua bɛkɔma ɛmɔ a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ? Abɔnefoɛ po ma abɔnefoɛ bosea, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkotua bɛkɔma bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔlɔ ɛmɔ atamfo, ɛmɔyɛ bɛ pa, ná ɛmɔbɔ bɛ bosea, bɔ ɛmɔnnea atee kyɛ bɛkɔyɛ bie bɛkosi ɛmɔ gya nu ɔ. Ɛhene yeɛ ɛmɔ akatua kɔyɛ piri, ná ɛmɔ ayɛ Anwuro-Anwuroniɛ ne mmaa; ofikyɛ ɔyɛ boniayɛfoɛ ne abɔnefoɛ mukoraati pa. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛnwu mmenia anwunvo, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ Baba nwu anwunvo nala.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Afei koso, ɛmɔyakyi atɛn bɔ ɛmɔbu mmenia ne, ná bammu ɛmɔ atɛn; nnɛmɔ dwudwo betia mmenia, na ebiala koso ngodwudwo ngotia ɛmɔ. Ɛmɔfa mmenia bɔne bɛhyɛ bɛ, na bɛkɔfa ɛmɔ deɛ bɛkɔhyɛ ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ɛmɔhyɛ nikye, na bɛkɔhyɛ ɛmɔ nikye. Bɛkowura kongo ne maa okoyi, ná bamia so, bawoso ye maa wabu wafa ye nwo kora ne bafa bagua ɛmɔ tena nu. Ofikyɛ kongo bɔ ɛmɔfa bɛsusu nikye bɛma mmenia ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ bɛkɔfa bɛkosusu bɛkɔma ɛmɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yeɛ ɔmane bɛ mvandoho kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea a, anyesiniwaaniɛ kɔhora kohyire anyesiniwaaniɛ atee? Nná kumaa nu yeɛ bɛkoogua ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Suaniɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔtra ye kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ɔ, nakoso ebiala bɔ bahyirehyire ye yé ne, ɔkɔwa kɔɔyɛ kyɛ ye kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Nzuati yeɛ ɛkora nwu ndɛtɛ <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sɔɔdas kamba.”</char></note> bɔ ɔla eliema nye so ne, ná mbuna bɔ ɔla wɔ bɔbɔ wɔ nye so ne de, ɛnnwu ye ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ na ahora aha ahyire eliema kyɛ, ‘Nniema, ma nye ndɛtɛ <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sɔɔdas kamba.”</char></note> bɔ ɔla wɔ nye so ne,’ aberɛ bɔ ɛnnwu mbuna bɔ ɔla wɔ nye so ne ɔ? Nyaatwomniɛ, di moa ye mbuna bɔ ɔla wɔ nye so ne, ɛhene kɔmaa ekonwu nikye yé, na ahora aye ndɛtɛ <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sɔɔdas kamba.”</char></note> bɔ ɔla eliema ne nye so ne.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Bakaa pa biala nne berɛ bɔ osu mmaa tɛɛ ɔ, na sɔ ala yeɛ bakaa tɛɛ biala nzu mmaa pa. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Bakaa biala mmaa yeɛ ɔmaa bɛnwu bakaa horɛ ɔ. Ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛnndete borɔdoma wɔ mmowie so, na sɔ ala yeɛ bɛnndete bobe koso wɔ ɛfone so. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Sona pa de, nningyein pa bɔ waboɔboa ye noa wɔ y'ahone nu ne, ɛhene bie yeɛ ɔye fite ɔ, nakoso nnipa-bɔneniɛ de, nningyein tɛɛ bɔ waboɔboa ye noa wɔ y'ahone nu ne bie, yeɛ ɔye fite ɔ; ofikyɛ bɔ wabu so wɔ ahone nanu ne, yeɛ noa ne ka ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔfrɛ me ‘Awurade, Awurade’, nakoso ɛmɔnyɛ bɔ meka ne? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Ebiala bɔ ɔba me berɛ, ɔte me dwirɛ, na odi so ne, ngɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu bɔ ɔte ɔ: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ɔte kyɛ biaa bie bɔ osi sua, na otuli bɔen maa ɔhɔle ase paa tole ye fapem ne siele nyɔboɛ so ne. Mmerɛ bɔ nzue yili ne, ɔɔbɔle sua ne, nakoso wangora wanwoso ye, ofikyɛ, osili ye yé. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Nakoso bɔ ɔte, na ɔnyɛ ye nwo hwee ne, ɔte kyɛ ebie bɔ osili ye sua siele ase, bɔ wando fapem ne. Nzue ne yi bɔle ne, ɛberɛ ala obu guale, na sua ne sɛkyele koraa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔhane bɔ ɔka kyire mmenia ne yiele ne, ɔhɔle Kapernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Odwuli berɛ ne, né sogyaniɛ panyi bie akoaa bɔ ɔla ye ahone so afokyɛ, né wafokyɛ paa maa ɔpena wu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Sogyaniɛ ne tele Yesu nga ne, ɔsomane Yudafoɛ mbanyi ne bie kyɛ bɛhɔ ye berɛ, na bɛsrɛ ye maa ɔɔsa ye akoaa ne anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bɛwale Yesu berɛ ne, bɛsrɛle ye paa kyɛ: “Ye de, odikyɛ ɛyɛ ɛhe ma ye, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />ofikyɛ ɔdɔ yɛ maen, na osili sua bɔ beyia nu mane yɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Na Yesu ne bɛ hɔle. Ɔka kaa maa odwu awuro berɛ ne, sogyaniɛ panyi ne somane ye nnamvo maa bɛɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nnɛha wɔ nwo, ofikyɛ menvata kyɛ ɛba m'awuro. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ mammɔ hɔen mamma wɔ berɛ ne. Mmom ka edwirɛ bie, ná ɔma m'akoaa ne nwo tɔ ye. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ofikyɛ nwura mmeraa bo, na nne sogyafoɛ bɔ bɛwura me bo, na sɛ meka mekyire kõ kyɛ, ‘Kɔ’ a, né wahɔ, sɛ meka mekyire foforɛ kyɛ, ‘Bra’ a, ne wawa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu tele ɛhe ne, ye nwo yɛle ye nwanwa, na ɔkakyile ye nwo ha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛli ye si ne kyɛ: “Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, Israel po, nnwuni gyidie bɔ ɔte piri sɔa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Na mmerɛ bɔ ɛbɔfoɛ nemɔ sa hɔle awuro ne, bɛɛnwuni kyɛ akoaa ne nwo atɔ ye.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ɛhene si pɛɛ ne, ɔhɔle kuro bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Nain nu; na ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ne mmeni pee ne ye hɔle. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Opingye kuro ne anoa nanwo ne, né mmenia sõ abrandeɛ bie bɔ wawu, na né bɛfa ye bɛfi kuro nanu bɛfite. Ne ye maame di ye bahorɛ, na ɛhene si ne, ne maame ne te kunaniɛ. Né kuro nanufoɛ pee boka ye so. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Yesu nye bɔle maame naso ne, ye wora bɔ mane ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yakyi sue.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Na ɔɔsɔle bɛen bɔ fuin ne la so nanu, yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛsõ fuin ne gyinane ɔ. Yesu hane kyɛ: “Abrandeɛ, meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, dwɔso!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Na abrandeɛ bɔ wawu ne dwɔso tenane berɛ, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ odwudwo, na Yesu fale ye mane ye maame.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Esuronyi hane bɛ mukoraati, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛyele Nyameɛ ayɛ kyɛ: “Wama diifoɛ kandinga bie so wɔ yɛ nu.” Na besa bɛhane kyɛ: “Nyameɛ apɛ ye nye waanea ye maen.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Na ye nwo dwirɛ he trɛ hɔle Yudea ne maen bɔ wapɛ ye nwo wayia namukoraati nu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Na Yohane asuafoɛ nemɔ hane edwirɛ he mukoraati hyirele Yohane, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />yeti ɔfrɛle ye asuafoɛ nanu nyɔ somane bɛ kyɛ, bɛɛbisa Awurade kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle bɔ ɔba ne, anaa yɛnea sona foforɛ atee?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛdwuli ye berɛ ne, bɛhane kyɛ: “Yohane Suboniɛ asoma yɛ wɔ berɛ, na yenwa yɛbisa wɔ kyɛ: ‘Aso wɔ yeɛ ɛle bɔ ɔba ne, anaa yɛnea sona foforɛ atee?’”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Sɔ mmerɛ nala nu ne, ɔsale mmeni pee anwonyerɛ, né ebiemɔ deɛ nu yɛ se paa, na ne ebiemɔ deɛ nu nyɛ sɛ pa, otuli sunzummɔne na ɔmaa anyesiniwaafoɛ pee nwuni nikye. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yeti ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ ɛmɔ anwu ye, na ɛmɔ ate ne, ɛmɔhɔ bɛɛha ye nwo dwirɛ behyire Yohane kyɛ: Kesaalae de, anyesiniwaafoɛ nwu nikye, bɛ bɔ babubu ne nate, akwatafoɛ nwo te, asotiniwaafoɛ te dwirɛ, awufo dwɔso, na baha nzɛmba ne bahyire ahiafoɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Anigye yeɛ ole ebiala bɔ mendo ye sintidua ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Bɛ bɔ Yohane somane bɛ ne hɔle ne, Yesu hyɛle yebo hane Yohane nwo dwirɛ hyirele mmenia ne kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔhɔle ɛserɛ naso dɔ bɛɛneane ne? Elemmire bɔ mvrama woso ye anaa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔhɔle dɔ kyɛ ɛmɔ kwaanea ne? Biaa bie bɔ owura atadeɛ pa? Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛwura ndadeɛ pa, ná bɛdi fɛɛ ne de, ahemvie yeɛ bɛte ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ye de, nzu deinn yeɛ ɛmɔhɔle dɔ kyɛ ɛmɔ kwaanea ne? Diifoɛ? Amba, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ ɔtra diifoɛ po. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ɛhe yeɛ bɛhworɔle ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Nea, mesoma me bɔfoɛ maa odi wɔ nyunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">ye yeɛ okosiesie atee nu kɔma wɔ ɔ.’<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛ bɔ mmrasua awo bɛ ne de, bɛ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte piri tra Yohane. Nakoso bɔ ɔte kaa wɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu ne, ɔte piri tra ye.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />(Mmerɛ bɔ mmenia ne né bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne tele ɛhe ne, bɛhane kyɛ Nyameɛ te teneneeniɛ, ofikyɛ Yohane yeɛ ɔbɔle bɛ asu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Nakoso Farisifoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛse mmeraa nanu ne de, Nyameɛ afutuo bɔ ɔfa mane bɛ ne, bamva bannyɛ hwee, ofikyɛ nná ye yeɛ ɔbɔle bɛ asu ɔ.)<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />“Nzu po yeɛ mva sɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he ndoto ye nwo ɔ? Sɛɛ po yeɛ bɛte ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bɛte kyɛ ngwalaa bɔ bɛtete dwaaso, na bɛfrɛ bɛ mmango mɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Yɛbɔle edwein yɛmane ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">nakoso ɛmɔ ango;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">yɛbɔle awuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">nakoso ɛmɔ anzu.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ofikyɛ Yohane Suboniɛ wale ne, wannidi na wanno nzãa, na ɛmɔnwa ‘Ole sunzummɔne.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Sona Awa ne wale ne, ye de, odidi na ɔno, nakoso ɛmɔnwa, ‘Ɛmɔnea, adufum ne kɔwenzaniɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛdide ɛtoɔ ne abɔnefoɛ damvo ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Nakoso ye nneyɛɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛkyire yebo tee a, ɔte “Ye mmaa.”</char></note> kyire kyɛ ɔse nworɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Farisifoɛ nanu kõ srɛle Yesu kyɛ ɔbra ma bɛdidi, yeti ɔhɔle Farisiniɛ ne awuro, na ɔtenane ase kyɛ odidi. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Na braa bie bɔ bɛse ye wɔ kuro nanu kyɛ ɔte ɔbɔnefoɛ tele kyɛ Yesu didi wɔ Farisiniɛ n'awuro, na ɔfale alabasta towaa bɔ ngoo fona-fona wɔ nu wale, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />na oogyinane Yesu gya nwo wɔ ye si suni, ɔfale ye nye mmoen ne loale Yesu gya nwo, na ɔfale ye ti nwiaa kyikyile. Afei ɔfele ye gya nanwo na ɔfale ngoo fona-fona ne popale ye nwo. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Farisiniɛ bɔ ɔtole ye sa frɛle ye ne nwuni bɔ ɔkɔ so ne, ɔhane ye wɔ ye tianu kyɛ: “Sɛ ɔte amba kyɛ biaa he te diifoɛ a, ahaa okonwu sona-horɛ deinn bɔ ɔsosɔ ye nu ne, ofikyɛ braa he te ɔbɔnefoɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yeɛ Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Simon, mepena kyɛ meka edwirɛ bie mekyire wɔ.” Na ye koso ɔhane kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, dwudwo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Né mmenia nyɔ bie ma ebie bɔ ɔbɔ bosea kerɛ. Né kõ ma ye kerɛ dɛnare 500, yeɛ ne kõ ne deɛ te 50. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Bangora kerɛ ne tua, yeti ɔfa hyɛle bɛ. Nwa yeɛ ɛnea okohuro baba ne dwirɛ paa ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simon yele ye noa kyɛ: “Me susu kyɛ bɔ ɔfale kerɛ piri ne hyɛle ye ne.” Yesu hane kyɛ: “Abua ye yé.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Na ɔpɛle ye nye neane brasua ne, yeɛ ɔha hyirele Simon kyɛ: “Nnaa anwu sɔ brasua he? Mmale wɔ awuro wa ne, amma me nzue ma mannwunzi me gya bo, nakoso ye de, wafa ye nye mmoen waloa me gya nwo, na wafa ye ti nwiaa wakyikyi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Amve me noa nwo, nakoso ye de, ofi mmerɛ bɔ mmale wa ne, ɔyakyille me gya nwo felɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Amva ngoo angua me ti anu, nakoso ye de, wafa ngoo wagua me gya nwo. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Yeti meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, ye bɔne pembe ne, bafa bahyɛ ye, ofikyɛ ɔdɔ bɔ wala ye ali ne te piri paa. Nakoso ebiala bɔ bɛfa kaa bɛkyɛ ye ne, ye dɔ te kaa bie.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele braa ne kyɛ: “Bafa wɔ bɔne bahyɛ wɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛne ye te tɛbulu nanwo ne hyɛle yebo bisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Sona beni po ɛhe, bɔ ɔkora fa bɔne kyɛ ne?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele maame ne kyɛ: “Wɔ gyidie alɛ́ wɔ ngoa; fa asomdwie kɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ɛhene si mmerɛ kaa bie ne, ohyinini nguraa ne nguro nemɔ nu hane Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo nzɛmba ne, né buru-ne-nyɔ ne boka ye so, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />yeɛ né mmrasua biemɔ boka ye so; ɔsale sɔ mmrasua nemɔ anwonyerɛ na otuli sunzummɔne fili bɛ so. Sɔ mmrasua nemɔ yeɛ ole Mary bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Magdalene ne, ye yeɛ sunzummɔne nzoo fili ye nu fitele ne; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Joana bɔ ohu yeɛ ole Kuza bɔ ɔnea Herode awuro so ne, yeɛ Susana ne mmrasua foforɛ pee bɔ bɛfale b'ahodeɛ bɛsõne bɛ ne.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Mmerɛ bɔ mmeni pee boale bɛ noa, na mmenia bɔ bɛfi nguro ahoroɛ so wale ye berɛ ne, ɔfale mvandoho hyirehyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Kuaniɛ bie hɔle kyɛ ɔkwaagua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔkwaapete.”</char></note> ɛmo. Ogua ne, ebie guale atee noa, na mmenia tietiale so, ná ewienu nu nnomaa susole. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ebie guale nyɔboɛ so, na ofifili, nakoso owuli ofikyɛ wannya nzue. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ebie guale mmowie nu, na mmowie ne né ye nyini, na omiane ye. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Yeɛ ebie guale aseɛ pa so, na onyini ne, osuli mmaa 100.” Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, ɔmane ye konvi so hane kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ ole asoɛ bɔ ɔkɔfa kotie ne, ma otie.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ye asuafoɛ nemɔ bisale ye bɔ mvandoho ne kyire ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ de, bafa bama ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔte Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea nabo, nakoso bɛ ngaa ne de, mvandoho yeɛ bɛka bɛkyire bɛ ɔ. Yeti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">bɛnea de, nakoso bɛnea ye mbaen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">na betie, nakoso bɛnde yebo.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Afei, mvandoho ne ɛhe: Mmaa ne yeɛ ole Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Bɔ oguale atee noa ne yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛtele edwirɛ ne, ná Abɔnzam wale ɔɔyele edwirɛ ne fili b'ahone nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛngole bɛngoli na balɛ́ bɛ ngoa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Bɔ oguale nyɔboɛ so ne yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛte edwirɛ ne a, bɛfa anigye bɛsɔ nu ne. Nakoso ɛhemɔ lle ndii; yeti bedɛ bɛdi mmerɛ kaa, na sɛ beyia nzɔhwɛ a, bɛngora gyina. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Yeɛ bɔ oguale mmowie nu ne yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛte edwirɛ ne, nakoso mmerɛ kɔ so ne, asetena nu dadwene, ahonyadeɛ ne anigye mia bɛ, yeti bɛ mmaa ne ndi. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Na bɔ oguale aseɛ pa so ne, yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛte edwirɛ ne a, bɛfa ahone pa bɛsɔ nu yé, ná bɛfa aboterɛ besu mmaa ne.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔsɔ kanea a, ɔfa nikye kata so anaa ɔfa wura mba bo ɔ, mmom ɔfa sie kanea bakaa so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala bɔ ɔkowura awuro berɛ ne konwu kanea ne. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ wafea bɔ ye nwo ngɔla berɛ; na nikye fee nne berɛ bɔ bafa basie fee bɔ ongofite ma ebiala ngonwu ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ ɛmɔtie edwirɛ ne yé, ofikyɛ bɔ ole bie ne, bɛkɔfa pee bɛkɔboka ye so, na bɔ olle bie ne de, bɔ y'adwene yɛ ye kyɛ ole ye ne po, bɛkole bɛkofi ye sa nu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Yeɛ ye maame ne oliema mmrienzua wale ye berɛ, nakoso mmeni lɔen nati bangora bamma nekaa bɔ ɔwɔ ne. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Na ebiemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ maame ne eliema mɔ gyi aluo dɔ, bɛpena kyɛ bɛnwu wɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me maame ne nniema mɔ yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ betie Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne, na bɛfa bɛyɛ adwuma ne.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ɛlɛho bie, ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fole ɛlɛen, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma yɛpɛ ɛkwaa ne yɛhɔ ye si dɔ.” Yeti bɛsili nu kyɛ bɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Bɛnate nzue naso ne, ɔfale nu lale. Na mvrama kandinga bie hyɛle yebo tuli wɔ ɛkwaa naso, na nzue ne bu fale bɛ ɛlɛen naso maa ahaa ɔpena mono. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Yeti, bɛtingyele ye, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Owura, Owura! Yawu yayie oo!” Na odwɔso teɛteane mvrama ne asorɔkye bɔ obu fa so ne, na yenoa hɔle ase, na ɛberɛ yɛle dinn. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ gyidie ne wɔ nisɔa?” Nakoso esuronyi hane bɛ, na ɔyɛle bɛ nwanwa maa bɛbisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Sona beni po ɛhe, bɔ ɔkora dwudwo kyire mvrama ne nzue po maa betie ye ne?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Na bɛpɛ bɛhɔle Gerasafoɛ aseɛ naso, ɛberɛ ne Galilea bɔ nhwɛ-anim. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu dwuli ase nala pɛ, biaa bie yiale ye, né ole sunzummɔne, na né ofi kuro berɛ ala. Né owurale atadeɛ ahyɛ paa, afei ne ɔtte awuro, mmom né ɔte asieleɛ naso. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Onwuni Yesu nala, oteane nu fale ye nyunu butule ase, na ɔteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Yesu, Nyameɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Anwuro-Anwuro ne Awa, nzu yeɛ ɔwɔ mene wɔ afia ɔ? Mesrɛ wɔ, nnɛha me.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />(Né Yesu aha ahyire sunzummɔne ne kyɛ ofi biaa ne nu. Né honhom ne taa bawura ye nu. Yeti ne bɛtaa bɛfa kyenyi bɛkyekye ye sa ne ye gya, na ne bɛnea ye so. Nakoso ɔtete kyenyi nanu, na honhom ne fa ye kowura nekaa bɔ ebiala nne berɛ.)<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu bisale ye kyɛ, wɔ dumaa li sɛɛ? Ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛlɔen,” ofikyɛ sunzummɔne pee yeɛ né ɔwɔ ye nu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Na sunzummɔne nemɔ srɛle Yesu alaa kyɛ, nnɛmaa ɔhyɛ bɛ maa bɛkogua kumaa kuron-kuron nanu. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ne, né mbrako pee bie didi wɔ bokaa ne ngyɛnu dɔ, na bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔma bɛɛwura mbrako nanu. Yeti ɔmane bɛ atee. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Yeɛ sunzummɔne nemɔ fili biaa nanu bɛɛwurale mbrako nanu ɔ, na mbrako nemɔ fale mirika fili bokaa naso beeguale nzue nanu, na bɛwuli.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Bɛ bɔ bɛnea mbrako ne nwuni bɔ wasi ne, bɛnwatili bɛɛhane bɔ wasi ne wɔ kuro ne, ɔne ye nnamue nemɔ nu. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Yeti mmenia hɔle kyɛ bɛkwaanea bɔ wasi ne. Bɛwale Yesu berɛ ne, bɛnwuni biaa bɔ sunzummɔne nemɔ fili ye nu ne kyɛ ɔte Yesu gya bo, na owura atadeɛ, na y'adwene nu la berɛ ne, ɛhe maa esuronyi hane bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bɛ bɔ bɛnwuni ye ne hane kyɛbɔ biaa bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ye so ne nwo tɔle ye ne hyirele bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛfi Gerasa mandanu berɛ nanu pee ha hyirele Yesu kyɛ, ofi bɛ berɛ hɔ, ofikyɛ ne esuronyi aha bɛ paa. Yeti ɔɔfole ɛlɛen ne kyɛ osa kɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Biaa bɔ sunzummɔne nemɔ fili ye nu ne srɛle Yesu kyɛ ɔne ye kɔhɔ, nakoso Yesu maa osale, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Sa kɔ w'awuro, na ka bɔ Nyameɛ ayɛ ama wɔ ne kyire bɛ.” Yeti ɔhɔle, na ɔhane bɔ Yesu ayɛ ama ye ne wɔ kuro nanu mukoraati.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu sa wale ne, mmenia ne lɛle ye kama, ofikyɛ ne bɛ mukoraati bɛnwondɛ ye. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Na biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yairo wale ye berɛ, né ɔte panyi wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. Na ɔkotole Yesu gya bo srɛle ye kyɛ ɔbra ye awuro berɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ofikyɛ ɔwa brasua komapɛ, bɔ wali kɔyɛ afoɛ 12 la awuso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu kɔ ne, né mmenia ahyere ye so paa. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Né brasua bie bɔ mogya atu ye afoɛ 12 wɔ berɛ, na né ebiala ngora nza ye anwonyerɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ɔfale Yesu si, na ɔfale ye sa hane ye atadeɛ ne noa ne, na ɛberɛ ala mogya ne pɛle. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔfale ye sa hane me ne?” Ebiala hane kyɛ nná ye ɔ, yeti Petro hane kyɛ: “Me wura, mmeni pee apɛ wɔ nwo ayia, na bahyere wɔ so.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Nakoso Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ebie afa ye sa aha me, menwu ye kyɛ tumi afi me nu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Maame ne nwuni kyɛ banwu ye ne, ɔfale ahopopo buli ndwerɛ wɔ Yesu nyunu hane bɔ ɔmaa ɔfale ye sa hane ye namukoraati, ɔne kyɛbɔ ɛberɛ ala ye nwo tɔle ye ne wɔ mmenia nanu. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mma brasua, wɔ gyidie amaa wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ, fa asomdwie kɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ogu so odwudwo ne, ebie fili Yairo awuro berɛ wale, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛwa brasua ne awu, nnɛha kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne kõ.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu tele ɛhe ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Nnɛsuro, wɔ de nya gyidie, na ye nwo kɔtɔ ye.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ɔhɔle awuro berɛ ne, Petro, Yohane, Yakobo ne akwalaa ne maame ne ye baba ngome yeɛ ɔne bɛwurale sua nanu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Né ebiala su akwalaa ne, na ne bɛpɛ awuye, nakoso Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔyakyi sue, ofikyɛ akwalaa ne wulli, wala.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bɛtele ɛhe ne, né bɛla ayanga, ofikyɛ ne bɛse kyɛ akwalaa ne awu. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Nakoso ɔsɔle ye sa nu, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Abayaa, dwɔso!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Na ye ngoa sa wale ye nu, na ɛberɛ ala ɔdwɔsole. Na ɔhane kyɛ bɛma ye aleɛ ma oli. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ye awofo nwo dwirili bɛ paa, nakoso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛka bɔ wasi ne bɛkyire ebiala.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yeɛ Yesu frɛle asuafoɛ 12 ne maa beyiale, na ɔmane bɛ tumi ne anwoserɛ bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔtu sunzummɔne mukoraati, ɔne tumi bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔsa anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Yeɛ ɔsomane bɛ kyɛ bɛɛha Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ, na bɛsa anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔfa hwee bɛtu atee ne; nnɛmɔfa pɔmaa, bɔtɔ, paanoo, sikaa anaa ndadeɛ nyɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Na awuro biala bɔ ɛmɔ kɔhɔ nu ne, ɛmɔtena berɛ ma oodwu kyɛ ɛmɔ kofi berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Na nekaa biala bɔ banne ɛmɔ ne, sɛ ɛmɔfi kuro nanu a, ɛmɔ poro-poro ɛmɔ gya bo mvuture bɛgua berɛ, ná wayɛ adanzeɛ wama bɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Na bɛsili nu bɛhɔle nguraa nemɔ anu bɛɛhane nzɛmba ne, na bɛsale anwonyerɛ wɔ nekaa biala.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Afei Herode bɔ odi manzini naso ne tele bɔ osisi namukoraati, na ɔbɔle ye pusa, ofikyɛ né ebiemɔ ka kyɛ Yohane adwɔso afi ewue nu, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />né ebiemɔ koso nwa, Elia yeɛ wawa ne, yeɛ ebie koso nwa, tete adiifoɛ nanu kõ yeɛ wadwɔso ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herode hane kyɛ: “Yohane de, mapɛ ye ti. Ye de nwa yeɛ metete kyɛ ɔyɛ sɔ nningyein nemɔ ne?” Yeti né ɔpena kyɛ onwu ye.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Asomafoɛ ne sa wale ne, bɛhane nningyein bɔ bayɛ namukoraati bɛhyirele Yesu. Yeti ɔne bɛ hɔle kuro bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Betsaida nu, ná bɛɛwurale nekaa bie dinn. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Mmenia ne nwuni ye sɔ ne, bɛlili ye si, na ye koso olɛle bɛ kama, na ɔhane Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ hyirele bɛ, na ɔsale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Afei ne aleɛ sa, yeti buru-ne-nyɔ ne wale ye berɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Nekaa bɔ yɛwɔ ne ate ye nwo, yeti gua mmenia ne atee, ma bɛhɔ nguro ne nnamue bɔ wapɛ yɛ nwo wayia nanu bɛɛpena nekaa bɛla, na bɛpena aleɛ bɛli.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma bɛ nikye ma bɛli.” Na bɛhane kyɛ: “Aleɛ bɔ yɛle ye wa te paanoo nnu ne egyein nyɔ. Ye de sana yɛkɔtɔ aleɛ yɛbrɛ mmenia he amukoraati.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Mmrienzua ngome kɔyɛ 5,000 yeɛ ne bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma bɛtena ase kue-kue, kue biala yɛ mmenia kɔyɛ 50.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Na bɛyɛle ye sɔ maa ebiala tenane ase. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yeɛ ɔfale paanoo nnu ne egyein nyɔ ne, na ɔneane anwuro hyirale so. Afei obubuli paanoo nanu mane asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ, bɛfa bɛma mmenia ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bɛ mukoraati bɛdidili maa bɛ ko yili. Ná bɛsesale yebo mbo-poro-ka ne, benyane kɛndɛn buru ne nyɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ɛlɛho bie, né Yesu ngome wɔ nekaa bie ɔbɔ mbaeɛ, ná ye asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ye berɛ, yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Mmenia keka kyɛ, nde sona beni?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bɛyele yenoa kyɛ: “Ebiemɔ nwa wɔ yeɛ ɛle Yohane Suboniɛ ne; ebiemɔ nwa Elia, yeɛ ebiemɔ koso nwa tete adiifoɛ nanu kõ yeɛ wadwɔso ne.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yeɛ osa bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Na ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnwa nde sona beni?” Yeɛ Petro yele yenoa kyɛ: “Kristo, bɔ Nyameɛ asoma ye ne.” <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yeɛ ɔbrale bɛ kitii kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛbɔso bɛkyire ebiala, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />na ɔhane kyɛ: “Odikyɛ Sona Awa ne nwu amaneɛ paa, na mbanyi nemɔ ne sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ ye ye ma, maa bɛku ye, na ye ɛlɛsa naso ne, ɔkɔtingye.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ mukoraati kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ odi me si a, ma ɔpa ye nwo si, na ɔfa ye asɛnnua daa biala, ná oli me si. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔbɔ ye ngoa nwo waen ne, okofi ye sa, nakoso ebiala bɔ me ti, ye ngoa kofi ye sa ne, ye yeɛ ye sa kɔha ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Sɛ sona nya ewiase amukoraati, ná ye ngoa fi ye sa anaa ɔsɛkye a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Na sona biala bɔ ɔkɔfɛle me ne me dwirɛ nanwo ne, sɛ Sona Awa ne ba ye Baba ne abɔfo krongron ne anuonyam nu a, ye nwo kɔyɛ Sona Awa ne fɛle. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmenia biemɔ gyi wa bɔ bɛngonwu ewue, sana banwu Nyameɛ Ahennie ne kora.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ɔhane sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ si kɔyɛ ngyẽa mmɔtwɛ ne, ɔne Petro, Yohane ne Yakobo hɔle bokaa naso dɔ kyɛ bɛkwaabɔ mbaeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Na ogu so ɔbɔ mbaeɛ ne, ye nyunu sesane, na ye atadeɛ ne tale hyireinn. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Na nea, né mmrienzua nyɔ bie ne ye bɔ ngɔmmɔ—Mose ne Elia. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bɛwale anuonyam nu, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛhane ye hɔlɛ nanwo dwirɛ, ɛhene yeɛ ne ɔkɔwa nu wɔ Yerusalem ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Petro ne bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne ala hatee, bɛ nye so tele bɛ ne, bɛnwuni ye anuonyam ne, ɔne mmrienzua nyɔ bɔ ɔne bɛ gyi berɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Na mmerɛ bɔ mmrienzua nyɔ nemɔ fi ye nwo berɛ kɔ ne, Petro ha hyirele Yesu kyɛ: “Me wura, ɔte kama paa kyɛ yɛwɔ wa. Ma yesi <char style="w">tɛnt</char> nza, wɔ deɛ kõ, Mose deɛ kõ, yeɛ Elia deɛ kõ”—né ɔnze bɔ ɔka po. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ogu so ɔka sɔ dwirɛ ne, munungum bie katale bɛ so, munungum ne katale bɛ so ne, né bɛsuro. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Afei, konviɛ bie fili munungum nanu hane kyɛ: “Ɛhe yeɛ ole mma bɔ maye ye ne. Ɛmɔtie ye.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Konviɛ ne si ne, Yesu ngome yeɛ bɛnwuni kyɛ ogyi berɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Aleɛ hene ne, bɛfili bokaa ne aso bedwuli ase, na mmenia somaa bie yiale ye. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ná biaa bie teane nu wɔ mmenia nanu kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, mesrɛ wɔ, nea mma ne, ofikyɛ ɔte mma komapɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nea! ɛyɛ a ne sunzummɔne awa ye so, ɔba sɔ a, ɔteanu komapɛ, na ɔpɛ ye fi ase maa ɔsenze, na ye noa pu ahure. Na sɛ opira ye yie po a, ɛyɛ a né ɔyɛ se kyɛ okofi ye nu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nzrɛle w'asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ bɛtu bɛfi ye nu, nakoso bangora.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ao, ɛnɛ mmerɛ mmenia bɔ bɛlle gyidie na bɛ so yɛ se, mene ɛmɔtena na nya ɛmɔ nwo aboterɛ maa oodwu kyẽa beni? Fa ɛwa ne bra.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mmerɛ bɔ akwalaa ne pingye Yesu ne, sunzum ne maa ɔpɛ fini na ɔsenzene. Nakoso Yesu hwili sunzummɔne ne nyunu na ɔsale akwalaa ne anwonyerɛ, yeɛ ɔfale ye mane ye baba ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Na Nyameɛ tumi pirikua ne maa mmenia namukoraati nwo dwirili bɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Na mmerɛ bɔ nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ ne yɛle mmenia namukoraati nwanwa ne, ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Ɛmɔma sɔ dwirɛ he la ɛmɔ ti anu paa, ofikyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ ne bafa Sona Awa ne bawura mmenia sa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Nakoso bande edwirɛ bɔ ɔhane ne bo. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, né bafa bafea bɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛngɔte yebo, nakoso ne bɛsuro kyɛ bɛkobisa ye nwo dwirɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Na asuafoɛ nemɔ suli aporowaa paa, ne bɛpena kyɛ bɛnwu bɔ ɔte piri wɔ bɛ nu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ne Yesu anwu adwene bɔ ɔwɔ b'ahone nu ɔ, yeti ɔfale akwalaa bie gyinane ye nwo berɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ me dumaa ti, ɔkole sɔ akwalaa he ne, wale me; na ebiala bɔ okole me ne, wale bɔ ɔsomane me ne. Na bɔ ɔte kaa wɔ ɛmɔ nu ne, ye yeɛ ɔte piri ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohane hane kyɛ: “Me wura, yɛnwuni kyɛ ebie fa wɔ dumaa tu sunzummɔne, na né yɛpena kyɛ yɛsi ye atee, ofikyɛ ɔbokka yɛbɔ yɛli wɔ si naso.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔsi ye atee, ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔndwɔso ndia ɛmɔ ne, né ɔta ɛmɔ si.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Na ɔwale kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ odikyɛ bɛfa ye bɛkɔ anwuro ne pena pingye ne, ɔfale ye nye hyirele Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Yeti ɔsomane ebiemɔ kyɛ bɛli ye nyunu moa. Na bɛhɔle Samaria nnamue bie nu, kyɛ bɛ kwaasiesie berɛ bɛma ye. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Nakoso banne ye, ofikyɛ ne ye nye kyire Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Na mmerɛ bɔ Yakobo ne Yohane bɔ bɛte ye asuafoɛ ne nwuni ye sɔ ne, bɛhane kyɛ: “Awurade, ɛpena kyɛ yɛfrɛ see yɛfi anwuro maa ɔbayera bɛ hɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Nakoso ɔkakyile ye nwo hwili bɛ nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Na bɛtoale so bɛhɔle nnamue foforɛ nu.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Bɛnate atee so bɛkɔ ne, ebie ha hyire ye kyɛ: “Nekaa bɔ ɛkɔhɔ biala, mene wɔ kɔhɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Na Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kangane mɔ le bɔen, na ewienu nnomaa le buye, nakoso Sona Awa ne de, olle nekaa bɔ ɔfa ye ti to ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele sona foforɛ kyɛ: “Di me si.” Nakoso ɔha hyirele Yesu kyɛ: “Awurade, ma nni moa ngɔnzie me baba kora.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ma awufo sie b'awufo. Na wɔ de, kɔbɔ Nyameɛ ahennie nanwo dawure.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Yeɛ sona foforɛ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, ngoli wɔ si, nakoso ma nni moa ngɔ ngra m'awurofoɛ kora.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ ɔfa ye sa sɔ buralɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛfundam aseɛ nanu, ná ɔnea nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ ye si ne, ɔmvata Nyameɛ Ahennie ne.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, Awurade yele asuafoɛ foforɛ 72,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ ne biemɔ nu a, ɔte 70.</char></note> na ɔsomane bɛ nyɔ-nyɔ lili ye nyunu hɔle kuro ne nekaa biala bɔ ye bɔbɔ ɔkɔ ne. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛboo nanu nningyein bɔ odikyɛ yɛpɛ ne sone, nakoso adwumayɛfoɛ ne te kaa. Yeti ɛmɔsrɛ ɛboo ne Wura ne kyɛ, ɔma adwumayɛfoɛ pee bra, ná bɛɛpɛ bie. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Ɛmɔhɔ; ɛmɔnea, mesoma ɛmɔ kyɛ mmoan mekɔ mbataku nu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Nnɛmɔfa sikaa bɔtɔ, aleɛ anaa mmaboa, na nnɛmɔ gyina atee so bɛkyea ebiala. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Awuro biala bɔ ɛmɔ kowura nu ne, ɛmɔha kyɛ: ‘Asomdwie bra awuro he anu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Sɛ ebie bɔ okuro asomdwie wɔ berɛ a, ɛmɔ asomdwie kɔtena ye so, nakoso sɛ ebie nne berɛ a, ɛmɔ asomdwie kosa kɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Ɛmɔtena sɔ awuro nanu, na bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔma ɛmɔ biala ne, ɛmɔli, na ɛmɔ no. Ofikyɛ ebie yɛ adwuma a, ye akatua fata ye. Nnɛmɔ fi awuro kõ anu bɛkɔ foforɛ nu.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />“Afei koso, sɛ ɛmɔwura kuro bie nu na bedɛ ɛmɔ a, ɛmɔli bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkosie ɛmɔ nyunu ne. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Ɛmɔsa bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ nu ne anwonyerɛ, na ɛmɔha behyire bɛ kyɛ: ‘Nyameɛ Ahennie ne apingye ɛmɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Na sɛ ɛmɔwura kuro bie nu na banne ɛmɔ a, ɛmɔfi nu bɛhɔ ye atee naso, na ɛmɔha kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Ɛmɔ kuro nanu mvuture bɔ wagua yɛ gya bo ne, yɛ poro-poro yɛgua ɛmɔ so. Nakoso ɛmɔkaye kyɛ, Nyameɛ Ahennie ne apingye.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɔ kyẽa ne, bɔ ɔkɔto sɔ kuro ne, Sodom deɛ ne po te kaa.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Due Korasin, Due Betsaida, ofikyɛ anwanwadeɛ bɔ bayɛ ye wɔ wɔ nu ne, sɛ bɛyɛle ye wɔ Tiro ne Sidon a, ahaa basakra bahra brisie batena nzoen nu dada. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Na atemmuda ne, bɔ ɔkɔto ɛmɔ ne, Tiro ne Sidon deɛ ne po te kaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na wɔ Kapernaum, bɛkɔfa wɔ bɛkɔhɔ anwuro hɔ? Nea kumaa nu yeɛ ɛkosa kɔhɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />“Ebiala bɔ otie ɛmɔ ne, watie me. Na ebiala bɔ obu ɛmɔ animtia ne, wabu me animtia. Afei, ebiala bɔ obu me animtia ne, obu bɔ ɔsomane me ne animtia.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Asuafoɛ 72 ne fale anigye wale, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Awurade, wɔ dumaa bɔ yɛbɔle nati, sunzummɔne mɔ po brɛle bɛ nwo ase mane yɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Na Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Manwu kyɛ Satan fi anwuro afi ase te kyɛ agralaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Nea, mama ɛmɔ tumi kyɛ ɛmɔ tietia ɛwoo ne anyanyangyeleɛ mɔ po so, na mama ɛmɔ tumi bɔ ɛmɔ kɔfa bɛkoli ɔtamfo naso ɔ, na nikye fee ngɔyɛ ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Nakoso nnɛmɔ di ahurusi kyɛ honhom mɔ po abrɛ bɛ nwo ase ama ɛmɔ, mmom ɛmɔli ahurusi kyɛ bahworɔ ɛmɔ dumaa wɔ anwuro.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ala, honhom krongron wale Yesu so, na ye nye gyele paa maa ɔhane kyɛ: “Baba, anwuro ne aseɛ Wura, meye wɔ ayɛ wɔ badwanu, ofikyɛ afa ɛhe afea anyanzafoɛ ne animdefoɛ, na aye ye ali ahyire ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa. O Baba, ɔte nahorɛ, ofikyɛ ɛhe yeɛ ɔsɔ wɔ nye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Me Baba afa nikye biala awura me sa, na ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔse kyɛbɔ Baa ne te ɔ, sana Baba ne, yeɛ ebiala nze kyɛbɔ Baba ne te ɔ, sana Baa ne, ɔne ebiala bɔ Baa ne pena kyɛ ɔye ye ali kyire ye ne.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yeɛ ɔkakyile ye nye hyirele asuafoɛ ne ha hyirele bɛ ngome kyɛ: “Anigye yeɛ ole anyeɛ bɔ onwu bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye ne. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ofikyɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, né adiifoɛ ne ahemvo pee pena kyɛ bɛnwu bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye ne, nakoso bannwu ye; na ne bɛpena kyɛ bɛte bɔ ɛmɔte ne, nakoso bannde.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Afei nea, ebie bɔ ɔse mmeraa nanu paa dwɔso gyinane kyɛ ɔbaasɔ ye nea, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, nzu yeɛ meyɛ a, ngonya daa ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ bahworɔ ye wɔ mmeraa nanu ɔ? Ɛkenga a, yenwa nzɛ?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Yeɛ ɔyele ye noa kyɛ: “ ‘Odikyɛ ɛfa w'ahone mukoraati, wɔ kra mukoraati, w'anwoserɛ mukoraati, ne w'adwene mukoraati dɔ Awurade wɔ Nyameɛ’ na ‘odikyɛ ɛdɔ wɔ mmango te kyɛ wɔ nwo.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Apɛ; yɛ ɛhe na ekonya ngoa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Nakoso ne ɔpena kyɛ obu ye nwo bem, yeti obisale Yesu kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔte me mmango ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu mane ye mmuayɛ kyɛ: “Né biaa bie fi Yerusalem ɔtro kɔ Yeriko, na ɔɔtɔle awiefoɛ nu maa bɛyele ye ndadeɛ mukoraati bɛbole ye bɛyakyile ye berɛ bɛhɔle, bɔ né wawu wayie. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Na bɔ ɔwale yeɛ ole kyɛ, né sɔfo bie nate sɔ atee naso, onwuni ye ne, ɔfale nekaa bie hɔle. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Lewiniɛ bie koso fale berɛ, onwuni ye ne, ɔfale nekaa bie hɔle. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Nakoso Samarianiɛ bie bɔ otu atee fitele biaa naso, ye nye bɔle ye so ne, ɔyɛle ye anwunvo. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Yeti ɔhɔle ye nwo berɛ, na ɔfale ngoo ne nzãa guale ye kena nanu, yeɛ ɔkyekyele so ɔ. Oyiele ne, ɔfale ye tole ye bɔbɔ ye kaka so fale ye hɔle ɛwɔfoɛ sua bie nu ɔɔneane ye. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Aleɛ hene ne, ɔyele dɛnare nyɔ mane sona bɔ ɔnea ɛwɔfoɛ sua naso ne, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Nea ye, na kerɛ biala bɔ ye si ne ɛkɔbɔ ne, meba a, ngotua ngɔma wɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Sɔ mmenia nza he, ɛnea a nwa yeɛ ohyirele kyɛ ɔte biaa bɔ awiefoɛ bole ye ne mmango ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ɔhane kyɛ: “Bɔ onwuni ye anwunvo ne.” Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ koso kɔ, na kɔyɛ sɔ ala.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛnate atee so bɛkɔ ne, ɔhɔle nnamue bie nu, na maame bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Marta lɛle ye hɔle ye awuro. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Né oliema brasua bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Mary wɔ berɛ, na ye de, né ɔte Awurade gya bo, na ne otie ye ngyerɛkyerɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Nakoso Marta de, né adwuma pee alɛ́ ye adwene. Yeti ɔhɔle Yesu berɛ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, ɛnnwu ye kyɛ nniema ne ayakyi nikye biala abɔ me so ne? Ka kyire ye kyɛ ɔɔboka me.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Nakoso Awurade ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Marta, Marta, ɛdwene soma, na ɛfa nningyein pee ha wɔ nwo soma, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />nakoso enu kaa bie yeɛ ye nwo hia ɔ. Mary de, wafa nikye pa ne, na bɛngole bɛngofi ye sa nu lle.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ɛlɛho bie, né Yesu wɔ nekaa bie ɔbɔ mbaeɛ, oyiele ne, ye asuafoɛ nanu kõ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, kyire yɛ kyɛbɔ bɛbɔ mbaeɛ, kyɛbɔ Yohane hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ne.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ a, ɛmɔha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Baba, wɔ dumaa nwo te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">W'Ahennie bra.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Ma yɛ aleɛ bɔ yɛkoli ye daa biala.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Na fa yɛ bɔne kyɛ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ofikyɛ yɛ koso yafa ebiala bɔ wayɛ yɛ bɔne ne deɛ yahyɛ ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Afei, nnɛfa yɛ kɔ nzɔhwɛ nu.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Yɛfa ye kyɛ ɛmɔ nu bie hɔle ye damvo berɛ kɔngɔen tumm, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, ‘Me damvo, mesrɛ wɔ ma me paanoo nza, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />ofikyɛ me damvo bie fi akwanduo nu awa, ná nnne hwee bɔ ngɔfa ngɔma ye ɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Yeɛ ebia ye damvo ne ha hyirele ye wɔ sua nanu dɔ kyɛ, ‘Nnɛha me! Yato anoa nanu dada, na me ne me mmaa mɔ ala. Mengɔhora dwɔso né maama wɔ hwee.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɔhale kyɛ ɔte ye damvo mbaen a, ahaa ɔngɔtɛ ye so, nakoso ɔnate kyɛ ɔhɔle so hale ye adwene nati, ɔdwɔso fale bɔ ohia ne mane ye.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Yeti meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔhɔ so bɛ bisa, na bɛkɔfa bɛkɔma ɛmɔ; ɛmɔhɔ so bɛpena, na ɛmɔ konwu ye; na ɛmɔhɔ so bɛbɔnu, na bɛkɔbukye ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔkɔso bisa ne, ye sa ka ye, na ebiala bɔ ɔkɔso pena ne, onwu ye, na ebiala bɔ ɔkɔso bɔnu ne, bɛbukye ye. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ ɔte baba, na sɛ ɔwa brienzua srɛ ye egyein a, ɔkɔfa ɛwoo kɔma ye, ná ɔngɔma ye egyein ɔ; <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />anaa ɔsrɛ ye kyiremvua a, ɔkɔma ye anyanyangyeleɛ ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte abɔnefoɛ ne po, sɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ odikyɛ ɛmɔfa nikye pa bɛma ɛmɔ mmaa mɔ a, ye de nea kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne kɔfa ye honhom krongron kɔma bɛ bɔ bɛbisa ye ne ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Ɛlɛho bie, né Yesu tu sunzummɔne bie bɔ ɔte ɛmumu. Sunzum ne fili ye nu nala pɛ, ɛmumu ne dwudwole maa ɔyɛle mmenia namukoraati nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Nakoso bɛ nu biemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ɔnate sunzummɔne panyi bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Beelsebul naso yeɛ otu sunzummɔne ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Né ebiemɔ koso pena kyɛ bɛsɔ ye bɛnea, yeti bɛhane kyɛ ɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ofi anwuro ma bɛnea. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ne Yesu se adwene bɔ ɔwɔ bɛ ti anu, yeti ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ahennie biala bɔ ɔkõ tia ye nwo ne, okogu, na awuro biala bɔ ɔkõ tia ye nwo ne, ɔkɔbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Sɛ Satan kõ tia ye nwo a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ye ahennie ne agyina? Nnaa ɛmɔnwa nnate Beelsebul so yeɛ metu sunzummɔne ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Sɛ Beelsebul tumi yeɛ mefa metu sunzummɔne a, ye de tumi beni yeɛ ɛmɔ mmaa nemɔ fa tu bɛ ɔ? Ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛkobu ɛmɔ atɛn ne. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Nakoso sɛ nnate Nyameɛ sa so yeɛ metu sunzummɔne a, ye de, Nyameɛ Ahennie ne asã ɛmɔ nwo.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Sɛ ebie bɔ ole anwoserɛ, na ole akodeɛ ɔbɔ ye awuro nwo waen a, ye agyapadeɛ ne kõ po ngomini. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Nakoso sɛ ebie bɔ ole anwoserɛ tra ye ba ye so, na odi ye so ngunim a, ɔkɔfa ye akodeɛ bɔ wafa ye nwo wato so ne, na ɔne ebiemɔ kɔhyɛ nningyein bɔ onya fili ye berɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Ebiala bɔ ɔbboka me so ne, ɔdwɔso tia me, na ebiala bɔ ɔne me mmoaboa ye noa ne, ɔbɔ sande.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Sɛ sunzummɔne fi ebie nu a, okyini ɛtii so pena nekaa bɔ ɔkɔtena ɔ; wannya bie a, ɔka kyɛ, ‘Ngosa ngɔhɔ me sua bɔ mvili nu nanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Na ɔkɔwa ne, né baprapra sua nanu basiesie nu kama. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Yeti, ɔkɔfa honhom nzoo bɔ bɛ ti anu yɛ se tra ye boka ye nwo so, ná baatena berɛ. Ɔba sɔ a, sona ne awieɛ ne sɛkye koraa tra daa ne.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ogu so ɔka ɛhemɔ ne, maame bie mane ye konvi so wɔ mmenia nanu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Anigye yeɛ ole koɛ bɔ ɛlale nu, ɔne nyɔfone bɔ ɛnone ne.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Nakoso Yesu hane kyɛ: “Daabi, mmom anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ betie Nyameɛ dwirɛ na bɛfa bɛyɛ adwuma ne.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Mmerɛ bɔ mmeni pee ba nekaa bɔ ɔwɔ ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.” </char></note> ne te nnipa-bɔnefoɛ! Bɛpena nzɛngyerɛneɛ, nakoso bɛngonya bie, sana Yona nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne ngome. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kyɛbɔ ne Yona te nzɛngyerɛneɛ ma Ninewifoɛ nemɔ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ Sona Awa ne kɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ kɔma mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ ne ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Atemmuda ne, ngwan dɔ hemaa ne né mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.”</char></note> ne kɔdwɔso, na okobu sɔ mmenia hemɔ fɔ, ofikyɛ ofili aseɛ ne noa dɔ wale, na ootiele Solomon nyanza, nakoso nea, bɔ ɔtra Solomon wɔ wa. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Atemmuda ne, Ninewifoɛ ne mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ ɛnɛ ne kɔdwɔso, na bɛkobu mmenia hemɔ fɔ, ofikyɛ Yona dwirɛ ne maa bɛsakrale, nakoso nea, bɔ ɔtra Yona wɔ wa.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔsɔ kanea yie a, ɔfa kɔfea nekaa bie anaa ɔfa wura kɛndɛn bo ɔ, mmom ɔfa sie kanea bakaa so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala bɔ okowura berɛ ne konwu kanea ne ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Anyeɛ yeɛ ɔte nipadua ne kanea ɔ. Sɛ wɔ nye te pa a, wɔ nipadua namukoraati kɔta hyireinn, nakoso sɔ wɔ nye ttemaye a, wɔ nipadua namukoraati kɔyɛ awosii. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Yeti, ɛmɔnea yé paa na kanea bɔ ɔwɔ ɛmɔ nu ne anyɛ awosii. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Sɛ wɔ nipadua namukoraati te kanea, ná nekafee nne awosii nu a, ɛkɔta hyireinn te kyɛ ɛnwa basɔ kanea ne.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu gu so odwudwo ne, Farisiniɛ bie srɛle ye kyɛ, ɔbra ma bɛdidi. Yeti ɔhɔle ye awuro kyɛ ɔkwaadidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Né ɔyɛ Farisifoɛ nemɔ nwanwa kyɛ wanni moa wannwunzi ye sa. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ Farisifoɛ hemɔ, ɛmɔnwunzi kwangoa ne kyɛnzee nwo, nakoso ɛmɔ nu de, asisie ne bɔne ngome. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mmenia bɔ ɛmɔlle adwene! Bɔ ɔyɛle nikye ne si ne, nná ye ala yeɛ ɔyɛle ye kunu ne? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Sɛ ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛyɛ adɔyɛ a, nikye biala nwo kɔte kama.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ tua ɛmanyire, akokɔ-bɛsa, ne nikye biala bɔ ɔte sɔ naso taet, nakoso ɛmɔbu ɛmɔ nye bɛgua Nyameɛ atɛn tenenee ne ye dɔ so. Ɔwɔ nu, odikyɛ ɛmɔyɛ sɔ nningyein ne, nakoso nningyein bɔ ohia paa ne, ɔnzɛ kyɛ ɛmɔbu ɛmɔ nye bɛgua so. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔkuro bia pa wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, ɔne dwaaso ngyeaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ ayɛ kyɛ asieleɛ bɔ wafea, na mmenia fa so bɔ bɛnnwu ye ne.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Bɛ bɔ bɛse mmeraa paa nanu kõ hane kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, sɛ ɛka sɔ a, yɛ koso apɛ yɛ nzoaa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔse mmeraa nanu ne, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔfa nningyein bɔ enu yɛ nno bɛsoa mmenia, nakoso ɛmɔ bɔbɔ de, ɛmɔ mva ɛmɔ sa ba po bɛnga ye. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ɛmɔ yaakɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔto adiifoɛ nemɔ asieleɛ, nakoso ɛmɔ baba mɔ yeɛ bɛhuni bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Nikye biala kyire kyɛ, ɛmɔse bɔ ɛmɔ baba mɔ yɛle ne, na ɛmɔ ne bɛ yɛ adwene, ofikyɛ bɛ yeɛ bɛhuni bɛ ɔ, na ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔto bɛ asieleɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ Nyameɛ nyanza hane kyɛ, ‘Ngɔsoma adiifoɛ ne asomafoɛ ngɔhɔ bɛ berɛ, bɛkɔhu ebiemɔ, na batane ebiemɔ nye. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ɛhe ati, adiifoɛ bɔ bahwie bɛ mogya bagua fi mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle wiase ne, mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.”</char></note> ne kobu bɛ mogya nanwo atɛn, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />ofi Habel mogya so, ɔbaadwu Zakaria bɔ bɛhuni ye wɔ afɔleɛ bokyea ne nekaa krongron né afia berɛ ne mogya so.’ Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.”</char></note> ne kobu ye nwo atɛn.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔse mmeraa nanu ne, ɛmɔ yaakɔ! ofikyɛ ɛmɔ afa nimdeɛ nzafoa ne. Ɛmɔ ahɔ a, ɛmɔ ngɔ nu, na bɛ bɔ bɛkɔ nu ne koso, ɛmɔsi bɛ atee.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yeti ofili berɛ ne, atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ wale ye nwo berɛ pee, na bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛfa nzɛmmisa bɛtaataa ye, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />né bɛnea atee kyɛ, ɔkɔha edwirɛ bie maa bekonya ye.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Wangyɛ biala, mmeni pee boale bɛ noa, né bɛsone alaa ma ebie nnya nekaa po né wafa ye gya watia, ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ odwudwo ne, oli moa ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ Farisifoɛ mmɔka bɔ ɔte nyaatwom nanwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ bakata so bɔ ongofite, anaa wafea bɔ bɛngonwu ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Na edwirɛ biala bɔ ɛmɔkɔha ye wɔ awosii nu ne, bɛkɔte ye wɔ kanea nu, na bɔ ɛmɔha bɛguale ebie so anu ne, bɛkɔtea nu bɛkɔha ye wɔ sua ti afia.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Me damvo mɔ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, nnɛmɔ suro bɛ bɔ bɛku nipadua ne a, bɛngora bɛnyɛ hwee kõ ne. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Mmom mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu bɔ odikyɛ ɛmɔsuro ye ɔ: Ɛmɔsuro bɔ oku nipadua ne yie a, ole tumi bɔ ɔkora gyi to <char style="tl">Gehenna</char> ne. Amba, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛhe yeɛ ɛmɔsuro ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Nnaa bɛtɔne ngasa-nnomaa nnu bedɛ kaprɛ nyɔ? Nakoso bɛ nu komapɛ po nne berɛ, bɔ Nyameɛ wora fi ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Na nwiaa bɔ ogua ɛmɔ ti so ne po, waha ye mukoraati. Nnɛmɔ suro, ɛmɔ nwo hia tra ngasa-nnomaa pee.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔbɔ me dumaa wɔ mmenia nyunu ne, Sona Awa ne koso kɔbɔ ye dumaa wɔ Nyameɛ abɔfo nemɔ nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔka ye wɔ mmenia nyunu kyɛ ɔnze me ne, ngɔpo ye wɔ Nyameɛ abɔfo nemɔ nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Ebiala bɔ ɔkodwudwo kotia Sona Awa ne, bɛkɔfa bɛkɔhyɛ ye, nakoso ebiala bɔ ɔkɔha mmusue dwirɛ kotia honhom krongron ne de, bɛngɔfa bɛngɔhyɛ ye. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Sɛ bɛfa ɛmɔ bɛkɔ badwafoɛ, awaen nu mbanyi ne atumvoɛ ne nyunu a, nnɛmɔ ha ɛmɔ nwo bɛdwene kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ kɔye ɛmɔ noa anaa bɔ ɛmɔkɔha nwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Ofikyɛ sɔ mmerɛ nala, honhom krongron ne kohyire ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔha ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Yeɛ ebie hane ye wɔ mmenia nanu kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, ka kyire nniema ne, na ɔne me hyɛ agyapadeɛ ne.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ngya biaa, nwa yeɛ ɔyele me kyɛ mmu ɛmɔ atɛn, anaa nziesie ɛmɔ afia dwirɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ anyeborolɛ biala nwo, ofikyɛ sɛ ebie nya ye nwo maa ɔbo so po a, nná sɔ nningyein nanu yeɛ ye ngoa wɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Na ɔyɛle mvandoho bie hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sikaniɛ bie aseɛ suli mmaa paa, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />yeti ɔhane ye wɔ ye tianu kyɛ, ‘Kesaalae bɔ nnne nekafee bɔ ngɔfa m'aleɛ né ngogua ne, nzu yeɛ nyɛ ɔ?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Yeti ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Bɔ ngɔyɛ ɛhe: Ngodwiri sua daa bɔ mefa me nningyein megua nu ne ngogua, na masi mbiri, ɛberɛ yeɛ ngɔfa me hwiit ne me nningyein pa mukoraati ngogua ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ná maha mahyire me nwo kyɛ: “Ɛle nningyein pa pee bɔ ɛkoli ye afoɛ pee; yeti de wɔ nwomeɛ, didi, no, na gye wɔ nye.” ’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Yeɛ Nyameɛ ha hyirele ye kyɛ, ‘Kwasea, kɔngɔen he ala, bɛkole wɔ ngoa bɛkofi wɔ sa nu. Ye de nningyein bɔ aboa ye noa agua berɛ ne, nwa yeɛ ɔkɔyɛ ye deɛ ɔ?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ebiala bɔ ɔboɔboa ahonyadeɛ noa ma ye nwo, ná ɔtte sikaniɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nye so ne te ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Yeti meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, nnɛmɔ dwene ɛmɔ ngoa nwo kyɛ, nzu yeɛ yekoli ɔ, anaa ɛmɔ nipadua nwo kyɛ, nzu yeɛ yɛkowura ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ngoa nwo hia koraa tra aleɛ, na nipadua ne nwo hia koraa tra atadeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Ɛmɔnea kwaakwaadabi, bɛnyɛ boo, bɛmbɛ, ná belle pata anaa nekaa bɔ bɛfa aleɛ bɛgua ɔ, nakoso Nyameɛ ma bɛ aleɛ. Ɛmɔnnwu ye kyɛ, ɛmɔ nwo hia koraa tra nnomaa ne? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ ɔdwene dee a, ɔkɔhora kɔfa dɔnhwere komapɛ po, kɔboka ye ngoa so ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Sɛ ɛmɔngora bɛnyɛ sɔ nikye kamba he po a, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔha ɛmɔ nwo wɔ bɔ waha nanwo ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ flawa nyi ne: Bɛnyɛ adwuma, na bɛnnwo ɛtena, nakoso meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, anuonyam bɔ Solomon nyane ye namukoraati si ne, wanziesie ye nwo kyɛ ɛhemɔ nu kõ po. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Na sɛ Nyameɛ wura ndire bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ, na ɛhema bagyi bagua fonoo nu ne atadeɛ a, atadeɛ beni yeɛ ɔngɔhora ngɔfa ngowura ɛmɔ ɔ? Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ gyidie te kaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Yeti nnɛmɔ maa bɔ ɛmɔ koli ne bɔ ɛmɔ kɔno nwo adwene-dwene hyɛ ɛmɔ so, na nnɛmɔ ha ɛmɔ nwo wɔ ye nwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ofikyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ wiase nanu ne nye aboro ye nwo paa ne, na ɛmɔ Baba se kyɛ ɛmɔ hia sɔ nningyein nemɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Mmom ɛmɔpena Ye Ahennie ne, na ɔkɔfa sɔ nningyein nemɔ kɔboka so kɔma ɛmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mmoan kue kamba, nnɛmɔ suro, ofikyɛ ɔyɛ ɛmɔ Baba ne fɛ kyɛ, ɔkɔfa Ahennie ne kɔma ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Ɛmɔtɔne nningyein bɔ ɛmɔle ye, ná ɛmɔyɛ ahiafoɛ adɔyɛ; ɛmɔyɛ sikaa bɔtɔ bɔ ɔnzɛkye bɛfa, kyire kyɛ, agyapadeɛ bɔ onyie lle wɔ anwuro, nekaa bɔ awiefoɛ mma berɛ, ná mvrɔlɔ koso nni ne. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ofikyɛ, nekaa bɔ ɛmɔ agyapadeɛ wɔ ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛmɔ ahone koso wɔ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Ɛmɔyɛ krado, ɛmɔsiesie ɛmɔ nwo, na ɛmɔma ɛmɔ kanea ne hɔso ta. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Ɛmɔyɛ kyɛ mmrienzua bɔ bɛnwondɛ bɛ wura bɔ ɔkwaayɛ ayeforɔ ne, kyɛbɔ ɔbadwu na ɔbɔ anoa nanu a, ɛberɛ nala bekobukye ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Anigye yeɛ ole ngoaa bɔ bɛ wura kɔɔto bɛ kyɛ betɛ́ nwondɛ ne. Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛ wura ne bɔbɔ kosiesie ye nwo, ná wamaa ngoaa ne atena tɛbulu nwo, na wasõ bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Sɛ ɔba kɔngɔen tumm anaa alobahene po, na ɔbato sɔ ngoaa nemɔ kyɛ bɛnwondɛ a, bekonya anigye. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Nakoso ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, sɛ né efiewura ne se mmerɛ bɔ awieniɛ ne kɔwa a, ahaa okosi pɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, awieniɛ ne ngonya atee ngowura ye awuro berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Yeti ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔyɛ krado, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nye nne so ne, yeɛ Sona Awa ne kɔwa ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Yeɛ Petro bisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, edwirɛ bɔ ɛka ne, ɛka kyire yɛ ngome, anaa ɛka kyire ebiala?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Awurade ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Akoaa beni yeɛ odi nahorɛ na ɔse nworɛ, bɔ ye wura afa ye awuro awura ye sa kyɛ ɔma ye ngoaa aleɛ wɔ mmerɛ bɔ ɔsɛ nu ne? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Anigye yeɛ ole akoaa bɔ ye wura kɔwa kɔɔto ye kyɛ ogu so ɔyɛ sɔ ne. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɔkɔfa bɔ ole ye biala kowura ye sa. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Nakoso sɛ ɔkɔba kyɛ akoaa ne ka ye wɔ ye ahone nu kyɛ, ‘Me Wura mia onya walle,’ ná ɔhyɛ yebo bo ngoaa bɔ baha ne, odidi, ɔno nzãa, na ɔbo a, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />kyẽa bɔ ye nye nne ye nwo so, ɔne mmerɛ bɔ ɔnze ne, yeɛ ye wura ne kɔwa ɔ; na ɔkɔhwe ye so paa, ná wafa ye waboka bɛ bɔ benni nahorɛ naso.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Akoaa bɔ ɔse ye wura ne apɛdeɛ, nakoso wanyɛ krado anaa wanyɛ bɔ ye wura ne kuro ne, bɛkɔbo ye pa-pa. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Nakoso akoaa bɔ ɔnze, ná ɔyɛle nikye bɔ odikyɛ bɛbo ye ne, bɛkɔbo ye kaa bie. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ bama ye pee ne, bɛkobisa pee bɛkofi ye berɛ, na bɔ bafa pee bawura ye sa ne, bɛkole pee bɛkofi ye berɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Mmale kyɛ mebaasɔ see wɔ aseɛ so, na ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa basɔ ye dada. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Nne asu bie mebɔ, na me nwo tete me tonn kodwu kyɛ ngɔbɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ asomdwie yeɛ mva mmale aseɛ he aso ɔ? Daabi oo, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, mbakye–mbakye–muɛ yeɛ mva mmale ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, sɛ mmenia nnu te awuro kõ nu a, bɛ nu kɔpakye–pakye; mmenia nza kɔdwɔso kotia nyɔ ne, na nyɔ ne adwɔso atia nza ne. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Bɛ nu kɔkyekyɛ, baba kɔdwɔso kotia ɔwa brienzua, na baa brienzua adwɔso atia ye baba, maame kɔdwɔso kotia ɔwa brasua, na baa brasua adwɔso atia ye maame, sia brasua kɔdwɔso kotia ye sia, na sia ne koso adwɔso atia ye sia brasua.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele mmenia ne kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ nzue amuna wɔ nekaa bɔ eyia kɔtɔ ne a, ɛberɛ ala ɛmɔka kyɛ, ‘Nzue kandinga bie baatɔ,’ na amba, ɔtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Na sɛ mvrama bɔ fi ngwan a, ɛmɔka kyɛ, ‘Ahuhuro kɔwa,’ na ɔba koso. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Nyaatwomfoɛ, ɛmɔ kora bɛnea ewienu ne aseɛ so, ná ɛmɔ anwu bɔ okosi ɔ. Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔnnea mmerɛ bɔ yɛwɔ nu ne, na ɛmɔ nga bɔ okosi ne?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Ye de, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔnnwu nikye pa bɔ odikyɛ ɛmɔyɛ ne? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Sɛ ebie fa wɔ kɔ kɔɔto a, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nate atee so ɛmɔkɔ ne, bɔ mmɔden kyɛ ɛne ye kosiesie ɛmɔ afia, wanyɛ sɔ a, ɔkɔfa wɔ kɔma temmufoɛ ne, ná temmufoɛ ne koso afa wɔ awura bɔ ɔnea berɛ ne sa, ná ye koso wafa wɔ wato prizin. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, sɛ etualle kerɛ namukoraati a, bengɔye wɔ maa ɛngɔhɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nanu bie hane Galileafoɛ bɔ Pilato fale bɛ mogya bɔle afɔleɛ nanwo dwirɛ hyirele Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Galileafoɛ bɔ bɛnwuni sɔ amaneɛ ne, ɛmɔnea a, né bɛte abɔnefoɛ bɛtra Galileafoɛ bɔ baha namukoraati? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɔtte sɔ. Na sɛ ɛmɔ anzakra a, ɛmɔ koso bɛkɔsɛkye ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Anaa mmenia 18 bɔ Siloam aborosaen ne bu guale bɛ so ne, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ bɛte abɔnefoɛ bɛtra Yerusalemfoɛ mukoraati hɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɔtte sɔ koraa. Na sɛ ɛmɔ anzakra a, ɛmɔ koso bɛkɔsɛkye ɛmɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yeɛ Yesu yɛle mvandoho bie hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ne biaa bie le borɔdoma wɔ ye bobe boo nu. Ɔhɔle kyɛ ɔkɔnea sɛ okonya mmaa wɔ so a, nakoso ɔhɔle ne, né hwee nne so. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Yeti ɔha hyirele bɔ ɔnea ɛboo naso ne kyɛ, ‘Afoɛ nza ɛhe, meba wa biala kyɛ mebaapena mmaa wɔ sɔ borɔdoma he aso a, mennya bie. Yeti, bu ye to! Nzuati yeɛ odikyɛ odɛ m'aseɛ ne bɔ so ɔ?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Yeɛ bɔ ɔnea ɛboo naso ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ, ‘Me wura, ma ogyina berɛ afoɛ kõ boka so, ngɔtutu ye bo, na mafa fɛtelaza magua ye bo. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Sɛ afoɛ bieku osu mmaa a, ye de pa nekaa ɔ. Na sɛ wanzu a, ɛkɔhora kobu ye kɔto.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Homeda bie, né Yesu yɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Né maame bie wɔ berɛ bɔ sunzummɔne afa anwonyerɛ ato ye so afoɛ buru ne mmɔtwɛ. Né yenu akondo, yeti ne ɔngora yenu tengyɛ koraa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu nwuni ye ne, ɔfrɛle ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Maame, male wɔ mafi wɔ anwonyerɛ nanu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yeɛ ɔfale ye sa tole ye so, na ɛberɛ nala, ɔtengyɛle yenu, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔye Nyameɛ ayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Nakoso, né ɔyɛ bɔ ɔnea sua bɔ beyia nu naso né ahi kyɛ Yesu asa anwonyerɛ homeda. Yeti ɔha hyirele mmenia ne kyɛ: “Ɛlɛsia yeɛ odikyɛ yɛfa yɛyɛ adwuma ɔ, yeti ɛyɛ a ɛmɔbra ma bɛsa ɛmɔ anwonyerɛ sɔ ngyẽa nemɔ, ná ɔtte homeda ne.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Nyaatwomfoɛ, sɛ odwu homeda a, nnaa ɛmɔ nu biala sangye ye nandwie anaa ye afunum fi buye nu kɔma ye nzue, melaka? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ye de, bɔne beni yeɛ ɔwɔ ye nwo kyɛ, bɛkɔsangye Abraham awa brasua bɔ Satan akyekye ye afoɛ 18 ne homeda ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ɔhane ɛhe ne, né ye atamfo namukoraati afɛle; na mmenia ne hyɛle yebo lili ahurusi wɔ nningyein mbiri–mbiri bɔ ɔyɛ nanwo.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yeti ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nyameɛ Ahennie ne, sɛɛ yeɛ ɔte ɔ? Na nzu po yeɛ mva ndoto ye nwo ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ɔte kyɛ sinapi aba bɔ biaa bie luale ye wɔ ye boo nu. Onyi yɛle bakaa kandinga maa ewienu no nnomaa yɛle bɛ buye wɔ ye sa mmaa naso.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Na osa hane kyɛ: “Na nzu po yeɛ mva ndoto ye nwo ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ɔte kyɛ yiste bɔ maame bie fa frale esam olonka nza maa ye mukoraati tuli ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Afei otuli atee hɔle nguro ne nnamue nemɔ nu yɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ, na ɔtoale so kyɛ ɔkɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Yeɛ ebie bisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, mmenia kaa bie yeɛ bekonya ngoa hɔ?” Yesu yele yenoa kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Yɛ bɔ ɛkɔhora biala wura anoa kamba nanu; meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, mmeni pee kɔbɔ mmɔden kyɛ bɛwura nu, nakoso bɛngɔhora. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Sɛ efiewura ne dwɔso to anoa nanu a, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛmɔ kogyina anoa ne si bɛkɔbɔ nu, na ɛmɔ aha kyɛ, ‘Me wura, bukye yɛ.’ Nakoso ɔkɔha kohyire ɛmɔ kyɛ: ‘Menze nekaa bɔ ɛmɔfi ɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Na ɛmɔ kɔhyɛ yebo bɛkɔha kyɛ: ‘Wɔ nyunu yeɛ né yɛdidi yɛno ɔ, na ne ɛyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ y'atee naso.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Nakoso ɔkɔha kyɛ: ‘Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, menze nekaa bɔ ɛmɔfi ɔ. Ɛmɔfi me so bɛhɔ, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ bɔne mukoraati bie ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Na sɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, Abraham, Isaac, Yakob, ne adiifoɛ namukoraati wɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu, bɔ ɛmɔ de bafoa ɛmɔ ne a, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛmɔ kosu na ɛmɔ anwose ɛmɔ gye ne. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Mmenia kofi afiteleɛ, atɔleɛ, sorɔ, ne ngwan koodidi wɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Nakoso bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛ bɔ baha siɛ ne bie koli moa, na bɛ bɔ bali moa ne bie aha siɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Sɔ mmerɛ nala nu ne, Farisifoɛ nemɔ bie wale ye berɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Fi wa kɔ, ofikyɛ Herode nya wɔ a, okohu wɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ bɛɛha behyire sɔ kangane ne kyɛ, ngɔhɔ so ngotu sunzummɔne na masa anwonyerɛ ɛnɛ ne ɛhema, na kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne yeɛ ngoyie m'adwuma ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Nakoso ɛnɛ ne ɛhema ne kyẽa bɔ oli berɛ ne de, odikyɛ metoa m'akwanduo naso; ofikyɛ sɛ bekohu diifoɛ bie a, odikyɛ beku ye wɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />O Yerusalem, Yerusalem, wɔ bɔ ɛku adiifoɛ na ɛsi bɛ bɔ nzomane bɛ wɔ berɛ ne nyɔboɛ! Nea mmerɛ dodoɔ bɔ mmɔle mmɔden kyɛ ngɔboɔboa wɔ mmaa mɔ noa, kyɛbɔ akɔ-taen boɔboa ye mmaa noa wɔ ye ndaa bo ne, nakoso ambene. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Nea, bayakyi ɛmɔ awuro ne bama ɛmɔ. Na meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔ ngonwu me kõ kodwu kyɛ ɛmɔkɔha kyɛ: ‘Anigye yeɛ ole bɔ ɔba Awurade dumaa nu ne.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Homeda bie, Yesu hɔle Farisifoɛ mbanyi nanu kõ awuro kyɛ ɔkwaadidi, na bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne, né bɛnea ye paa. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Nea, né biaa bie wɔ wanwu-nwu wɔ Yesu nyunu berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yeti Yesu bisale bɛ bɔ bɛse mmeraa nanu ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Mmeraa ma atee kyɛ bɛsa ebie anwonyerɛ Homeda, anaa ɔmma ate?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Nakoso bandwudwo. Yeti Yesu sɔle biaa ne nu, na ɔsale ye anwonyerɛ maa ɔhɔle. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ ɔwa anaa ye nandwie tɔ kumaa nu homeda a, ɔngɔye ye ngofi nu ndɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Na bangora bamma ye mmuayɛ biala.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Mmerɛ bɔ onwuni kyɛ bɛ bɔ bato bɛ sa bafrɛ bɛ ne pena nekaa bɔ odi mu tena ne, ɔyɛle mvandoho hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Sɛ ebie to ye sa frɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔbra ayeforɔ a, nnɛmɔ kɔtena nekaa bɔ odi mu ne, ofikyɛ ebia ne wato ye sa wafrɛ ebie bɔ odi mu tra wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ɔba sɔ, sona bɔ ɔtole ye sa frɛle ɛmɔ munyɔ ne kɔha kohyire wɔ kyɛ, ‘Dwɔso, na fa wɔ bia ne ma ye.’ Ɔba sɔ a ɛkɔdwɔso, na afa animguaseɛ aatena neka bɔ ɔba ase koraa ne. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Mmom sɛ bɛto bɛ sa bɛfrɛ wɔ a, kɔtena nekaa bɔ ɔba ase koraa ne, ɔba sɔ a, bɔ ɔtole ye sa frɛle wɔ ne kɔha kohyire wɔ kyɛ, ‘Me damvo, dwɔso fi wa, na kɔtena neka bɔ odi mu ne.’ Ɛhene kɔmaa ekonya anuonyam wɔ bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ namukoraati nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔma ye nwo so ne, bɛkɔbrɛ ye ase, na ebiala bɔ ɔbrɛ ye nwo ase ne, bɛkɔma ye so.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele sona bɔ ɔtole ye sa frɛle ye ne kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛto paati eyia anaa kɔngɔen a, nnɛfrɛ wɔ nnamvo, eliema mɔ, w'abusuafoɛ anaa wɔ mmango asikafoɛ. Sɛ ɔba sɔ a, bɛ koso bɛkɔto bɛ sa bɛkɔfrɛ wɔ, na ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔyɛ w'akatua ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Mmom to wɔ sa frɛ ahiafoɛ, mmubuafoɛ ne anyesiniwaafoɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />ɛhene kɔmaa Nyameɛ kohyira wɔ. Ofikyɛ bɛ de, bɛlle hwee bɔ bɛfa betua wɔ kerɛ, na ekonya w'akatua mmerɛ bɔ bɛtingye ateneneefoɛ ne.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Bɛ bɔ ɔne bɛ didi nanu kõ tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Anigye yeɛ ole sona bɔ okodidi wɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu ne.” <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baba bie yɛle paati kandinga bie, na ɔtole ye sa frɛle mmeni pee. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ná paati ne mmerɛ sone ne, ɔsomane ye ngoaa kyɛ, bɛɛha behyire bɛ bɔ ɔtole ye sa frɛle bɛ ne kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔbra, ofikyɛ yasiesie nikye biala yayie.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Nakoso bɛ nu biala hyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔfa edwirɛ bie ye ye nwo noa. Bɔ oli moa ne hane kyɛ, ‘Matɔ aseɛ, odikyɛ mekɔnea; mesrɛ wɔ, ye me fi nu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Sona foforɛ koso hane kyɛ: ‘Matɔ nandwie buru, odikyɛ mekɔnea bɛ; mesrɛ wɔ, ye me fi nu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Yeɛ sona foforɛ koso hane kyɛ: ‘Bekye bɔ magya ɔ, yeti mengɔhora ba.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Yeti akoaa ne wale, na ɔhane ɛhe mukoraati hyirele ye wura ne. Yeɛ efiewura ne fɛle yaa, na ɔha hyirele ye akoaa ne kyɛ: ‘Yɛ ndɛ, kɔ kuro né atee ne ye mmorɔnoa nemɔ so, na kɔfa ahiafoɛ ne mmubuafoɛ ne anyesiniwaafoɛ ne apakye nemɔ bra.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Yesi ne, akoaa ne ha hyirele ye wura ne kyɛ, ‘Me wura, mayɛ bɔ ɛhane ne, nakoso atee tɛ́ wɔ berɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Yeɛ ye wura ne sa ha hyirele ye akoaa ne kyɛ, ‘Kɔ atembire ne atee mmaa-mmaa naso, na ka kyire bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne kyɛ bɛbra; mepena kyɛ m'awuro wa yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛ bɔ mvrɛle bɛ ne, bɛ nu komapɛ po nne berɛ bɔ m'aleɛ ne bie kɔha ye gye ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Afei, mmeni pee tu lili ye si, na ɔkakyile ye nwo ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Sɛ ebie ba me berɛ, na sɛ wannde ɔdɔ bɔ ole ye ma ye baba, ye maame, ɔye, ye mmaa, oliema mmrienzua ne mmrasua, ɔne ye bɔbɔ ye ngoa naso a, ɔngɔhora ngɔyɛ me suaniɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Ná sɛ ebie anzoa ye asɛnnua, ná wanni me si a, ɔngɔhora ngɔyɛ me suaniɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ ɔpena kyɛ osi aborosaen a, onni mmoa ndena ase nzese nnea sɛ ole sikaa bɔ ɔkɔfa kosi a? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Sɛ wanyɛ sɔ a, ɔkɔhyɛ yebo, nakoso ɔngɔhora yie, na bɛ bɔ bekonwu ye namukoraati kɔhyɛ yebo kɔgoro ye nwo kyɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />‘Akoaa he hyɛle yebo kyɛ osi sua, nakoso wangora ye si yie.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Anaa ɔhene beni yeɛ ɔne ɔhene foforɛ kwaahõ a, ɔngɔli moa ngɔtena ase ngɔnea, sɛ ɔkɔhora kɔfa sogyafoɛ 10,000 kooyia kõhene bɔ ɔfa sogyafoɛ 20,000 ba ye so ne? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Sɛ onwu ye kyɛ ɔngɔhora a, mmerɛ bɔ ɔhene kõ ne wɔ dede ne, ɔkɔsoma mmenia maa bɛkɔɔsrɛ ye kyɛ, ɔpena kyɛ ɔne ye tena asomdwie nu. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Sɛ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ebie anyakyi bɔ ole ye ne mukoraati berɛ a, ɔngɔhora ngɔyɛ me suaniɛ.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Ngyee te pa, nakoso sɛ ye fɛɛ ne fi nu a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne wasa wasi ye daa nu? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ɛfa fra anweaa ɔnyɛ yé, na ɛfa yɛ fɛtelaza koso a, ɔnyɛ ye, sana egyi gua. Bɔ ole asoɛ bɔ ɔkɔfa kotie ne, ma otie.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Né bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne abɔnefoɛ taa ba Yesu berɛ batie ye. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Na Farisifoɛ ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ hyɛle yebo yɛle nwuhu-nwuhu kyɛ: “Sɔ akoaa he sosɔ abɔnefoɛ so, na ɔne bɛdidi.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yeɛ Yesu yɛle mvandoho bie hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ ole mmoan 100, na bɛ nu kõ mini a, ɔngɔyakyi 99 ne berɛ ngɔhɔ ngɔpena kõ ne tonn ngodwu kyɛ okonwu ye ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Na sɛ onwu ye a, anigye ti, ɔfa ye to ye kɔme anwo, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />na ɔba awuro a, ɔfrɛ ye nnamvo ne ye mmango mɔ ka kyire bɛ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔma yɛgye yɛ nye, ofikyɛ manwu me boan bɔ ominini ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Sɔ ala yeɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɔbɔnefoɛ kõ sakra a, anigye bɔ ɔba anwuro ne, ɔtra teneneefoɛ 99 bɔ benhia adwene-sakra ne deɛ ne.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Anaa brasua beni yeɛ ole drakma buru bɔ enu kõ mini a, ɔngɔsɔ kanea ngɔpra awuro berɛ, na ɔngɔpena drakma ne tonn ngodwu kyɛ okonwu ye ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Na sɛ onwu ye a, ɔfrɛ ye nnamvo ne ye mmango mɔ ka kyire bɛ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔma yɛgye yɛ nye, ofikyɛ manwu me sikaa bɔ ominini ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Sɔ ala yeɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɔbɔnefoɛ komapɛ sakra a, kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ abɔfo nye gye ne, ɔtte angorɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu toale so kyɛ: “Né biaa bie le mmaa mmrienzua nyɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Ná kamba ne ha hyirele ye baba kyɛ, ‘Daa, kyɛ agyapadeɛ nanu na fa me deɛ ma me.’ Yeti, ɔhyɛle agyapadeɛ nanu mane bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ngyẽa kaa bie si ne, ɔwa kamba ne boɔboale ye nningyein mukoraati noa, na ɔfale ye ti bɔle nu hɔle maen bie so wɔ dede. Ná ɔɔbɔle bra–bɔne sɛkyele ye agyapadeɛ namu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ye sikaa namukoraati yiele ne, ɛhɔen kandinga bie sili maen nanu, ná ohiane ye pa–pa. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Yeti ɔfale ye nwo bɔle kuromani bie wɔ maen nanu, na ɔfale ye hɔle ye aseɛ so kyɛ ɔɔnea ye mbrako. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Né ɛhɔen kora ku ye alaa maa onyane ye a, ahaa okoli aleɛ bɔ mbrako ne di ne bie, nakoso ebiala amma ye hwee. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ye nye wale ye nwo so ne, ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Me baba ngoaa nanu beni, yeɛ aleɛ bulli ye so ɔ? Nakoso nea, ɛhɔen yeɛ oku me wa ne! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ngosa ngɔhɔ me baba berɛ, na maha mahyire ye kyɛ, “Daa, mayɛ bɔne matia Nyameɛ ne wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Yeti, menvata kyɛ ɛfa me yɛ ɛwa, mesrɛ wɔ, wɔ de ma nyɛ wɔ ngoaa nanu kõ.”’<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />“Na odwɔso hɔle ye baba dɔ. Ɔwɔ dedeede bɔ ye baba nye bɔle ye so ne, ɔyɛle ye anwunvo, yeti otuli mirika yiale ye, na ɔyɛle ye atuu fele ye noa nwo. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Yeɛ akwalaa ne ha hyirele ye baba kyɛ, ‘Daa, mayɛ bɔne matia Nyameɛ ne wɔ; yeti menvata kyɛ ɛka kyɛ nde ɛwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Nakoso baba ne ha hyirele ye ngoaa nemɔ kyɛ: ‘Ɛmɔha ɛmɔ nwo bɛɛfa atadeɛ bɔ ɔyɛ nyemene paa bɛwura ye, na ɛmɔfa kaa bɛgua ye sa, na ɛmɔwura ye mmaboa. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Afei ɛmɔye nandwie ba bɔ ɔte piri paa bɛhu ye, na ɛmɔma yɛdidi na yɛgye yɛ nye. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ofikyɛ mma ne wuli, na wasa wawa ngoa nu, ominini, na manwu ye.’ Yeti bɛhyɛle yebo bɛgyele bɛ nye.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Né ɔwa brienzua panyi ne ahɔ fiɛso, na ɔnate atee so ɔba bɔ waha ka maa odwu awuro ne, ɔtele dwein ne abilie wɔ awuro berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Yeti ɔfrɛle ngoaa nanu kõ bisale ye bɔ ɔkɔ so ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Na akoaa ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Eliema ne awa, yeti wɔ baba ahu nandwie awa kandinga, ofikyɛ ye sa aha ye, na ɔte apɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Ɛhe maa ɔwa panyi ne fɛle yaa paa, ná wangɔ awuro berɛ. Yeti ye baba wale ye berɛ kyɛ ɔbaapa ye kyerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele ye baba kyɛ: ‘Daa, afoɛ pee yeɛ mafa masõ wɔ ɔ, na mmuli wɔ mmeraa so ɛlɛhomapɛ po. Nakoso ɛhora manne me abɔngye ba kõ po kyɛ ngu ye, na mene me nnamvo mɔ fa gye yɛ nye. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Nakoso ɛwa he bɔ wasɛkye w'agyapadeɛ wɔ tuutuufoɛ nwo ne wale ala pɛ, ahu nandwie ba kandinga ne ama ye.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Yeɛ baba ne hane kyɛ: ‘Mma, wɔ de daa mene wɔ wɔ wa, na bɔ nne ye biala te wɔ deɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Nakoso odikyɛ yɛdi ahurusi na yɛmaa yɛ nye gye, ofikyɛ eliema ne wuli, na wasa wawa ngoa nu, ominini, na yanwu ye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Osa ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Né sikaniɛ bie le ebie bɔ ɔnea ye awuro so, ná bɛɛbɔle ye amaneɛ kyɛ, sɔ sona ne bɔ ye kerɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Yeti ɔfrɛle ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Nzu yeɛ metete mefa wɔ nwo ne? Baabu w'adwuma nanwo ngondaa kyire me, ofikyɛ mengɔma ɛngɔnea m'awuro naso kõ.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Yeɛ akoaa bɔ ɔnea awuro naso ne ha hyirele ye nwo kyɛ: ‘Kesaalae bɔ me wura baale m'adwuma ne fi me sa nu ne, nzu yeɛ ngɔyɛ ɔ? Nnne anwoserɛ bɔ ngɔfa ngoli paa, na me fɛle kyɛ ngɔsrɛ-srɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ahaa, mese bɔ ngɔyɛ, na sɛ ɔka kyɛ nnɛmaa menea ye awuro naso kõ a, mmenia alɛ́ me ahɔ b'awuro.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Yeti ɔfrɛle bɛ bɔ bɛma ye wura kerɛ namukoraati. Yeɛ obisale bɔ oli moa ne kyɛ: ‘Ɛma me wura kerɛ sɛɛ?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Anwa galɔn 100.’ Yeɛ bɔ ɔnea awuro naso ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘De wɔ krataa ne, na tena ase tworɔ 50 kesaalae.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Yeɛ obisale sona foforɛ kyɛ: ‘Wɔ koso, ɛma kerɛ sɛɛ?’ Ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Hwiit bɔtɔ 100.’ Yeɛ bɔ ɔnea awuro naso ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘De wɔ krataa ne, na tworɔ 80.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Ɔwɔ nu, sona bɔ ɔnea awuro naso ne anni nahorɛ, nakoso ye wura ne kamvole ye, ofikyɛ wafa ye adwene wayɛ adwuma. Mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.”</char></note> sɛ bɛne bɛ mmango mɔ yɛ nikye a, bɛkyire kyɛ bɛ nye ate atra kanea mmaa nemɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yeti meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔfa ahonyadeɛ bɔ ɔndengyɛ so benya nnamvoa, na sɛ ofi berɛ a, bamaa ɛmɔ anya nekaa batena daa.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />“Ebiala bɔ odi nahorɛ wɔ nningyein mmaa-mmaa nu ne, odi nahorɛ wɔ nningyein mbiri nu koso; na bɔ onni nahorɛ wɔ nningyein mmaa-mmaa nu ne, onni nahorɛ wɔ nningyein mbiri nu. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Sɛ ɛmɔ anni nahorɛ wɔ ahonyadeɛ bɔ ɔndengyɛ nu a, nwa yeɛ ɔkɔfa ahonyadeɛ pa kowura ɛmɔ sa ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Na sɛ ɛmɔ anni nahorɛ wɔ ebie deɛ nu a, nwa yeɛ ɔbaafa ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔ deɛ ma ɛmɔ ne? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Akoaa biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔsõ mmenia nyɔ ɔ; ɔba ye sɔ a, okohuro kõ dwirɛ na ɔngɔhuro kõ dwirɛ, anaakyɛ ɔkɔso kõ nahorɛ nu, né wabu kõ animtia. Ɛmɔ ngɔhora bɛngɔsõ Nyameɛ na ɛmɔ asa basõ ahonyadeɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Farisifoɛ bɔ bɛ nye boro sikaa ne tele ɛhe amukoraati, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛgorole Yesu nwo. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yeti ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔpena kyɛ mmenia nwu ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔte teneneefoɛ, nakoso Nyameɛ se bɔ ɔwɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu. Ofikyɛ nikye bɔ mmenia nwu ye kyɛ ɔsom bo ne, Nyameɛ nye so de, ɔte akyiwadeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Mmeraa ne adiifoɛ ne tenane berɛ tonn oodwuli Yohane so. Ofi sɔ mmerɛ ne, Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ yeɛ bɛka ɔ, na ebiala yere ye nwo kyɛ ɔkɔhɔ nu bie. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Na ɔkɔyɛ mmerɛ kyɛ anwuro ne aseɛ kɔpɛ nu, tra kyɛ bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ mmeraa nanu ne komapɛ po komini bɔ ɔngɔwa nu ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Ebiala bɔ okoyira ɔye kogya foforɛ ne, wasɛkye agyaa, na ebiala bɔ okogya brasua bɔ bayira ye ne, ye koso wasɛkye agyaa.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Né sikaniɛ bie wɔ berɛ bɔ ne ɔtaa wura atadeɛ <char style="tl">valent</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daa ne, sɛ ebie wura atadeɛ bɔ ye kɔla te </char><char style="it">violet</char> anaa <char style="it">purple</char> (Brɔfo) a, né ɔte ebie bɔ ole sikaa paa, ofikyɛ ne sɔ ndadeɛ nemɔ nyɔboɛ yɛ se.</note> ne nwera pa. Na daa biala ne ɔfa nningyein pa gye ye nye. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Né bɛtaa bɛfa hianiɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Lazarus bɛbatena ye atee ne noa, né ye nwo mukoraati atutu ngena. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Na aleɛ bɔ ne ofi sikaniɛ ne tɛbulu naso gua ase ne, ɛhene yeɛ ne odi ɔ. Afei koso, ne ngyea batafe ye kena nanu. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Hianiɛ ne wuli, na abɔfo fale ye hɔle Abraham berɛ. Na sikaniɛ ne wuli maa bɛsiele ye. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ɔla kumaa nanu ne, né ye nwo teetee ye. Na ɔtole ye nye ne, onwuni Abraham wɔ dedeede, na onwuni kyɛ Lazarus wɔ ye nwo berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Na ɔteane nu kyɛ: ‘Baba Abraham, mesrɛ wɔ nwu me anwunvo, na soma Lazarus ma ɔfa ye sa ati bɔ nzue nu, na ɔfa pe me temverema so, ofikyɛ me nwo yerɛ-yera me wɔ see bɔ ɔsɔ buru-buru he anu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Nakoso Abraham ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Mma, kaye kyɛ w'asetena nu ne, nningyein pa ngome yeɛ enyane ye ɔ, nakoso Lazarus de, ɔhaw ngome yeɛ ɔhɔle nu ɔ. Nakoso kesaalae de, ye nwo atɔ ye wɔ wa, yeɛ wɔ koso wɔ nwo teetee wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Sɛ ɛhene la ahameɛ a, kumaa kandinga la yɛ ne ɛmɔ afia, yeti ebiala ngɔhora ngofi wa ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ, yeɛ ebiala ngɔhora ngofi ɛmɔ berɛ ngɔwa wa.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Yeɛ sikaniɛ ne hane kyɛ: ‘Daa, ye de mesrɛ wɔ, soma ye ma ɔhɔ me baba awuro berɛ, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />nne aliemaa mmrienzua nnu wɔ berɛ, ma ɔɔbɔ bɛ kɔkɔ na bɛ koso, bamma anwu amaneɛ bɔ menwu ye ne bie.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Nakoso Abraham ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Mose ne adiifoɛ nemɔ wɔ dɔ, ma betie bɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Daabi oo, baba Abraham, sɛ ebie fi ɛwa mmom kɔ a, ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔmaa bɛkɔsakra ɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Yeɛ Abraham ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Sɛ bɛngotie Mose ne adiifoɛ nemɔ a, ye de sɛ ebie fi awufo nanu kɔ po a, bɛngotie ye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ná ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, sintidua kɔwa, nakoso bɔ ɔnate yeso kɔwa ne, ye yaakɔ! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Sɔ sona ne, sɛ bɛfale nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛtĩ hwiit bɛtole ye kɔme bɛgyili ye bɛtole ɛpo nu po a, ahaa ɔte pa ma ye tra kyɛ ɔkɔto mmaa–mmaa he anu kõ sintidua. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Yeti, ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé, sɛ eliema yɛ wɔ bɔne a, ka kyire ye, sɛ ɔsakra a, fa kyɛ ye. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Sɛ ɔyɛ wɔ bɔne pɛn nzoo kyẽa komapɛ po, na ɔba wɔ berɛ pɛn nzoo baka kyire wɔ kyɛ, ‘Masakra’ a, fa kyɛ ye.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele Awurade kyɛ: “Ma yɛ gyidie yɛ se.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔle gyidie bɔ ye piri te kyɛ sinapi mmaa a, ahaa ɛmɔka bɛkyire sikamore bakaa he kyɛ, ‘Tu fi wa, na kogyina ɛpo nu’ a, okotie ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yɛfa ye kyɛ ɛmɔ nu bie le akoaa bɔ ofundam aseɛ anaa ɔnea mmoan, sɛ akoaa ne fi fiɛso ba awuro a, aso ɔkɔha kohyire ye kyɛ, ‘Yɛ ye ndɛ baatena ase didi’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Nná bɔ ɔkɔha kohyire ye yeɛ ole kyɛ, ‘Yɛ aleɛ ma nni ye nnɔsoa ye, na siesie wɔ nwo so me ma nnidi na nno nyie, meyie ne wɔ koso adidi ano’? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ɛmɔnea a, ɔkɔla akoaa ne ase kyɛ wayɛ bɔ okuro wama ye hɔ? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Yeti ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔ baha kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ namukoraati beyie a, ɛmɔha kyɛ: ‘Yɛte ngoaa bɔ mvasoɛ nne yɛ so, bɔ odikyɛ yɛyɛ ala yeɛ yayɛ ne.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Na ɔnate atee so ɔkɔ Yerusalem ne, ɔfale Samaria ne Galilea wɛen so. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ɔkɔ nnamue bie nu ne, oyiale kwatafoɛ 10 bie, né bɛgyi dede, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ná bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Yesu, Owura, nwu yɛ anwunvo.” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu nwuni bɛ ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nwo beehyire sɔfo nemɔ.” Bɛnate atee so bɛkɔ ne, bɛ nwo tɔle bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛ nu kõ nwuni kyɛ ye nwo atɔ ye ne, osale ye si, na ɔmane ye konvi so yele Nyameɛ ayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Na obuli ndwerɛ wɔ Yesu gya bo lale ye ase; ne ɔte Samarianiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yeɛ Yesu bisale kyɛ: “Nná mmenia buru yeɛ nzale bɛ anwonyerɛ ɔ? Ná ngona ne wɔ nisua? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Yeti bɛ nu biala anza yesi amma anye Nyameɛ ayɛ, sana ɛwɔfoɔ he ngome?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Dwɔso na kɔ; wɔ gyidie amaa wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Yesi ne, Farisifoɛ nemɔ bisale Yesu kyɛ, “Mmerɛ beni yeɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne kɔwa ɔ?” Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nyameɛ Ahennie ne ba, nakoso mmenia ngɔfa bɛ nye ngonwu ye; <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />na bɛngɔha kyɛ: ‘Nea, ɔwɔ wa,’ anaa ‘Ɔwɔ faen.’ Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, Nyameɛ Ahennie ne wɔ ɛmɔ afia.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: “Mmerɛ bie ba, sɔ mmerɛ ne, ɔhale ɛmɔ ngome a, ahaa ɛmɔ anwu Sona Awa ne ngyẽa nanu kõ, nakoso ɛmɔ ngonwu ye. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Na sɛ bɛka bɛkyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Ɔwɔ ɛwa,’ anaa ‘Ɔwɔ ɛdɔ’ a, nnɛmɔ kɔ, na nnɛmɔ di bɛ si. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Na kyɛbɔ agralaa te yerɛm wɔ ewienu a, ɔta maa ebiala nwu ye ne, sɔ ala yeɛ Sona Awa ne ngyẽa ne kɔyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Nakoso odikyɛ onwu amaneɛ paa na mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ ne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.”</char></note> ye ye ma. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Afei, bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ Nowa aberɛ so ne, ɛhene ala bie yeɛ ɔkɔhɔ so wɔ Sona Awa ne ngyẽa nanu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bɛdidili, bɛnone, mmrienzua gyale, na bɛfale mmrasua bɛmane agyaa tonn oodwuli kyɛ, Nowa wurale alaka nanu, ɛhene si ne, nzue ne yi sɛkyele bɛ mu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ ɔhɔle so wɔ Lot aberɛ so ɔ; né mmenia didi, bɛno, bɛdi dwaa, bɛyɛ ɛboo, bɛsisi sua, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />nakoso kyẽa bɔ Lot fili Sodom ne, see ne sɔfa tɔ fili anwuro sɛkyele bɛ mukoraati. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Kyẽa bɔ bɛkɔla Sona Awa ne ali ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɔkɔyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Sɔ kyẽa ne, nnɛmaa sona bɔ ɔwɔ sua ti afia dwu ba ase kyɛ ɔbaafa ye agyapadeɛ. Na bɔ wahɔ fiɛso ne, nnɛmaa ɔba awuro kyɛ ɔbaafa ye nningyein bɔ wayakyi ye wɔ siɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Ɛmɔkaye Lot aye ne. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔyɛ kyɛ ɔbɔ ye ngoa nwo waen ne, okofi ye sa, na ebiala bɔ ye ngoa kofi ye sa ne, ɔkɔbɔ ye nwo waen. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɔ kɔngɔen ne, mmenia nyɔ kɔla bɛen kõ so, bɛkɔfa kõ na bayakyi kõ. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Mmrasua nyɔ kotĩ nikye wɔ nyɔboɛ kõ so, bɛkɔfa kõ, na bayakyi kõ.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="bd">Mmrienzua nyɔ kɔhɔ fiɛso, bɛkɔfa kõ, na bayakyi kõ.</char> Nakoso sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔnne asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa, ne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu.</note>—<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nisua?” Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nekaa bɔ fuin ne la ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ mbɛtɛ koso boa bɛ noa ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu yɛle mvandoho bie maa bɛnwuni kyɛ, ye nwo hia kyɛ bɛbɔ mbaeɛ daa bɔ bɛngɔma bɛ abanu ngobu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Ɔhane kyɛ: “Né temmufoɛ bie wɔ kuro bie nu, ye ahɔ a onzuro Nyameɛ, yeɛ ommu sona koso. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Né kunaniɛ bie wɔ kuro nanu, na ne ɔtaa kɔ ye berɛ kɔka kyire ye kyɛ: ‘Edwirɛ bɔ wawa mene me tamfo ne afia ne, mesrɛ wɔ, bu atɛn tenenee ma me.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ahyɛaseɛ ne, né ɔndɛ ye so, nakoso ye si ne, ɔha hyirele ye nwo kyɛ: ‘Ɔwɔ nu, menzuro Nyameɛ, yeɛ memmu sona, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />nakoso ɔnate kunaniɛ he halɛ bɔ ɔha me nati, ngobu atɛn tenenee ngɔma ye, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔngɔfa ye dwirɛ ne ngodwane me nwo kõ ɔ.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Yeɛ Awurade hane kyɛ: “Temmufoɛ ne bɔ ɔndengyɛ ne po, ɛmɔtie bɔ ɔhane ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ye de, bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ aye bɛ ne, sɛ besu bɛfrɛ ye eyia ne kɔngɔen a, ongobu atɛn tenenee ngɔma bɛ anaa? Ɛmɔnea a, ɔkɔhyɛ kora ne waboka bɛ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, okobu atɛn tenenee kɔma bɛ ndɛ-ndɛ. Nakoso sɛ Sona Awa ne ba a, aso okonwu gyidie sɔa bie wɔ aseɛ naso?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Na bɛ bɔ bedɛ bɛ nwo bɛdi kyɛ bɛte teneneefoɛ, na bɛbu afoforɛ animtia ne, ɔyɛle mvandoho bie hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Mmenia nyɔ bie hɔle asɔre awuro berɛ kyɛ bɛkwaabɔ mbaeɛ, né kõ te Farisiniɛ, yeɛ ne kõ dide toɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Farisiniɛ ne gyinane berɛ bɔle mbaeɛ mane ye nwo kyɛ, ‘O Nyameɛ, meda wɔ ase kyɛ nnde nnipa-bɔneniɛ, asisie, na menzɛkye agyaa te kyɛ mmenia bɔ baha ne. Ná meda wɔ ase kyɛ nnde kyɛ biaa he bɔ odidɛ ɛtoɔ ne koso ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Dapɛn biala meyɛ akɔngyere pɛn nyɔ, na bɔ menya ye biala, metua ye nwo taet.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Nakoso sona bɔ odidɛ toɔ ne de, ɔtele ye nwo gyinane nekaa bie, wampagya ye ti so wannea anwuro po, mmom ɔfale ye sa bobɔle ye hue so hane kyɛ, ‘Nyameɛ, nwu me anwunvo, ofikyɛ nde nnipa-bɔneniɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, biaa he kɔ ye awuro ne, né ɔte teneneeniɛ tra Farisiniɛ ne. Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔma ye nwo so ne, bɛkɔbrɛ ye ase, na ebiala bɔ ɔbrɛ ye nwo ase ne, bɛkɔma ye so.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Né bɛfa ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa bɛbrɛ ye kyɛ ɔfa ye sa ha bɛ. Na asuafoɛ ne nwuni ye sɔ ne, bɛteɛteane bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Nakoso Yesu frɛle ngwalaa nemɔ wale ye nwo berɛ, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma ngwalaa nemɔ atee ma bɛbra me berɛ, nnɛmɔsi bɛ atee; ofikyɛ ɛhemɔ yeɛ Nyameɛ ahennie ne ɔte bɛ deɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ wanne Nyameɛ Ahennie ne wandonu te kyɛ akwalaa ne, ɔngɔhɔ nu bie.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Yeɛ panyi bie bisale ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ pa, nzu yeɛ meyɛ a, ngonya daa ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛka kyɛ nde sona pa ɔ? Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte pa ɔ, sana Nyameɛ ngome. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Nnaa ɛse mmeraa ne: ‘Nnɛsɛkye agyaa, nnɛdi awue, nnɛwia, nnɛdi adanzewia, bu wɔ baba ne wɔ maame.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yeɛ biaa ne hane kyɛ: “Mvi me ngwalaa nu, yeɛ mali ɛhe amukoraati so ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Waha nikye kõ bɔ odikyɛ ɛyɛ ɔ. Tɔne bɔ ɛle ye biala, na fa sikaa ne ma ahiafoɛ, sɛ ɛyɛ sɔ a, ekonya agyapadeɛ wɔ anwuro; afei bra bali me si.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Biaa ne tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, ye wora bɔle pa-pa, ofikyɛ né ole sikaa paa.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu nwuni ye sɔ ne, ye wora bɔle, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Nea kyɛbɔ ɔyɛ se kyɛ asikafoɛ kɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu ɔ! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Nahorɛ, ɔkɔyɛ mmerɛ kyɛ afupɔngɔ kowura paneɛ bɔen nu, tra kyɛ sikaniɛ kɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nu ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bɛ bɔ bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ ne hane kyɛ: “Ye de, nwa paa yeɛ okonya ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Nakoso Yesu hane kyɛ: “Nikye bɔ sona ngora ye yɛ ne, Nyameɛ de, ɔnyɛ se mma ye.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Yeɛ Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea, yayakyi bɔ yɛle ye biala berɛ yaali wɔ si.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nati, wayakyi ye awuro, ɔye, oliema mɔ, ye awofo, ne ye mmaa mɔ berɛ ne, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />bɛkɔbɔ ye nwo pee bɛkɔma ye wɔ wiase he anu, na okonya daa ngoa wɔ wiase bɔ ɔba nanu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yeɛ ɔfrɛle 12 ne hɔle ahameɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Ɛmɔnea, yɛfo yɛkɔ Yerusalem, na bɔ adiifoɛ nemɔ ha fale Sona Awa nanwo namukoraati kɔwa nu. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Bɛkɔfa ye bɛkɔma maen-maen nanufoɛ ne, na bɛkɔgoro ye nwo, bɛkɔpepɛ ye nzoaa, na batete ngɔserɛ bagua ye nwo. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Afei bɛkogwa ye, na bahu ye, na ye ɛlɛsa naso ne, ɔkɔdwɔso.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Nakoso asuafoɛ nemɔ ande sɔ dwirɛ nabo. Né bafa sɔ dwirɛ ne bafea bɛ, na ne bɛnze bɔ ɔka ye nwo dwirɛ ne po.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Opingye Yeriko ne, né anyesiniwaaniɛ bie te atee ne noa ɔsrɛ-srɛ sikaa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele kyɛ mmeni pee pɛ nu ne, né ɔpena kyɛ onwu bɔ ɔkɔso ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bɛha behyirele ye kyɛ: “Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu yeɛ ɔpɛ nu ne.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Yeti ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Yesu, David awa, nwu me anwunvo!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ ye nyunu ne teɛteane ye, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ ɔyɛ dinn. Nakoso ɛhene po maa ɔteɛteane nu serɛ kyɛ: “David awa, nwu me anwunvo!” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu gyinane, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, bɛfa ye bɛbra. Ɔwale ye nwo berɛ ne, Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Nzu yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ meyɛ mema wɔ ɔ?” Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Awurade, ma nwu nikye.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Na Yesu hane kyɛ: “Nwu nikye; wɔ gyidie amaa wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Na ɛberɛ nala, ye nye tele, na olili Yesu si yele Nyameɛ ayɛ. Mmerɛ bɔ mmenia ne nwuni ye ne, bɛyele Nyameɛ ayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu hɔle Yeriko, na ɔnate kuro nanu ne, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />né biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Zakios wɔ berɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛdide ɛtoɔ ne, né ɔte bɛ mbanyi nanu kõ, na né ole sikaa paa. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Né ɔpena kyɛ onwu sona-horɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yesu ne, nakoso mmenia nati né onwu ye, ofikyɛ ne ɔte sii. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Yeti ɔhɔle anyunu ɔɔfole sikamore bakaa kyɛbɔ okonwu Yesu, ofikyɛ né Yesu kɔfa sɔ atee naso. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu dwuli bakaa nabo ne, ɔtole ye nye neane anwuro, yeɛ ɔha hyirele Zakios kyɛ: “Zakios, yɛ ndɛ dwu ase, ofikyɛ ɛnɛ, odikyɛ metena wɔ awuro.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ná Zakios yɛle ndɛ dwuli, na ɔfale anigye lɛle ye hɔle ye awuro. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Mmenia ne nwuni ɛhe ne, bɛhyɛle yebo bɛkekane kyɛ: “Ɔbɔnefoɛ he awuro yeɛ waatena ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Nakoso Zakios dwɔso gyinane berɛ, na ɔha hyirele Awurade kyɛ: “Awurade, nea, ngɔfa me agyapadeɛ ne bue ngɔma ahiafoɛ. Na bɔ masisi ebiala male ne, ngɔbɔ ye nwo nná ngɔma ye.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛnɛ, balɛ́ awuro he anufoɛ ngoa, ofikyɛ ye koso, ɔte Abraham awa. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Na Sona Awa ne wale kyɛ, ɔbaapena bɛ bɔ bamini ne, na odɛ́ bɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Bɛguso betie ye ne, ɔyɛle mvandoho foforɛ bie; ɔyɛle sɔ mvandoho ne, ofikyɛ ne waha kaa maa odwu Yerusalem, na né mmenia ne adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ, odwu Yerusalem a, ɛberɛ ala Nyameɛ Ahennie né kɔwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ɔhane kyɛ: “Dehyeɛ bie tuli atee hɔle maen bie so wɔ dede kyɛ ɔkwaale tumi badi hene. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ɔbaahɔ ne, ɔfrɛle ye ngoaa nanu buru mane bɛ nu biala <char style="tl">mmɛnaa</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tete ne, ne mmɛnaa te sikaa bɔ enu yɛ nno, sɛ akoaa bie yɛ adwuma ngyẽa 100 a, ne ye akatua te mmɛnaa kõ.</char></note> kõ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: ‘Ɛmɔfa sikaa he bɛyɛ adwuma tonn maa odwu kyɛ ngosa ngɔwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Nakoso né ye maen nanufoɛ ne nguro ye dwirɛ, yeti bɛtuli mmenia maa bɛlili ye si bɛɛhane kyɛ: ‘Yɛnguro kyɛ biaa he di yɛ so hene.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Onyane tumi, ná osa wale ne, ɔfrɛle ngoaa bɔ ɔfale sikaa ne mane bɛ ne kyɛ bɛbra, na bɛma onwu mvasoɛ bɔ banya ye wɔ sikaa nanwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Bɔ oli moa ne wale, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Me wura, <char style="tl">mmɛnaa</char> kõ bɔ ɛfa mane me ne, manya buru maboka so.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Mo, ɛte akoaa pa! Ɔnate kyɛ ali kaa he anu nahorɛ nati, nea nguro buru so.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne wale, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Me wura, manya <char style="tl">mmɛnaa</char> nnu maboka wɔ <char style="tl">mmɛnaa</char> kõ naso.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Na ye wura ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Wɔ koso nea nguro nnu so.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Akoaa foforɛ wale ne, ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Me wura, wɔ <char style="tl">mmɛnaa</char> ne ɛhe, mva mveale ɛtena nu. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, né mesuro wɔ, ofikyɛ wɔ dwirɛ yɛ se. Wɔ de, bɔ ɔtte wɔ deɛ yeɛ ɛfa ɔ, na bɔ elualle yeɛ ɛpɛ ɔ.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Yeɛ ye wura ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Ɛtte akoaa pa! Wɔ noa dwirɛ abu wɔ fɔ. Nnaa ɛse kyɛ me dwirɛ yɛ se, bɔ ɔtte me deɛ yeɛ mefa ɔ, na bɔ nnuale yeɛ mepɛ ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Ye de, nzuati yeɛ amva me sikaa ne ando <char style="tl">bank</char>, na sɛ meba a, manya ye nwo nzihoɛ ɔ?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi berɛ ne kyɛ: ‘Ɛmɔle <char style="tl">mmɛnaa</char> ne bɛfi ye sa nu, na ɛmɔfa bɛma bɔ onyane <char style="tl">mmɛnaa</char> buru ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nakoso bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Yɛ wura, ole mmɛnaa buru oo!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: ‘Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ole bie ne, bɛkɔfa pee bɛkɔboka ye so; nakoso bɔ olle bie ne de, kaa bɔ ole ye ne po, bɛkole bɛkofi ye sa nu. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Na me tamfo nemɔ, bɔ ne bɛnguro kyɛ medi bɛ so hene ne, ɛmɔfa bɛ bɛbra, na ɛmɔhũ bɛ wɔ me nyunu wala.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu hane ɛhe yiele ne, osili atee so kyɛ ɔkɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Mmerɛ bɔ odwuli Olive Bokaa bɔ opingye Bɛtfage ne Betania naso ne, ɔsomane ye asuafoɛ nanu nyɔ, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ nnamue bɔ ɛmɔ nye ta ye dɔ nanu, ɛmɔwura nu a, ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ bamenda afunum ba bie bɔ ebiala tennane ye so lle. Ɛmɔ sangye ye, na ɛmɔfa ye bɛbrɛ me. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Na sɛ ebie bisa ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ sangye afunum ne?’ a, ɛmɔha behyire ye kyɛ: ‘Awurade hia ye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bɛhɔle ne, bɛnwuni nikye biala kyɛbɔ baha bɛhyirele bɛ nala. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Bɛsangye afunum ne, ye mene ne bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ sangye afunum ne?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Awurade hia ye.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Yeti bɛfale afunum ne bɛbrɛle Yesu, na bɛfale bɛ ndadeɛ bɛguale ye so maa ɔtenane so. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ɔte afunum naso ne, mmenia fale bɛ ndadeɛ guale atee nanu maa ɔfale so. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Odwuli nekaa bɔ ɔtoro fi Olive Bokaa naso ne, ye asuafoɛ pembe namukoraati hyɛle yebo lili ahurusi, na nningyein mbiri-mbiri bɔ banwu ye nati, bɛbɔle ose bɛyele Nyameɛ ayɛ <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">“Nhyira yeɛ ole bɔ ɔba kyɛ Ɔhene wɔ Awurade dumaa nu ne!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Asomdwie wɔ anwuro, na anuonyam wɔ anwuro-anwuro!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Nakoso né Farisifoɛ ne biemɔ wɔ mmenia nanu, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, dwudwo kyire w'asuafoɛ nemɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɛhemɔ mua bɛ noa po a, nyɔboɛ kɔ teɛtea nu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Opingye Yerusalem bɔ onwuni kuro ne, osuni, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />na ɔhane kyɛ: “Wɔ, sɛ ɛnɛ kyẽa ye, ɛse bɔ ɔkɔmaa ekonya asomdwie a, ahaa ɔte pa! Nakoso kesaalae de, bafa bafea wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bie ba, bɔ w'atamfo kɔfa mmakaa bɔ yenoa te mvemveaa kɔyɛ ɛwaen kɔpɛ wɔ nwo koyia maa ɛkɔha afia, ná baha bamia wɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Na bɛkɔdwiri ɛne wɔ mmaa bɔ bɛwɔ wɔ nu namukoraati bɛkogua ase, na bɛngɔyakyi nyɔboɛ wɔ nyɔboɛ so; ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ bɛɛneane wɔ ne, annwu ye.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesi ne, Yesu wurale asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɔfoane bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne nningyein wɔ berɛ namu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bahworɔ kyɛ, ‘M'awuro ne kɔyɛ mbaebɔ awuro,’ nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ afa bayɛ awiefoɛ adwosuo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Né Yesu yɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ daa biala. Né sɔfo mbanyi, atwerɛfoɛ ne kuro nanu mbanyi ne pena ye ku ye; <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />nakoso bannya atee bangu ye, ofikyɛ né mmenia namukoraati ayɛ asoɛ betie edwirɛ bɔ ɔka ne.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ɛlɛho bie, ne Yesu ka nzɛmba ne kyire mmenia biemɔ wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, na sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ ne kuro nanu mbanyi ne wale ye berɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Ka kyire yɛ, tumi beni yeɛ ɛfa yɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ne? Na nwa yeɛ ɔmane wɔ sɔ tumi ne?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mepena kyɛ me bisa ɛmɔ dwirɛ bie. Ɛmɔha behyire me, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yohane asubɔ ne, né ofi anwuro, anaa ofi sona?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Na bɛdwenene ye nwo kyɛ: “Sɛ yɛka kyɛ, ‘ofi anwuro’ a, okobisa kyɛ, ‘Nzuati yeɛ né ɛmɔnne ye benni ne?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Nakoso sɛ yɛka kyɛ, ‘ofi sona’ a, mmenia ne kosi yɛ nyɔboɛ, ofikyɛ bɛ mukoraati bedɛ bɛdi kyɛ né Yohane te diifoɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Yeti bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ bɛnze nekaa bɔ ofi ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzaade me koso, tumi bɔ mefa meyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ne, mengɔha mengohyire ɛmɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yeɛ ɔyɛle mvandoho he hyirele mmenia nemɔ ɔ: “Baba bie yɛle bobe boo, na ɔfa wurale ahwɛsofoɛ sa tule atee, ɔhɔle ne, ɔhyɛle kaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Bobe ne mmerɛ sone ne, ɔsomane akoaa bie hɔle ahwɛsofoɛ ne berɛ, kyɛ oole bobe né mmaa ne bie berɛ ye. Nakoso ngoaa nemɔ bole ye, na bɛmaa ɔfale ye sa nzaa-nzaa hɔle. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Osa somane akoaa foforɛ, ye koso, bɛbole ye bɛguale ye nyunu ase, yeɛ bɛmaa ɔfale ye sa nzaa-nzaa hɔle ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Yeɛ ɔsomane bɔ ɔtɔ so nza, na ɛhe de, bɛpirale ye paa, yeɛ bɛfoane ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yeɛ bobe boo wura ne bisale ye nwo kyɛ: ‘Nzu yeɛ nyɛ ɔ? Ngɔsoma me dɔba ne, ye de, bɛkɔfɛle ye.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Nakoso ahwɛsofoɛ nemɔ nwuni ye ne, bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ: ‘Koliagyaa ne ɛhe. Ɛmɔma yɛhu ye, ná agyapadeɛ né ayɛ yɛ deɛ.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Yeti, bɛfale ye bɛfili bobe boo nanu bɛɛhuni ye. Ɛmɔnea a, nzu yeɛ ɛboo ne wura ne kɔfa kɔyɛ bɛ ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ɔkɔwa kɔɔsɛkye sɔ ahwɛsofoɛ nemɔ, ná wafa ɛboo ne wama mmenia foforɛ.” Bɛtele ɛhe ne, bɛhane kyɛ: “Nyameɛ pa gua!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Nakoso Yesu neane bɛ haa, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Ye de, edwirɛ he bɔ bɛhworɔle ne, yebo kyire sɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Nyɔboɛ bɔ brekyafoɛ ne gyi tole ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ɛhene yeɛ waayɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ ye nwo hia paa ne.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Ebiala bɔ okofĩ sɔ nyɔboɛ naso ne, okobubu pasaa; ná sɛ nyɔboɛ ne tɔ ebie so a, okotĩ ye muhu-muhu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Atwerɛfoɛ ne sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ nwuni ye kyɛ, bɛ ti ala yeɛ Yesu yɛle sɔ mvandoho ne, yeti né bɛpena kyɛ bɛkye ye berɛ ala, nakoso né bɛsuro mmenia ne. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Yeti né bɛtetɛ ye. Na ye si ne, bɛbɔle mmenia biemɔ paa kyɛ, bɛyɛ bɛ nwo kyɛ bɛte mmeni pa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔha edwirɛ bie maa bekonya ye, ná bafa ye bahɔ awaen ne atumvoɛ nemɔ nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, yɛse kyɛ wɔ dwirɛ ne wɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ te nahorɛ; ɛnnea sona nyunu, na bɔ ɛka fa Nyameɛ nwo ne koso te nahorɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Mmeraa ma atee kyɛ yetua toɔ yɛma Kaesare, anaa ɔmma ate?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Nakoso onwuni adwene bɔ otira bɛ ne, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Ɛmɔma me sikaa ne bie. Nwa foto ne ye sa noa yeɛ ɔwɔ so ne?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Kaesare.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ye de ɛmɔtua Kaesare deɛ bɛma Kaesare, na ɛmɔtua Nyameɛ deɛ bɛma Nyameɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Yeti, bangora bamma wanga edwirɛ tɛɛ biala wɔ mmenia ne nyunu. Mmon ye ngyerɛkyerɛ ne maa bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ, na bɛyɛle konn.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Yesi ne, Sadukifoɛ nanu bie wale ye berɛ, bɛ yeɛ ne bɛnwa ewue tingyele biala nne berɛ ne. Na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, Mose hworɔ mane yɛ kyɛ, sɛ brienzua bie wu yakyi ɔye, ná olle ba a, odikyɛ oliema brienzua gya ɔye ne, na ɔwo mmaa ma ye. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Né yɛne mmrienzua nzoo bie wɔ wa; bɔ oli moa ne gyale braa, nakoso ɔne ye anwo yeɛ owuli ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne koso, sɔ ala; <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />yeɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne koso gyale ye. Aliemaa nzoo namukoraati gyale, nakoso ebiala ne ye anwo mmaa, yeɛ owuli ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Awieɛ koraa ne, maame ne koso wuli. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Yeti, sɛ bɛtingye bɛ a, brasua ne kɔyɛ nwa aye? Ofikyɛ mmenia nzoo namukoraati gyale ye.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ ne de, bɛgya, na bɛfa mmrasua bɛma agyaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛnwu bɛ kyɛ bɛfata kyɛ bɛtena ewiase bɔ ɔba nanu, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛkotingye bɛ bɛkofi ewue nu ne de, bɛngogya, bɛngɔfa bɛ bɛngɔma agyaa, <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />na bɛngonwu kõ, ofikyɛ bɛkɔyɛ kyɛ abɔfo. Bɛte Nyameɛ mmaa, ofikyɛ bɛkotingye bɛ bɛkofi ewue nu. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mose po maa yɛnwuni ye wɔ ndire bɔ né ɔsɔ nanwo dwirɛ nanu kyɛ, awufo kotingye; ofikyɛ ɛberɛ ne, ɔfrɛle Awurade kyɛ, Abraham Nyameɛ, Isaac Nyameɛ, yeɛ Yakob Nyameɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ɔtte awufo Nyameɛ, mmom ɔte ateasefoɛ Nyameɛ; ofikyɛ ye nye so de, bɛ mu bɛte ase.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Yeɛ Sadukifoɛ nanu bie hane kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, bɔ aha ne te nahorɛ kaenn.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ofi sɔ mmerɛ ne, bɛ nu biala ammɔ ye nwo mmusue ammisa ye dwirɛ kõ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yeɛ Yesu bisale mmenia ne kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ bɛka kyɛ, Kristo né te David awa ɔ? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ofikyɛ David bɔbɔ hane ye wɔ Edwein nwomaa nanu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Awurade ha hyirele me wura kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">tena me sa famaa so<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />kodwu kyɛ, ngɔfa w'atamfo ngogua wɔ gya bo.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />David frɛ ye me wura, ye de, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne wayɛ ɔwa?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Mmenia namukoraati gu so betie ne, ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo ye wɔ atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ nwo. Bɔ bɛkuro yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛkowura ndadeɛ ndee–ndee bɛkohini, na balɛ́ dwaaso ngyeaa. Sɛ bɛkɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu a, bɛpena bia pa, na sɛ bɛkɔ paati bo a, bɛpena nekaa bɔ odi mu bɛtena. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Nakoso bɛsisi kunaniɛ bedɛ ye nwo nningyein, na nyaatwom ti, bɛbɔ mbaeɛ tendebaa. Asotwe bɔ ɔkɔwa bɛ so ne, ɔkɔtra ebiala deɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu tole ye nye ne, onwuni kyɛ asikafoɛ ne fa b'akyɛdeɛ gua sikaa alaka nanu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Afei onwuni brasua kunaniɛ hianiɛ bie, né ɔfa ngaprɛ nyɔ bɔ ɔtte sikaa biala gua alaka nanu. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɔ kunaniɛ hianiɛ he afa agua nu ne, ɔsone tra bɛ mukoraati bɛ deɛ ne; <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />ofikyɛ bɛ de, bɔ banya ye maa wabo so ne bie yeɛ bafa bagua nu ɔ, nakoso ye de, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ wahia ye buburoo ne, bɔ ole ye namukoraati yeɛ wafa waagua alaka nanu ne.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Ye si ne, ne ebiemɔ ka asɔre awuro nanwo dwirɛ, né bɛka kyɛbɔ bɛfale nyɔboɛ pa ne nningyein bɔ bahyira so bɛsili nanwo dwirɛ. Nakoso ɔhane kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, nningyein bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye wa ne, mmerɛ bie kɔwa bɔ bɛngɔyakyi nyɔboɛ komapɛ po wɔ nyɔboɛ so, bɛkɔdwiri ye mukoraati bɛkogua.” <verse eid="LUK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, mmerɛ beni yeɛ ɛhe kosi ɔ, na nzɛngyerɛneɛ beni yeɛ ɔkɔmaa yekonwu kyɛ sɔ nikye ne baasi ɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea yé na ebiala anlaka-laka ɛmɔ; ofikyɛ mmeni pee kɔfa me dumaa kɔwa kɔɔha kyɛ: ‘Me yeɛ nne ye,’ na ‘Mmerɛ ne aso ayie!’ Nakoso nnɛmɔ di bɛ si. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Afei sɛ ɛmɔte koɛ ne basabasa nwo dwirɛ a, nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ kunu tete ɛmɔ; ofikyɛ odikyɛ nningyein hemɔ sisi, nakoso nná ɛberɛ ala yeɛ awieɛ ne kɔwa ɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yeɛ osa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Maen ne maen kɔhõ, na ahennie ne ahennie kɔhõ. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Afei aseɛ wosolɛ mbiri-mbiri, ɛhɔen ne anwonyerɛ suronyi-suronyi bɔ osa kɔwa nekaa ahoroɛ; na nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ suro ne nzɛngyerɛneɛ mbiri-mbiri kofi anwuro kɔwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Nakoso kora bɔ ɛhemɔ kosisi ne, bɛkɔhye ɛmɔ, ná batane ɛmɔ nye; ná bɛkɔhwe ɛmɔ bɛkɔhɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na bafa ɛmɔ bagua prizin. Na me dumaa bɔ ɔla ɛmɔ so nati, bɛkɔfa ɛmɔ bɛkɔhɔ ahemvo ne atumvoɛ nyunu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ɛhe kɔmaa ɛmɔ koli bɛ adanzeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ɛmɔma ɛhe la ɛmɔ tianu, nnɛmɔ di moa bɛdwene edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔ kɔfa bɛkɔye ɛmɔ noa nanwo, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />ofikyɛ edwirɛ ne nyanza bɔ ngɔfa ngɔma ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔ atamfo nemɔ ngɔhora ye noa gyina, na bɛngɔhora ye bɔ gua. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Ɛmɔ awofo, ɛmɔ aliema mɔ, ɛmɔ abusuafoɛ ne ɛmɔ nnamvo mɔ po kɔye ɛmɔ kɔma, na bɛkɔhu ɛmɔ nu biemɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Me dumaa ti, mmenia mukoraati kɔtane ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Nakoso ɛmɔ ti nwiaa komapɛ po ngomini. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Sɛ ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye begyina nu a, ɛmɔ konya ngoa.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Sɛ ɛmɔnwu kyɛ sogyafoɛ apɛ Yerusalem kuro nanwo ayia a, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, waha kaa bie maa basɛkye ye. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ɔba sɔ a, bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Yudea ne, odikyɛ bɛnwati bɛkɔ mmokaa so, bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ kuro nanu ne, odikyɛ bɛnwati bɛfi nu, na bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ nguraa nemɔ nu ne, nnɛmaa bɛba kuro nanu; <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />ofikyɛ ɛhe yeɛ ole mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kɔfa kɔhwe mmenia so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɔ bahworɔ ne kɔwa nu ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, mmrasua bɔ bɛnwonzɛ, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛma ngwalaa nyɔfone ne de, bɛ yaakɔ! Ofikyɛ ahohiehia kandinga paa kɔwa aseɛ naso, na Nyameɛ kɔfɛ mmenia so yaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bɛkɔfa dadeɛ bɛkɔhu bɛ, na bɛkɔfa bɛ nnɔmun bɛkɔhɔ maen mukoraati so, na maen-maen ne kotietia Yerusalem so tonn koodwu kyɛ maen-maen ne mmerɛ ne koso.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Na nzɛngyerɛneɛ kɔwa eyia, ɛsraen, ne nzramaa mɔ so; na kyɛbɔ ɛpo ne kohu na okobu kɔfa so nati, ahunu–ndetelɛ kɔto maen-maen nemɔ so, na bɛngonwu bɔ bɛyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Na esuronyi ne nningyein bɔ ɔbaasisi wiase nati, mmenia nye so koburu bɛ, ofikyɛ bɛkɔwoso anwuro tumi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Na ɛberɛ yeɛ bekonwu kyɛ Sona Awa ne nate munungum nu ɔba, bɔ ole tumi ne anuonyam kandinga. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Sɛ sɔ nningyein ne hyɛ yebo kyɛ osisi a, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nu so, na ɛmɔma ɛmɔ ti so, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ bekole ɛmɔ ne apingye.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yeɛ ɔyɛle mvandoho hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea borɔdoma ne mmakaa bɔ waha ne. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Sɛ onya fa nyaa a, ɛmɔse kyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ ne ahuhuro awa. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ ɛhemɔ ahyɛ yebo osisi a, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, waha kaa ne Nyameɛ Ahennie ne awa. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ ne nngɔpɛ nu, sana ɛhe amukoraati awa nu kora. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Anwuro ne aseɛ kɔpɛ nu, nakoso me dwirɛ ne de, ɔngɔpɛ nu lle.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Nakoso ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé, na adufum, nzãa nonɛ pembe, ne asetena nu dadwene anni ɛmɔ ti lle, na sɔ kyẽa ne amvu ɛmɔ nu te kyɛ ngaen. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Ofikyɛ ɔkɔwa bɛ bɔ bɛtete aseɛ naso namukoraati so. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Yeti daa biala, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ konya anwoserɛ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔnwati bɔ ɔbaasisi namukoraati, na ɛmɔ ahora bagyina Sona Awa ne nyunu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Na daa biala, né ɔyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, na aleɛ sa a, ne ɔkɔ bokaa bɔ bɛfrɛ Olive naso kɔda dɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu ne, né mmenia namukoraati ba asɔre awuro berɛ, kyɛ bɛbaatie ye.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Né waha kaa maa bɛdi Paanoo bɔ Yiste Nne Nu afahyɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Pɛnu ne. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Na ne sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ pena atee pa bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛkɔhu Yesu, ofikyɛ ne bɛsuro mmenia ne.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Na Satan wurale Yuda, bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Iskariot bɔ ɔboka buru-ne-nyɔ naso nanu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ɔhɔle sɔfo mbanyi ne polisifoɛ bɔ bɛnea asɔre awuro berɛ ne dɔ, na ɔne bɛ hane atee bɔ ɔkɔfa so kɔye Yesu kɔma bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Bɛ nye gyele paa, na bɛhane kyɛ, bɛkɔma ye sikaa. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ole tole nu, na ɔhyɛle yebo penane atee pa bɔ ɔkɔfa so kɔye ye kɔma bɛ, mmerɛ bɔ mmenia nne berɛ ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Kyẽa bɔ bɛdi Paanoo bɔ Yiste Nne Nu afahyɛ ne dwuli so, sɔ kyẽa ne yeɛ né bɛfa Pɛnu boan ne bɛbɔ afɔleɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yeti, Yesu somane Petro ne Yohane, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ bɛɛsiesie Pɛnu ne ma yɛɛli.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Nisɔa yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ yɛkosiesie Pɛnu ne?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔwura kuro nanu a, ɛmɔ koyia biaa bie, ɔsõ bua bɔ nzu wɔ nu. Ɛmɔli ye si bɛhɔ awuro bɔ okowura nu nanu, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />na ɛmɔha behyire efiewura ne kyɛ, ‘Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne nwa yɛbisa wɔ kyɛ: “Ɛwɔfoɛ sua bɔ mene m'asuafoɛ ne koli Pɛnu ne wɔ nu ne, ɔwɔ nisua?” ’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Na okohyire ɛmɔ aborosaen sua kandinga bie bɔ basiesie nu kama, ɛmɔsiesie Pɛnu ne wɔ berɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bɛhɔle ne, bɛnwuni ye kyɛbɔ ɔhane ne pɛpɛɛpɛ, yeti bɛsiesiele Pɛnu ne.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Mmerɛ ne sone ne, Yesu ne asomafoɛ nemɔ tenane tɛbulu nwo kyɛ bɛdidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ ɔla me ahone so paa yeɛ ole kyɛ, mene ɛmɔ koli Pɛnu he kora ne manwu amaneɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ofikyɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, mengoli kõ, sana wawa nu wɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Yeɛ ɔfale kwangoa, na ɔlale ase yiele ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔle ɛhe, na ɛmɔma ebiala no bie. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Na meka mekyire kyɛ, ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, mengɔno bobe nzãa kõ kodwu kyɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne kɔwa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Afei ɔfale paanoo, na ɔlale ase yiele ne, obuli nu, yeɛ ɔfa mane bɛ hane kyɛ: “Ɛhe gyi berɛ ma me nipadua bɔ ɛmɔ ti bɛfa bɛma ne. Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛyɛ ɛhe bɛfa bɛkaye me.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Na bɛlili nnɔsoa aleɛ ne beyiele ne, ɔyɛle kwangoa ne koso sɔ; ɔhane kyɛ: “Sɔ kwangoa he gyi berɛ ma apam foforɛ bɔ bɛfa me mogya bɛyɛ ne, bɔ ɛmɔ ti bɛkɔhwie bɛkogua ne.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Nakoso ɛmɔse, bɔ ɔkɔye me kɔma ne, ɔte tɛbulu he anwo bie. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, Sona Awa ne kowu kyɛbɔ bahyɛ bato berɛ ne, nakoso sona bɔ ɔkɔye ye kɔma ne, ye yaakɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Né bɛpena kyɛ bɛnwu sona-horɛ bɔ ɔkɔyɛ sɔ nikye ne, yeti bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛbisa bɛ nwo ngoko-ngoko.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Afei asuafoɛ nemɔ suli aporowaa paa, né ɔfa sona bɔ ɔte piri wɔ bɛ nu nanwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ahemvo bɔ bɛwɔ maen-maen nanu ne de, bɛdi bɛ mmenia nemɔ so bakoma, na bɛ bɔ bɛdi tumi ne, bɛka kyɛ bɛte mmeni pa. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Nakoso nná sɔ yeɛ odikyɛ ɔkɔso wɔ ɛmɔ nu ɔ. Mmom bɔ ɔte piri wɔ ɛmɔ nu ne, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ ye nwo akwalaa, ná bɔ oli anyunu ne yɛ ye nwo somvoɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ma mmisa ɛmɔ, sona bɔ ɔte tɛbulu nwo odidi, ɔne bɔ ɔsõ ne, nwa yeɛ ɔte piri ɔ? Nná bɔ odidi ne? Nakoso me de, nwɔ ɛmɔ nu kyɛ mesõ ɛmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ abata me nwo wɔ me nzɔhwɛ nu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />yeti mene ɛmɔ yɛ ahennie nwo apam, kyɛbɔ me Baba ne me ayɛ ahennie nwo apam ne, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ná ɛmɔ ne me atena tɛbulu nwo badidi bano wɔ m'ahennie nu, na ɛmɔ atena ahemvo bia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ “Ɔhene bia” anaa “Ahennie bia.”</char></note> so babu Israel mmusuakue 12 ne atɛn.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simon, Simon, nea, Satan pena kyɛ ohu ɛmɔ so te kyɛ hwiit. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Nakoso mabɔ mbaeɛ mama ɛmɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ gyidie ngɔyɛ mmerɛ; esa ba ala pɛ, hyɛ eliema nemɔ nguraen.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Yeɛ Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, mayɛ krado kyɛ mene wɔ kɔhɔ prizin, na ewue po mene wɔ kowu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Petro, meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, kyɛ dee bɔ akɔ bɔ ne, ne aha ye pɛn nza kyɛ ɛnze me.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yeɛ osa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mesoma ɛmɔ, bɔ ngane kyɛ nnɛmɔfa sikaa bɔtɔ, aleɛ bɔtɔ anaa mmaboa ne, ɛmɔ nwo hyerele ɛmɔ hɔ?” Bɛyele yenoa kyɛ: “Daabi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nakoso kesaalae de, bɔ ole sikaa bɔtɔ ne, ma ɔfa na bɔ ole aleɛ bɔtɔ ne koso, ma ɔfa. Na bɔ olle dadeɛ ne, ɔtɔne ye atadeɛ na ɔfa tɔ bie. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Na bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, odikyɛ sɔ tworɔnzɛm he ba nu wɔ me so kyɛ: ‘Bɛfale ye bɛ bokale mmeratofoɛ.’ Ofikyɛ bɔ bahworɔ bafa me nwo ne, ɔba nu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, nea, dadeɛ nyɔ ɛhe.” Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛhene ala te pa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Kyɛbɔ ne Yesu taa yɛ ne, ofili berɛ hɔle Olive Bokaa naso, na asuafoɛ nemɔ ne ye hɔle. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Odwuli berɛ ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ bɔ mbaeɛ, na ɛmɔ angɔ nzɔhwɛ nu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Na ofili bɛ nwo berɛ hɔle dede kaa, yeɛ obuli ndwerɛ bɔle mbaeɛ <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />kyɛ: “Baba, sɛ ekuro a, ye kwangoa he fi me so. Nakoso nná bɔ mekuro yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ, bɔ ekuro mmom yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Na abɔfo fili anwuro wale, na ɔhyɛle ye nguraen. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ná ye nwo bɔ ne ɔteetee ye nati, ɔyerele ye nwo bɔle mbaeɛ paa; na ye nwo mvifire yɛle kyɛ mogya bɔ ɔpepe ne.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Na ɔbɔle mbaeɛ ne yiele ne, ɔhɔle nekaa bɔ asuafoɛ ne wɔ ne, odwuli berɛ ne, né bala, ofikyɛ aworaborɛ ti, né bafɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔda ne? Ɛmɔ dwɔso bɛbɔ mbaeɛ, na ɛmɔ angɔ nzɔhwɛ nu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ogu so odwudwo ne, bɛkwaanea a, mmeni lɔen bie ɛhe, na Yuda bɔ né ɔboka buru-ne-nyɔ naso ne, yeɛ né oli bɛ nyunu ɔ. Ɔwale Yesu nwo berɛ, na ɔfele ye noa nwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yeɛ Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Yuda, yeti bɔ ɛfa ye Sona Awa ne ma yeɛ ole kyɛ ɛkɔfe ye noa?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Asuafoɛ bɔ ne bɛne Yesu wɔ berɛ ne nwuni bɔ ɔbobɔ ba ne, bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, yɛfa dadeɛ ne yɛhɔ bɛ so anaa?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na bɛ nu kõ fale dadeɛ pɛle sɔfo panyi ne akoaa ne so famaa fili berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Nakoso Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛhe ala te pa!” Na ɔfale ye sa hane ye so ne maa ye nwo tɔle ye. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Afei Yesu ha hyirele sɔfo mbanyi, polisifoɛ bɔ bɛnea asɔre awuro berɛ, ɔne mbanyi bɔ bɛwale kyɛ bɛbaahye ye ne kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ afa dadeɛ ne mmo-kuro-mma bawa me so te kyɛ ɛmɔ baahye awieniɛ bie ne? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mmerɛ bɔ ne mene ɛmɔ wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ eyia ne kɔngɔen ne, ɛmɔ angye me. Nakoso ɛmɔ mmerɛ ɛhe, ɔte mmerɛ bɔ awosii di tumi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Afei bɛhyele ye, na bɛfale ye bɛwale sɔfo panyi né awuro, na Petro lili bɛ si, nakoso ne ɔwɔ dede. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bɛsɔle see wɔ awuro ne aluo berɛ bɛtenane ye nwo, na Petro tenane bɛ nwo berɛ bie. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Na abaawa bie nwuni kyɛ ɔte see nanwo berɛ ne, ɔneane ye haa hane kyɛ, “Akoaa he koso, né ɔboka ye so.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Nakoso ɔsale kyɛ, “Maame, menze ye!” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ɔyɛle kaa ne, sona foforɛ nwuni ye, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Wɔ koso, né ɛboka bɛ so.” Nakoso Petro hane kyɛ: “Baba, mmmoka bɛ so.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kɔyɛ dɔnhwere kõ si ne, sona foforɛ sa sili so kyɛ: “Amba, ne sɔ akoaa he boka ye so, na ye koso ɔte Galileaniɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Nakoso Petro hane kyɛ: “Baba, bɔ ɛka ne, menze ye nwo hwee.” Na ogu so odwudwo ne, akɔ bɔle. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Na Awurade pɛle ye nye neane Petro. Na Petro kayele edwirɛ bɔ Awurade ha hyirele ye ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛnɛ, kora bɔ akɔ kɔbɔ ne, né aha ye pɛn nza kyɛ ɛnze me.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Na ofitele oosuni paa.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛnea Yesu so ne hyɛle yebo gorole ye nwo, na bɛbole ye. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Afei bɛfale nikye bɛkatale ye ti, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Hyɛ ngɔm! Nwa yeɛ ɔbɔle wɔ ne?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Na bɛkekane mmusue dwirɛ pee betiale ye.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Aleɛ hene ne, maen nanu mbanyi ne, sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ namukoraati yiale nu, na bɛfale Yesu bɛhɔle Sanhendrin ne nyunu, yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />“Sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne a, ka kyire yɛ.” Nakoso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ po a, ɛmɔ ngole ngoli, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />na sɛ me bisa ɛmɔ dwirɛ a, ɛmɔ ngɔye me noa. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Nakoso ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, Sona Awa ne kɔtena Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ ne sa famaa so.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ɛhe ati, bɛ mukoraati bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Ye de, nnaa wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ Awa ne?” Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ye ala yeɛ ɛmɔ aha ne.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Yɛpena adanzeɛ foforɛ yɛyɛ nzu? Edwirɛ ne mia ye bɔbɔ wapakye nu waha.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Na mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ namukoraati dwɔsole, na bɛfale ye bɛhɔle Pilato berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Yeɛ bɛhyɛle yebo bɛbɔle ye sommoɛ kyɛ: “Yanwu kyɛ sɔ biaa he tutu maen bo; ɔka kyire mmenia ne kyɛ nnɛmaa betua toɔ bɛma Kaesare; afei koso, yenwa ye yeɛ ole ɔhene<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoh 18:36</char></note> Kristo ne.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Yeɛ Pilato bisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ele Yudafoɛ hene ne?” Na ɔyele ye noa kyɛ: “Ye ala yeɛ aha ne.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Yeɛ Pilato ha hyirele sɔfo mbanyi ne né mmenia ne kyɛ: “Mennwu mvomsoɛ biala wɔ biaa he anwo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Nakoso bɛhane ye kitii kyɛ: “Ɔnate ye ngyerɛkyerɛ naso amaa mmenia ate atua wɔ Yudea mukoraati, ɔhyɛle yebo wɔ Galilea, na wafa wawa ɛwa koso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato tele ɛhe ne, né ɔpena kyɛ onwu kyɛ biaa ne te Galileaniɛ a. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Onwuni kyɛ sãa ofi nekaa bɔ Herode di tumi ne, yeti ɔmaa bɛfale ye bɛɛmane Herode, sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɔwɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herode nwuni Yesu ne, ye nye gyele paa. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ne watete ye nwo dwirɛ pee, ɛhene ati ne ɔpena kyɛ onwu ye, na ne ye nye la so kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bie maa okonwu ye. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Yeti obisale ye dwirɛ pee, nakoso Yesu amma ye mmuayɛ biala. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Né sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ wɔ berɛ, na ne bɛ nye aboro bɛbɔ ye sommoɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Na Herode ne ye sogyafoɛ nemɔ guale ye nyunu ase, na bɛgorole ye nwo. Beyiele ne, bɛfale atadeɛ kama-kama bie bɛwurale ye, yeɛ ɔmaa besa bɛfale ye bɛɛmane Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Sɔ kyẽa nala, Herode ne Pilato fale adamvoa; daa ne de, né bɛnga.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato frɛle sɔfo mbanyi ne, kuro nanu mbanyi ne mmenia namukoraati, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ fale biaa he bɛwale ne, ɛmɔnwa ɔmaa mmenia te atua. Na ɛmɔtie, ɛmɔ nyunu wala yeɛ nneɛneane ye dwirɛ nu ɔ, nakoso kwaadu bɔ ɛmɔ afa babɔ ye ne, komapɛ po nne berɛ bɔ odi ye nwo fɔ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Herode koso annwu mvomsoɛ biala wɔ ye nwo, yeti wasa wafa ye wabrɛ yɛ. Ɛmɔtie, ɔyɛlle nikye biala bɔ odikyɛ bɛku ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Yeti ngɔhwe ye so, na mayakyi ye.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="bd">Bɛdi afahyɛ biala a, né ole ye nwo atee kyɛ ɔyakyi sona kõ.</char> Nakoso sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu a, sɔ dwirɛ ne nne nu. </note>—<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Nakoso bɛ mukoraati bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Ku sɔ biaa he, na yakyi Barabas ma yɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Ne sɔ Barabas ne la prizin, ofikyɛ ne waboka maa mmenia ate atua atia awaen ne, afei koso né ɔte wudiniɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato sa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ ɔpena kyɛ ɔyakyi Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />nakoso bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu! Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ pɛn nza so kyɛ: “Nzu ɔ? Bɔne beni yeɛ wayɛ ɔ? Me de mennwu nikye biala wɔ ye nwo bɔ odikyɛ meku ye ɔ. Yeti ngɔhwe ye so, na mayakyi ye.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Nakoso né bɛ nye aboro, na ne bɛteɛtea nu kyɛ ɔbɔ ye asɛnnua nu. Afei de, né bɛ dede ne abo ye so. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Yeti Pilato le tole nu kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ bɔ bɛpena ne kɔma bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Ɛhene ati, biaa bɔ ne wate atua watia awaen, na wasa wahu ebie ne, ɔyakyile ye mane bɛ, ofikyɛ ɛhene yeɛ ne bɛpena ɔ, na Yesu de, ɔfale ye mane bɛ kyɛ bɛhu ye.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Yeti bɛfale Yesu bɛhɔle, bɛnate atee so ne, bɛnwuni Simon bɔ ofi Kiren ne kyɛ ɔba Yerusalem, na bɛhyɛle ye kyɛ ɔsoa asɛnnua ne li Yesu si. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Né mmeni pee li ye si, na né mmrasua bɔ bɛpɛ awuye na bɛsu bɛma ye boka so. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Nakoso Yesu kakyile ye nwo ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Yerusalem mmrasua, nnɛmɔ su bɛma me, mmom ɛmɔsu bɛma ɛmɔ nwo ne ɛmɔ mmaa mɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bie ba, na mmenia kɔha kyɛ, ‘Anigye yeɛ ole bonini, ne koɛ bɔ wanwo lle, ne nyɔfone bɔ banno ye noa lle ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Na bɛkɔha bɛkohyire mmokaa nemɔ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔ dwiri bɛgua yɛ so’, na baha bahyire esire nemɔ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔ kata yɛ so.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Bakaa ne te monɛ ne po yeɛ bɛyɛ ɛhe ne, ye de sɛ owu a, nzu yeɛ bɛkɔyɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Bɛkwaabɔ Yesu asɛnnua nu ne, bɛfale mmrienzua nyɔ bɛbokale ye so. Né sɔ mmrienzua ne te abɔnefoɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Bɛdwuli nekaa bɔ bɛfrɛ berɛ Tire Kokuroka ne, bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu, na bɛbɔle abɔnefoɛ nyɔ ne koso asɛnnua nu, né kõ wɔ ye famaa, yeɛ né kõ wɔ ye bɛen. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Daa, fa kyɛ bɛ, ofikyɛ bɛnze bɔ bɛyɛ ɔ.” Afei bɛtɔɔsole <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛbɔle ndondo.”</char></note> bɛhyɛle ye atadeɛ nanu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Na mmenia nemɔ gyinane berɛ neane ye, nakoso mbanyi nemɔ gorole ye nwo kyɛ: “Né odɛ́ amanvoɛ, sɛ yeɛ ole Kristo bɔ Nyameɛ aye ye ne a, maa ole ye nwo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Sogyafoɛ nemɔ koso gorole ye nwo; na bɛwale ye nwo berɛ bɛɛfale nzãa bɔ enu ka po bɛmane ye, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Yudafoɛ hene ne a, de wɔ nwo!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Né basa bahworɔ edwirɛ bie bagua ye tiafia berɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="LUK 23:38">ƐHE YEƐ OLE YUDAFOƐ HENE NE.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Abɔnefoɛ bɔ babɔ bɛ asɛnnua nu ne, bɛ nu kõ hyɛle yebo bɔle ye alapaa kyɛ: “Nná wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne? De wɔ nwo na de yɛ ee!” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Nakoso kõ ne hwili ye nyunu kyɛ: “Sãa ɛnzuro Nyameɛ? Atemmuo bɔ bafa bama ye ne, ɛnwu ye kyɛ ebiala yeɛ bafa bama yɛ ne? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Yɛ deɛ ne de, yala ne, ofikyɛ bɔ yɛyɛle nanwo asotwe yeɛ bafa bama yɛ ne. Nakoso ye de, ɔyɛlle bɔne biala.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Yesu, sɛ ɛba w'Ahennie nu a, ɛyɛ a kaye me.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu koso ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire wɔ ɛnɛ ole kyɛ, ɛkɔboka me so wɔ paradise.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Né wabɔ kɔyɛ eyia 12:00,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">12:00 ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia.</char></note> na aseɛ naso mukoraati yɛle tumm tonn maa ɔbɔle eyia 3:00,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">3:00 ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so ngona.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ofikyɛ eyia ne nuane. Na <char style="w" lemma="Kɛtens ">kɛtens</char> bɔ ɔsa asɔre awuro berɛ nanu ne tele nyɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yeɛ Yesu teane nu kyɛ: “Daa, wɔ sa nu yeɛ mefa me honhom mewura ɔ!” Ɔhane sɔ ne ala pɛ, ɔyakyile nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Sogyaniɛ panyi ne nwuni bɔ wasi ne, ɔyele Nyameɛ ayɛ hane kyɛ: “Amba, sɔ biaa he te teneneeniɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Na mmerɛ bɔ mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ namukoraati nwuni bɔ wasi ne, besa bɛhɔle awuro, bɛkɔ namu, né bɛfa bɛ sa bɛbobɔ bɛ hue so. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛse ye namukoraati, ne mmrasua bɔ bɛne ye fili Galilea wale namukoraati gyinane dede, yeɛ ne bɛnea bɔ ɔkɔ so ɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Né biaa bie wɔ berɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yosef, né ɔboka badwa naso, na ne ɔte teneneeniɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Ye de, ne ɔmbene bɛ gyinayɛ ne bɛ nneyɛɛ naso. Né ofi Yudafoɛ kuro Arimatea nu, na ne onwondɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ɔhɔle Pilato berɛ ɔɔsrɛle Yesu fuin ne. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Yeti ɔyele fuin ne fili asɛnnua naso, na ɔfale nwera kyekyele ye nwo, yeɛ ɔfale ye tole asieleɛ bɔ bapɛ ye wɔ nyɔboɛ nu; sɔ asieleɛ ne, ne bɛfalle ebiala bɛtolle nu lle. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Né sɔ kyẽa ne te Anwoboaboa Kyẽa, na ne waha kaa maa Homeda ne hyɛ yebo. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Mmrasua bɔ bɛne Yesu fili Galilea wale ne lili Yosef si, bɛnwuni asieleɛ ne, na bɛnwuni kyɛbɔ bɛfale ye fuin ne bɛtole nu ne. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Besa bɛhɔle bɛɛyɛle ayire ne sakyeɛ bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔpopa fuin ne. Homeda ne, bɛlɛle bɛ nwomeɛ, kyɛbɔ mmeraa ne kyire ne.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Dapɛn nanu kyẽa bɔ oli moa ne, bɛwale asieleɛ naso berɛ ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu, bɛba ne, bɛfale sakyeɛ bɔ bɛyɛle ne bɛwale. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Na bɛnwuni kyɛ baye nyɔboɛ ne bafi asieleɛ ne noa, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />yeti bɛwurale nu, nakoso bannwu Awurade Yesu fuin ne. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Bɛguso bɛdwene ɛhe anwo ne, bɛkwaanea a, mmrienzua nyɔ bɔ bɛwura ndadeɛ fufue hyɛnn bie gyi bɛ nwo berɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Né mmrasua nemɔ suro paa, yeti bɛsili bɛ ti ase, yeɛ mmrienzua ne bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔpena teasefoɛ wɔ awufo nu ne? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ɔnne wa oo, batingye ye, nnaa ɛmɔkaye edwirɛ bɔ ɔha hyirele ɛmɔ wɔ Galilea ne? <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Bɛkɔfa Sona Awa ne bɛkɔma abɔnefoɛ maa bɛkɔbɔ ye asɛnnua nu, na ye ɛlɛsa naso ne, okotingye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ɛberɛ ala yeɛ bɛkayele ye dwirɛ ne ɔ, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />na bɛfili asieleɛ naso bɛhɔle, yeɛ bɛhane ɛhe amukoraati behyirele buru-ne-kõ ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛne bɛ wɔ berɛ ne. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Sɔ mmrasua nemɔ yeɛ ole Mary Magdalene, Joana, yeɛ Yakobo maame Mary. Bɛne mmrasua bɔ baha ne hane ɛhe hyirele asomafoɛ nemɔ, <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />nakoso ne bɛnwu ye kyɛ nyanza biala nne bɔ bɛka nanu, na banne banni.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Nakoso Petro dwɔsole, na otuli mirika hɔle asieleɛ naso dɔ, ɔtole ye nye neane asieleɛ nanu ne, nwera ne ngome yeɛ onwuni ye ɔ. Yeti ofili berɛ hɔle, ɔkɔ namukoraati, né ɔdwene bɔ wasi nanwo.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Sɔ ɛlɛho nala, né asuafoɛ nanu nyɔ kɔ kuro bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Emaus nu, ofi Yerusalem bɔ ɔkɔ berɛ ne te kɔyɛ kwanzii nzoo. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Ná ne bɛbɔ edwirɛ bɔ wasisi nanwo ngɔmmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Bɛguso bɛbɔ ngɔmmɔ ne, Yesu bɔbɔ fitele berɛ, na ɔne bɛ nate hɔle. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Nakoso bannwu kyɛ ye ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Na edwirɛ beni yeɛ ɛmɔ nye aboro bɛbɔ ye nwo ngɔmmɔ wɔ atee naso ne?” Bɛgyinane, na ne bɛ wora abɔ paa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yeɛ bɛ nu kõ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kleopa mane ye mmuayɛ kyɛ, “Yeti wɔ ngome yeɛ ɛte ɛwɔfoɛ wɔ Yerusalem, bɔ yeti ɛnze edwirɛ bɔ wasi berɛ ɛlɛsaen ne?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Obisale bɛ kyɛ, “Nikye yeɛ wasi ɔ?” Yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Yesu bɔ ofi Nazerɛt nanwo dwirɛ yeɛ yɛka ne, né ɔte diifoɛ, na ne Nyameɛ ne sona biala nwu ye kyɛ tumi wɔ ye dwudwolɛ ne ye nneyɛɛ nu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Na yɛ sɔfo mbanyi ne kuro nanu mbanyi ne hyele ye buli ye kumfɔ, na bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Nakoso né yedɛ yɛdi kyɛ ye yeɛ ɔbaale Israel ɔ. Na ɛhemɔ mukoraati sili ne, ɛlɛsa ɛhe. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ɛhe la ahameɛ a, mmrasua bɔ bɛboka yɛ so ne bie amaa yɛ nwo adwiri yɛ; bɛhɔle asieleɛ naso ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />nakoso bannwu ye fuin ne. Na bɛɛbɔle yɛ amaneɛ kyɛ, abɔfo biemɔ aye bɛ nwo ali ahyire bɛ, na bɛnwa watingye. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bɛ bɔ yɛne bɛ wɔ berɛ ne bie hɔle asieleɛ naso, na bɔ mmrasua nemɔ hane ne, sɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ yeɛ bɛnwuni ye ɔ, nakoso ye de, bannwu ye.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ ndeaseɛ wɔ dede, na ɔyɛ se ma ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔkole bɔ adiifoɛ nemɔ hane ne bɛkoli. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Né ye nwo nhia kyɛ Kristo ne nwu sɔ amaneɛ hemɔ, na ɔkɔ y'anuonyam nu hɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Na ɔhyɛle yebo fili Mose ne adiifoɛ namukoraati so, na ye nwo dwirɛ bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ Tworɔnzɛm nanu ne, ohyirehyirele nu hyirele bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Né bapingye nekaa bɔ bɛkɔ ne, na ɔhyɛda yɛle ye nwo kyɛ ye de ɔtoa so. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Nakoso bɛsrɛle ye alaa kyɛ: “Tena yɛ nwo wa, nekaa bɔ eyia ne adwu ne de, aleɛ asa ayie.” Yeti ɔne bɛ hɔle awuro. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ɔne bɛ tenane tɛbulu nwo bɔ bɛdidi ne, ɔfale paanoo hyirale so, yeɛ obuli nu fa mane bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛ nye wale bɛ nwo so maa bɛnwuni sona-horɛ ɔ. Na otu minini. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Mmerɛ bɔ ɔne yɛ bɔ ngɔmmɔ wɔ atee naso, bɔ ne okyirekyire Tworɔnzɛm nanu kyire yɛ ne, yeti wambemo yɛ kaa ala?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Na ɛberɛ ala, bɛdwɔso bɛhɔle Yerusalem. Bɛdwuli berɛ ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ asuafoɛ buru-ne-kõ ne né bɛ bɔ baha ne ayia nu, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />na bɛguso bɛka kyɛ: “Amba, Awurade adwɔso, na waye ye nwo ali wahyire Simon.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Yeɛ bɛ koso bɛhane bɔ osili atee naso, ɔne kyɛbɔ paanoo bɔ obubuli nu ne maa bɛnwuni ye ne bɛhyirele bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Bɛguso bɛka ɛhemɔ nwo dwirɛ ne, Yesu bɔbɔ yele ye nwo ali hyirele bɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Asomdwie ha ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Na bɛbɔle birim, na esuronyi hane bɛ, na ne b'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ banwu honhom bie. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Na obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ kunu tete ɛmɔ ne? Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ adwene nu ayɛ ɛmɔ naa ne? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Ɛmɔnea me sa nu ne me gya ne, na ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ, me yeɛ ngyi wa ne. Ɛmɔsɔ me nu bɛnea; ofikyɛ honhom lle anwoɔnaen ne bowue, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ nne ye ne.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ɔhane ɛhe hyirele bɛ ne, ɔfale ye sa kunu ne ye gya ne hyirele bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Kyɛbɔ ne asuafoɛ nemɔ nye agye na bɛ nwo adwiri bɛ ne, né bɛnnwu kyɛ bɛle bɛli, na obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔle aleɛ wɔ wa?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bɛmane ye egyein bɔ batoto, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />na ole lili ye wɔ bɛ nyunu berɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɔ dwirɛ he yeɛ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ mmerɛ bɔ ne mene ɛmɔ wɔ berɛ ne. Ngane kyɛ bɔ bahworɔ bafa me nwo wɔ Mose Mmeraa ne, Adiifoɛ, ɔne Edwein nanu ne, odikyɛ ɔba nu.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Afei obukyele b'adwene nu maa bɛtele Tworɔnzɛm nabo, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛhe yeɛ bɛhworɔle ye kyɛ, odikyɛ Kristo ne nwu amaneɛ, na ye ɛlɛsa so otingye fi ewue nu ne, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />na bɛkogyina ye dumaa naso bɛkɔha bɛkohyire maen-maen ne kyɛ, bɛsakra b'adwene ma bɛfa bɛ bɔne bɛhyɛ bɛ, ɛhe kɔhyɛ yebo wɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Na ɛmɔte ɛhe anwo adanzefoɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Na bɔ me Baba hyɛle ye nwo bɔ ne, ngɔsoma ye maa ɔkɔwa ɛmɔ so. Nakoso odikyɛ ɛmɔtena kuro nanu kodwu kyɛ bɛkɔfa tumi bɔ ofi anwuro ne bɛkɔma ɛmɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Na ɔne bɛ fili berɛ hɔle Betania, na ɔmane ye sa so hyirale bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ogu so ohyira bɛ ne, bɛmane ye so bɛhɔle anwuro. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Na bɛbɔle bɛ nu ase bɛkotole ye, yeɛ bɛfale anigye paa besa bɛwale Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Na daa biala né bɛye Nyameɛ ayɛ wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>